(698405, 74394, 19608, '<td valign="top">The beach area, water area and sky are very nice indeed.  But the out of focus areas on the bottom/left are major detractors.</td>', 'The beach area, water area and sky are very nice indeed.  But the out of focus areas on the bottom/left are major detractors.', '2004-05-05 02:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
