(698423, 73243, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, and I don''t mind you extending ''rusty'' to this end. I''m not sure the image itself communicates that your game is rusty, though. In fact, it looks like the ball is going in the net! That said, nice capture of the ball--I really like the ever so slight blur on it. I like the centered composition for this.</td>', 'I like this idea, and I don''t mind you extending ''rusty'' to this end. I''m not sure the image itself communicates that your game is rusty, though. In fact, it looks like the ball is going in the net! That said, nice capture of the ball--I really like the ever so slight blur on it. I like the centered composition for this.', '2004-05-05 02:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(698426, 74455, 6870, '<td valign="top">So nice. I just wish the rail were in focus, too. Lovely tones, colors and compostion.</td>', 'So nice. I just wish the rail were in focus, too. Lovely tones, colors and compostion.', '2004-05-05 02:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
