(698429, 73095, 19608, '<td valign="top">Aha - you post (a sister) of this image asking for advice... then use it in a challenge.  One of the comments was to set it off-center which you''ve done nicely here.  This composition is right on as is the exposure.</td>', 'Aha - you post (a sister) of this image asking for advice... then use it in a challenge.  One of the comments was to set it off-center which you''ve done nicely here.  This composition is right on as is the exposure.', '2004-05-05 02:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
