(698459, 73642, 19608, '<td valign="top">Simple yet effective.  Good handling of DOF.  The bight white on the lock is a tad of a detractor, but the reflection of what looks to be a flag is a plus.</td>', 'Simple yet effective.  Good handling of DOF.  The bight white on the lock is a tad of a detractor, but the reflection of what looks to be a flag is a plus.', '2004-05-05 02:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
