(698584, 74380, 18722, '<td valign="top">Good colors, but there is a spo ton the flower and on a couple of blades of grass that are too hot on my monitor.  The actual rusted object is almost too dark to tell it is rusted, and is a bit out of focus.  I can''t help but think a different angle with the flower contrasting against the rust would have helped the shot.</td>', 'Good colors, but there is a spo ton the flower and on a couple of blades of grass that are too hot on my monitor.  The actual rusted object is almost too dark to tell it is rusted, and is a bit out of focus.  I can''t help but think a different angle with the flower contrasting against the rust would have helped the shot.', '2004-05-05 03:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(698586, 73490, 7151, '<td valign="top">Hey hey, my my.  :)  Not sure about the composition.  But the rust is prominent, and the details are crisp.</td>', 'Hey hey, my my.  :)  Not sure about the composition.  But the rust is prominent, and the details are crisp.', '2004-05-05 03:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
