(698644, 74282, 772, '<td valign="top">This is excellent work.  It begs for questions, and I really like that in a photograph.  I wanna know more about what I see.  This is like a ''teaser'' that makes me want to explore this environment and know the people who inhabited it (past tense).  It feels uninhabited now, but there was life here at some point in time.  Death may play a strong role in this image as well.  Kudos on a great shot :)</td>', 'This is excellent work.  It begs for questions, and I really like that in a photograph.  I wanna know more about what I see.  This is like a ''teaser'' that makes me want to explore this environment and know the people who inhabited it (past tense).  It feels uninhabited now, but there was life here at some point in time.  Death may play a strong role in this image as well.  Kudos on a great shot :)', '2004-05-05 03:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
