(698692, 74428, 16230, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, my favorite drink. A little single malt scotch, a little Drambuie.. Yumm!<br/>A great idea for the challenge. I wish I would have thought of this myself. The photo seems to be missing something. Maybe a little more sparkle? The composition is cropped a bit too tight I think. It might have been better if the bottom of the glass were visible, and placing the glass to one side with something to offset it might help too. Not bad though. I think I''ll give it an 8.</td>', 'Ah yes, my favorite drink. A little single malt scotch, a little Drambuie.. Yumm!A great idea for the challenge. I wish I would have thought of this myself. The photo seems to be missing something. Maybe a little more sparkle? The composition is cropped a bit too tight I think. It might have been better if the bottom of the glass were visible, and placing the glass to one side with something to offset it might help too. Not bad though. I think I''ll give it an 8.', '2004-05-05 04:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
