(699195, 74496, 6008, '<td valign="top">Toning/color: You certainly got a good rust color to the shot, and I like the matching tone in the background although it seems to have a little bit of noise.<br/> <br/>Cropping/composition: The composition is straight forward but it''s good. The crop seems to center on the item(s) themselves without extra negative space, which is good.<br/> <br/>Subject: They look like items from a car, but I''m not sure, and that makes them somewhat interesting to me. I see them as a constructed work of art on display. Certainly meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>Technical: It doesnt have the sharp, clean look that a lot of studio set ups usually have. Some of the shadows work but there are others that seem to get in the way of the textures.<br/> <br/>Artistic: Rust texture, light and shadow, gradient background, almost abstract feel.<br/> <br/>Overal: It has potential but I think there are a few technical issues that stop it from being great - mostly the shadows, sharpness of image, and noise in the gradient background.</td>', 'Toning/color: You certainly got a good rust color to the shot, and I like the matching tone in the background although it seems to have a little bit of noise. Cropping/composition: The composition is straight forward but it''s good. The crop seems to center on the item(s) themselves without extra negative space, which is good. Subject: They look like items from a car, but I''m not sure, and that makes them somewhat interesting to me. I see them as a constructed work of art on display. Certainly meets the challenge. Technical: It doesnt have the sharp, clean look that a lot of studio set ups usually have. Some of the shadows work but there are others that seem to get in the way of the textures. Artistic: Rust texture, light and shadow, gradient background, almost abstract feel. Overal: It has potential but I think there are a few technical issues that stop it from being great - mostly the shadows, sharpness of image, and noise in the gradient background.', '2004-05-05 11:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(699196, 74509, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great focus.  -2 for no rust.  Total: 8</td>', 'Great focus.  -2 for no rust.  Total: 8', '2004-05-05 11:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(699199, 74276, 19311, '<td valign="top">would make a better silhouette picture than rusted but still a beatifull shot</td>', 'would make a better silhouette picture than rusted but still a beatifull shot', '2004-05-05 11:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(699200, 73095, 6130, '<td valign="top">I have seen this before but still a good picture.</td>', 'I have seen this before but still a good picture.', '2004-05-05 11:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(699201, 73536, 15530, '<td valign="top">This would have been a truly wonderful photograph if the focus had been clearer on the center wire.</td>', 'This would have been a truly wonderful photograph if the focus had been clearer on the center wire.', '2004-05-05 11:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(699202, 73526, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat find and the composition okay. The dof is a little shallow. I think the roof should of been crisp since its the main subject. Nice color range.</td>', 'Neat find and the composition okay. The dof is a little shallow. I think the roof should of been crisp since its the main subject. Nice color range.', '2004-05-05 11:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(699203, 74258, 15530, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2004-05-05 11:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(699204, 73217, 327, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool old bike. Your shot is oof but I do like the b&amp;w for this shot.</td>', 'That''s a cool old bike. Your shot is oof but I do like the b&w for this shot.', '2004-05-05 11:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(699207, 74310, 20027, '<td valign="top">great title. Get closer if possible, the detail is lost in the rubble.</td>', 'great title. Get closer if possible, the detail is lost in the rubble.', '2004-05-05 11:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(699209, 73644, 20214, '<td valign="top">Where''s the rust?</td>', 'Where''s the rust?', '2004-05-05 11:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(699211, 73376, 327, '<td valign="top">sry? Not sure what that is.</td>', 'sry? Not sure what that is.', '2004-05-05 11:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(699213, 74455, 6008, '<td valign="top">Toning/Color: It seems almost slightly desaturated with muted colors, and I think that works well for the mood of it.<br/> <br/>Composition/cropping: Excellent use of perspective and leading line.<br/> <br/>Subject: I like how the rusty rail introduces us to the rest of the scene. It''s a dominant subject and yet it doesnt steal the entire focus either. Certainly meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>Technical: I dont see anything technical here that I would change.<br/> <br/>Artistic: I have a feeling of duality when I see this. The lower two-thirds is rusted and dark and yet the top third is light and serene. There could very well be meaning in that.<br/> <br/>Overall: Well-executed, relaxing, pleasant mood, just a great image!</td>', 'Toning/Color: It seems almost slightly desaturated with muted colors, and I think that works well for the mood of it. Composition/cropping: Excellent use of perspective and leading line. Subject: I like how the rusty rail introduces us to the rest of the scene. It''s a dominant subject and yet it doesnt steal the entire focus either. Certainly meets the challenge. Technical: I dont see anything technical here that I would change. Artistic: I have a feeling of duality when I see this. The lower two-thirds is rusted and dark and yet the top third is light and serene. There could very well be meaning in that. Overall: Well-executed, relaxing, pleasant mood, just a great image!', '2004-05-05 11:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(699216, 74258, 327, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot. Love things like this. Neat looking sculpture. Maybe if you''d of just photographed one of the objects a little closer we could see more detail.</td>', 'What a fun shot. Love things like this. Neat looking sculpture. Maybe if you''d of just photographed one of the objects a little closer we could see more detail.', '2004-05-05 11:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(699219, 73536, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe not so centered and a bit more focus. :)</td>', 'Maybe not so centered and a bit more focus. :)', '2004-05-05 11:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(699220, 73840, 20214, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2004-05-05 11:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
