(699232, 74485, 13602, '<td valign="top">I don''t know I feel like the croping is too tight. I think a larger crop where the entire car is visibble being somewhat complementary colors with the sky, would have a really good effect.</td>', 'I don''t know I feel like the croping is too tight. I think a larger crop where the entire car is visibble being somewhat complementary colors with the sky, would have a really good effect.', '2004-05-05 11:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
