(699235, 73792, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty dark area for your shot. The levels could use some adjustment so that the white is white. Cool find but would of been better to show less of the top and a bit more of the bottom door frame.</td>', 'Pretty dark area for your shot. The levels could use some adjustment so that the white is white. Cool find but would of been better to show less of the top and a bit more of the bottom door frame.', '2004-05-05 12:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
