(699317, 74203, 18854, '<td valign="top">Love your title!</td>', 'Love your title!', '2004-05-05 12:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(699318, 74276, 18854, '<td valign="top">Your combination of the dog and fence on the left, and the sun on the right is just beautiful!  I see a winner here!<br/></td>', 'Your combination of the dog and fence on the left, and the sun on the right is just beautiful!  I see a winner here!', '2004-05-05 12:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(699319, 74209, 17148, '<td valign="top">why is this on a chess board?</td>', 'why is this on a chess board?', '2004-05-05 12:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(699322, 73746, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I like your title, it reminds me that old things can be preserved if we take sufficient interest in them. Good composition and lighting brings the eye to the object totally neglected.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I like your title, it reminds me that old things can be preserved if we take sufficient interest in them. Good composition and lighting brings the eye to the object totally neglected.', '2004-05-05 12:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(699324, 74354, 17148, '<td valign="top">Wow, very intriguing, like the shadows</td>', 'Wow, very intriguing, like the shadows', '2004-05-05 12:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(699327, 74342, 21202, '<td valign="top">Great choice of angle and lighting.  I am not too sure about 90 degree rotation from the angle at which I normally view a grill.  Unfortunately it does not inspire me to go throw some chicken on the barby.</td>', 'Great choice of angle and lighting.  I am not too sure about 90 degree rotation from the angle at which I normally view a grill.  Unfortunately it does not inspire me to go throw some chicken on the barby.', '2004-05-05 12:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(699334, 74495, 21202, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  the colors are interesting and the quality of the photo is more thatn adequate.  I just find it unfinished at the bottom and to the right.  It is as if I am only allowed to see through a peep hole and that I would have liked to see more.</td>', 'Good photo.  the colors are interesting and the quality of the photo is more thatn adequate.  I just find it unfinished at the bottom and to the right.  It is as if I am only allowed to see through a peep hole and that I would have liked to see more.', '2004-05-05 12:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(699335, 74291, 16907, '<td valign="top">IMO, should have been cropped out a bit more on the right side (right bottom corner spoils it) and less dof would have more impact. Still, one of my favourites, 8</td>', 'IMO, should have been cropped out a bit more on the right side (right bottom corner spoils it) and less dof would have more impact. Still, one of my favourites, 8', '2004-05-05 12:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(699340, 73514, 21202, '<td valign="top">I don''t knowwhy the right hand third of this picture is there.  It does not help me locate the subject.  I would have liked the camera positioned so that something of great interest dominates the foreground and becomes lost in perspective and focus.  The depth of field hurts as well.</td>', 'I don''t knowwhy the right hand third of this picture is there.  It does not help me locate the subject.  I would have liked the camera positioned so that something of great interest dominates the foreground and becomes lost in perspective and focus.  The depth of field hurts as well.', '2004-05-05 12:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(699342, 73167, 6624, '<td valign="top">What is that?  Nice macro and fits challenge for me</td>', 'What is that?  Nice macro and fits challenge for me', '2004-05-05 12:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(699344, 74357, 19216, '<td valign="top">Way to go buddy, good shot!</td>', 'Way to go buddy, good shot!', '2004-05-05 12:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(699345, 74475, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I would have liked to see this from an even lower angle to bring the butte above the horizon of the distant hills and a wider aperture.  The lighting and placement of the can is great.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I would have liked to see this from an even lower angle to bring the butte above the horizon of the distant hills and a wider aperture.  The lighting and placement of the can is great.', '2004-05-05 12:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(699351, 74297, 21202, '<td valign="top">Great title.  Less sunlight would have helped a lot as would a different camera angle.</td>', 'Great title.  Less sunlight would have helped a lot as would a different camera angle.', '2004-05-05 12:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(699352, 74113, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition.  An excellent poster for the need for recycling rather than retirement.  I actually find this an appealing shot even though it chronicles an environmental nightmare.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition.  An excellent poster for the need for recycling rather than retirement.  I actually find this an appealing shot even though it chronicles an environmental nightmare.', '2004-05-05 12:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(699353, 74275, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice to be reminded of the speed of rust by the use of decayed new tech. The smog helps make the point of where our priorities are.  Unfortunately there seems to be two pictures instead of one.  The building in the background is too incompletely represented to have a place in the photo.</td>', 'Nice to be reminded of the speed of rust by the use of decayed new tech. The smog helps make the point of where our priorities are.  Unfortunately there seems to be two pictures instead of one.  The building in the background is too incompletely represented to have a place in the photo.', '2004-05-05 13:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(699355, 74384, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice joke.  The fact that the word is so centered and viewed so straight on reminds me of buttons on a computer screen.</td>', 'Nice joke.  The fact that the word is so centered and viewed so straight on reminds me of buttons on a computer screen.', '2004-05-05 13:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(699359, 73613, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, nice subject.  Somehow it is quaint when old farm equipment is left to decay, not so nice when it is a car.  The foreground focus is great.  I like the positioning and lighting.  I would have liked the background to have been lost to circles of confusion with a wider open aperture.</td>', 'Nice photo, nice subject.  Somehow it is quaint when old farm equipment is left to decay, not so nice when it is a car.  The foreground focus is great.  I like the positioning and lighting.  I would have liked the background to have been lost to circles of confusion with a wider open aperture.', '2004-05-05 13:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(699360, 73528, 9089, '<td valign="top">The border because it is so close to the color in the picture, but yet cleaner, becomes stronger, thus detracting from the photo, a simple black would have been better</td>', 'The border because it is so close to the color in the picture, but yet cleaner, becomes stronger, thus detracting from the photo, a simple black would have been better', '2004-05-05 13:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
