(699415, 74357, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like the parallels of cylindrical shape.   Even the comparison of bright and dull is nice.   I think if you could have moved the camera to the left so as to allow the cylinder of the combine to be closer to the silo, several problems for the eye could be eliminated.  The vegetation is a visual distraction as is the lack of interest in the uniformly rusted combine.   Great sky.  Must be a really nice place to live.</td>', 'I like the parallels of cylindrical shape.   Even the comparison of bright and dull is nice.   I think if you could have moved the camera to the left so as to allow the cylinder of the combine to be closer to the silo, several problems for the eye could be eliminated.  The vegetation is a visual distraction as is the lack of interest in the uniformly rusted combine.   Great sky.  Must be a really nice place to live.', '2004-05-05 13:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(699416, 73753, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of perspective and subject.  The harsh lighting through the windshield detracts from the overall effect--perphaps a polarizing filter would improve this.</td>', 'Interesting choice of perspective and subject.  The harsh lighting through the windshield detracts from the overall effect--perphaps a polarizing filter would improve this.', '2004-05-05 13:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
