(699422, 73237, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting rusted gate.  The cropping could be improved--the right hand third of the photo conveys little of interest to me.  I understand the point of view was probably chosen to eliminate a distracting background but perhaps it also needs a more limited depth of field.  A little oversharped?</td>', 'Interesting rusted gate.  The cropping could be improved--the right hand third of the photo conveys little of interest to me.  I understand the point of view was probably chosen to eliminate a distracting background but perhaps it also needs a more limited depth of field.  A little oversharped?', '2004-05-05 13:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(699423, 74422, 7322, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see just a little more detail. Overall, it''s a great shot. I love the point of view and the simple background, and the lack of cliche. Excellent job!</td>', 'I wish I could see just a little more detail. Overall, it''s a great shot. I love the point of view and the simple background, and the lack of cliche. Excellent job!', '2004-05-05 13:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(699424, 73735, 21202, '<td valign="top">Just a little smaller aperture and a complete view of the entire screw, I would really, really like this photo.  The rust is really rendered nicely.  It does not show up as uniform at all.  There is also something lying on the wood that could have been picked off before shooting the shot.</td>', 'Just a little smaller aperture and a complete view of the entire screw, I would really, really like this photo.  The rust is really rendered nicely.  It does not show up as uniform at all.  There is also something lying on the wood that could have been picked off before shooting the shot.', '2004-05-05 13:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(699425, 74108, 20809, '<td valign="top">nice color and interpretation</td>', 'nice color and interpretation', '2004-05-05 13:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
