(699580, 73708, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think you might have been better getting in closer to reduce the ammount of background and to separate the figures from looking like a part of the tree.</td>', 'I think you might have been better getting in closer to reduce the ammount of background and to separate the figures from looking like a part of the tree.', '2004-05-05 14:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
