(699718, 73938, 7322, '<td valign="top">Way too high key for me. The strong contrast emphasizes the hot spots in the left corners and on the lock.</td>', 'Way too high key for me. The strong contrast emphasizes the hot spots in the left corners and on the lock.', '2004-05-05 15:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(699719, 74541, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is not a great perspective for this subject.</td>', 'This is not a great perspective for this subject.', '2004-05-05 15:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(699720, 73402, 7322, '<td valign="top">Kind of boring. I don''t like the way the frame is divided into four sections of bland color.</td>', 'Kind of boring. I don''t like the way the frame is divided into four sections of bland color.', '2004-05-05 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(699721, 73735, 21345, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate the composition of this photograph. The texture creates the interest in this photo.</td>', 'I can appreciate the composition of this photograph. The texture creates the interest in this photo.', '2004-05-05 15:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(699725, 73544, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this idea. Creative idea. I do think the eye needs some clean-up. I would start by removing the red on the lower lid.....that or really play that up with make-up.Then crop out the left more and level the shot, it''s tilted to the left a bit.</td>', 'I like this idea. Creative idea. I do think the eye needs some clean-up. I would start by removing the red on the lower lid.....that or really play that up with make-up.Then crop out the left more and level the shot, it''s tilted to the left a bit.', '2004-05-05 15:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(699727, 72858, 327, '<td valign="top">That is a vivid blue/purple. Like Liz Taylor''s eyes. Stunning contrast.</td>', 'That is a vivid blue/purple. Like Liz Taylor''s eyes. Stunning contrast.', '2004-05-05 15:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(699728, 73315, 16408, '<td valign="top">too much sharpening</td>', 'too much sharpening', '2004-05-05 15:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(699729, 74516, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful old barn. There''s nothing really wrong with this composition. It''s a nice rural landscape. But I''d be inclined to close in on the section with the door and the window.</td>', 'This is a beautiful old barn. There''s nothing really wrong with this composition. It''s a nice rural landscape. But I''d be inclined to close in on the section with the door and the window.', '2004-05-05 15:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(699730, 74434, 15212, '<td valign="top">your main subject is too dark, a little fill flash would have made this an 8. instead i give you a 6</td>', 'your main subject is too dark, a little fill flash would have made this an 8. instead i give you a 6', '2004-05-05 15:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(699732, 73670, 21345, '<td valign="top">I love it.</td>', 'I love it.', '2004-05-05 15:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(699733, 74509, 327, '<td valign="top">Sorry.</td>', 'Sorry.', '2004-05-05 15:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(699735, 73861, 15212, '<td valign="top">main subject seems a little dark...5</td>', 'main subject seems a little dark...5', '2004-05-05 15:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(699737, 74480, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the harsh shadows the leaves cast. It looks like the result of flash. I''m not crazy about the composition.</td>', 'I don''t like the harsh shadows the leaves cast. It looks like the result of flash. I''m not crazy about the composition.', '2004-05-05 15:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(699738, 73526, 19184, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The building seems a little blurry, but then again the challenge calls to compose an interesting shot around it so this is right on in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice photo.  The building seems a little blurry, but then again the challenge calls to compose an interesting shot around it so this is right on in my opinion.', '2004-05-05 15:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(699739, 73330, 18080, '<td valign="top">Really nice.<br/>I love the way that it looks like some kind of animal. I''m just waiting for it to move.<br/>Good luck in the challenge. I hope it does well.</td>', 'Really nice.I love the way that it looks like some kind of animal. I''m just waiting for it to move.Good luck in the challenge. I hope it does well.', '2004-05-05 15:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(699743, 74368, 7322, '<td valign="top">Kind of washed out and bland. This isn''t a particularly interesting compositon.</td>', 'Kind of washed out and bland. This isn''t a particularly interesting compositon.', '2004-05-05 15:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(699744, 73140, 16408, '<td valign="top">color woulds showed the rust better, are those kids feet, or just dolls?  anyway, cool idea</td>', 'color woulds showed the rust better, are those kids feet, or just dolls?  anyway, cool idea', '2004-05-05 15:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(699745, 73935, 7322, '<td valign="top">The washed out detail and out of focus rods in the foreground pretty much ruin this shot. I don''t get the title.</td>', 'The washed out detail and out of focus rods in the foreground pretty much ruin this shot. I don''t get the title.', '2004-05-05 15:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(699747, 73370, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a framing device. Good color. Could use a bit more detail in the rust.</td>', 'Nice use of a framing device. Good color. Could use a bit more detail in the rust.', '2004-05-05 15:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(699748, 74538, 18080, '<td valign="top">nice composition.<br/>Looks a bit over sharpened.<br/>Good luck though.</td>', 'nice composition.Looks a bit over sharpened.Good luck though.', '2004-05-05 15:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(699749, 73186, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit washed out and grainy. The detail in the birds should pop more.</td>', 'This looks a bit washed out and grainy. The detail in the birds should pop more.', '2004-05-05 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(699750, 73315, 7322, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit flat. There are too many tiny hot spots in the nails. It could be I''m just not interested in this composition. Sorry...</td>', 'The lighting is a bit flat. There are too many tiny hot spots in the nails. It could be I''m just not interested in this composition. Sorry...', '2004-05-05 15:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(699752, 74426, 19184, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, one of the best so far I have seen in this challenge.  Meets the challenge details right on "compose an interesting picture around it"</td>', 'I really like this photo, one of the best so far I have seen in this challenge.  Meets the challenge details right on "compose an interesting picture around it"', '2004-05-05 15:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(699758, 73492, 16408, '<td valign="top">go ahead, make my day, LOL</td>', 'go ahead, make my day, LOL', '2004-05-05 15:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(699763, 73676, 20214, '<td valign="top">Now there''s some major rust! Good shot!</td>', 'Now there''s some major rust! Good shot!', '2004-05-05 15:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(699766, 73962, 20214, '<td valign="top">Great colors, nice shot!</td>', 'Great colors, nice shot!', '2004-05-05 15:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(699769, 74426, 20214, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see that I''m not the only one who likes shooting train tracks. Nice photo!</td>', 'I''m glad to see that I''m not the only one who likes shooting train tracks. Nice photo!', '2004-05-05 15:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(699772, 73790, 13575, '<td valign="top">this picture will be one of the top three finals.</td>', 'this picture will be one of the top three finals.', '2004-05-05 15:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(699773, 73494, 20214, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo! Good job!</td>', 'Very interesting photo! Good job!', '2004-05-05 15:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(699775, 74409, 16301, '<td valign="top">This is the only 10 I gave in this challenge, simply because its quality stands out from the rest. The chains just jumps right out me. The composition, coming from top right to bottom left is just perfect. The central focus is great, it just pulls me into the photo. The detail and color is great too. It''ll be going into my favs, I would be very dissapointed if this didn''t get a ribbon!<br/> <br/>Excellent work, good luck...<br/> <br/>- Thamer</td>', 'This is the only 10 I gave in this challenge, simply because its quality stands out from the rest. The chains just jumps right out me. The composition, coming from top right to bottom left is just perfect. The central focus is great, it just pulls me into the photo. The detail and color is great too. It''ll be going into my favs, I would be very dissapointed if this didn''t get a ribbon! Excellent work, good luck... - Thamer', '2004-05-05 15:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(699777, 74442, 20214, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my youth spent in Canada during the summers in North Bay! Nice shot!</td>', 'Reminds me of my youth spent in Canada during the summers in North Bay! Nice shot!', '2004-05-05 16:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(699783, 73855, 20214, '<td valign="top">Too bad that the car in the rear wasn''t in focus.</td>', 'Too bad that the car in the rear wasn''t in focus.', '2004-05-05 16:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(699785, 74515, 20027, '<td valign="top">a lot of potential in this one but focus just isn''t there</td>', 'a lot of potential in this one but focus just isn''t there', '2004-05-05 16:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(699787, 73344, 20027, '<td valign="top">great photo but absence of rust isn''t rust.</td>', 'great photo but absence of rust isn''t rust.', '2004-05-05 16:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(699788, 74225, 20027, '<td valign="top">great subject but this photo looks badly compressed or distorted somehow.</td>', 'great subject but this photo looks badly compressed or distorted somehow.', '2004-05-05 16:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(699793, 74545, 9089, '<td valign="top">Good Photo, only wish you could have gotten rid of those wires on the side of the building to the left.</td>', 'Good Photo, only wish you could have gotten rid of those wires on the side of the building to the left.', '2004-05-05 16:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(699795, 74394, 16408, '<td valign="top">looks tilted</td>', 'looks tilted', '2004-05-05 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(699796, 74064, 5603, '<td valign="top">How lovely, one of my favorite shapes in nature.  I am truly moved by your entry.   Are you single by any chance?</td>', 'How lovely, one of my favorite shapes in nature.  I am truly moved by your entry.   Are you single by any chance?', '2004-05-05 16:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(699802, 74056, 9089, '<td valign="top">Great find</td>', 'Great find', '2004-05-05 16:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(699803, 73692, 18349, '<td valign="top">Could really be a nice shot if it were brighter.  I can hardly tell where the barbed wire begins.  Background is nice; white spot behind the barb in the foreground is distracting.</td>', 'Could really be a nice shot if it were brighter.  I can hardly tell where the barbed wire begins.  Background is nice; white spot behind the barb in the foreground is distracting.', '2004-05-05 16:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(699806, 74349, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the angle.  IMHO, would be much nicer if the left was cropped and the BG was blurred.</td>', 'I like the angle.  IMHO, would be much nicer if the left was cropped and the BG was blurred.', '2004-05-05 16:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(699807, 73448, 9089, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that you smoothed the interest right out of the rust, especially on the side of the rust bucket, just looks unusually smooth for rust.</td>', 'It seems to me that you smoothed the interest right out of the rust, especially on the side of the rust bucket, just looks unusually smooth for rust.', '2004-05-05 16:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(699823, 73523, 18349, '<td valign="top">Like it, but a tad too dark.  Hard to make out much detail.</td>', 'Like it, but a tad too dark.  Hard to make out much detail.', '2004-05-05 16:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(699824, 73348, 18349, '<td valign="top">Where were the wheels when we needed them?  :0)<br/> <br/>Good shot; like the composition.</td>', 'Where were the wheels when we needed them?  :0) Good shot; like the composition.', '2004-05-05 16:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(699825, 73698, 19608, '<td valign="top">Simple yet very effective.  Good seeing!</td>', 'Simple yet very effective.  Good seeing!', '2004-05-05 16:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(699826, 74199, 18349, '<td valign="top">Unique...I''ll give you that! :&gt;)</td>', 'Unique...I''ll give you that! :>)', '2004-05-05 16:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(699827, 73753, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of a framing device. Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting use of a framing device. Nice job.', '2004-05-05 16:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(699829, 73406, 7322, '<td valign="top">Really nice. Great composition. Good details.</td>', 'Really nice. Great composition. Good details.', '2004-05-05 16:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(699830, 74281, 18349, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast of colors.  Don''t know that it REALLY meets the challenge, as nothing in this photo is rusted.  The color rust may or may not squeak by.  I like the shot, however, and will give you the benefit of the doubt.  Good job.</td>', 'Like the contrast of colors.  Don''t know that it REALLY meets the challenge, as nothing in this photo is rusted.  The color rust may or may not squeak by.  I like the shot, however, and will give you the benefit of the doubt.  Good job.', '2004-05-05 16:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(699831, 73790, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and lighting.  The fact that the tallest and brightest object in the upper right is cut off is distracting as it leads you out of your image.</td>', 'Very nice colors and lighting.  The fact that the tallest and brightest object in the upper right is cut off is distracting as it leads you out of your image.', '2004-05-05 16:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(699832, 74394, 16957, '<td valign="top">If the nail is the key element in the composition it shoulc be in focus. Had it been so, this would have been an attractive vista.</td>', 'If the nail is the key element in the composition it shoulc be in focus. Had it been so, this would have been an attractive vista.', '2004-05-05 16:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(699833, 74299, 7322, '<td valign="top">Maybe tighter framing? It''s just sort of hanging there suspended in the middle of the frame.</td>', 'Maybe tighter framing? It''s just sort of hanging there suspended in the middle of the frame.', '2004-05-05 16:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(699834, 73270, 11518, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-05-05 16:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(699835, 74044, 19608, '<td valign="top">This challenge had SO MANY rusted chains and locks!  But the good news is that yours is great.  Nice composition, lighting, exposure.</td>', 'This challenge had SO MANY rusted chains and locks!  But the good news is that yours is great.  Nice composition, lighting, exposure.', '2004-05-05 16:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(699836, 74434, 20027, '<td valign="top">A fellow Clevelander. Great shot, nicely framed and nice contrast. It''s a shame the foreground shadows hide the details of the rust. I imagine you''ll receive comments to that effect. 7</td>', 'A fellow Clevelander. Great shot, nicely framed and nice contrast. It''s a shame the foreground shadows hide the details of the rust. I imagine you''ll receive comments to that effect. 7', '2004-05-05 16:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(699837, 74225, 7322, '<td valign="top">It''s a little noisy in the reflection and the underside of the boat. Nice composition and mood.</td>', 'It''s a little noisy in the reflection and the underside of the boat. Nice composition and mood.', '2004-05-05 16:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(699838, 74029, 11518, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2004-05-05 16:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(699839, 74474, 7322, '<td valign="top">The background is way too distracting. This overhead perspective isn''t really doing much to bring out the interesting fomr of th erusty thing. It flattens everything out.</td>', 'The background is way too distracting. This overhead perspective isn''t really doing much to bring out the interesting fomr of th erusty thing. It flattens everything out.', '2004-05-05 16:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(699841, 74428, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hehe.  Nice idea and the only one who thought of it.  I''d like to see the bottom of the glass.  Black background works nicelt for this.  The small white dots at various places on the glass are minor but noticeable.</td>', 'Hehe.  Nice idea and the only one who thought of it.  I''d like to see the bottom of the glass.  Black background works nicelt for this.  The small white dots at various places on the glass are minor but noticeable.', '2004-05-05 16:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(699846, 73526, 7322, '<td valign="top">The green is a bit oversaturated. Note that ther is very little difference between the color of the pond water and the vines in the foreground. It kind of hurts my eyes. I''d expect the water to look a bit more brownish than this. But I like the composition and the tranquil mood. I''d like to be here.</td>', 'The green is a bit oversaturated. Note that ther is very little difference between the color of the pond water and the vines in the foreground. It kind of hurts my eyes. I''d expect the water to look a bit more brownish than this. But I like the composition and the tranquil mood. I''d like to be here.', '2004-05-05 16:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(699848, 73296, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract - excellent colors.  I''d like to see it a biy sharper and presented diagonally.  As is  - it still has a great feel - well done.</td>', 'Nice abstract - excellent colors.  I''d like to see it a biy sharper and presented diagonally.  As is  - it still has a great feel - well done.', '2004-05-05 16:40:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(699851, 74044, 18073, '<td valign="top">Lots of interesting detail here and fab textures on the timber, really like this one 8/10</td>', 'Lots of interesting detail here and fab textures on the timber, really like this one 8/10', '2004-05-05 16:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(699852, 73084, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the foreshortening this straight-on perspective causes. Maybe at a sharper angle?</td>', 'I don''t care for the foreshortening this straight-on perspective causes. Maybe at a sharper angle?', '2004-05-05 16:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(699854, 74250, 20027, '<td valign="top">nice shot, slight soft focus.  I might have tried this shot vertical by losing the objects on the left and right.</td>', 'nice shot, slight soft focus.  I might have tried this shot vertical by losing the objects on the left and right.', '2004-05-05 16:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(699855, 73676, 11518, '<td valign="top">need more dof</td>', 'need more dof', '2004-05-05 16:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(699859, 74369, 7322, '<td valign="top">The rust isn''t really apparent in this color. The pitted texture could just as easily have come from cast iron.</td>', 'The rust isn''t really apparent in this color. The pitted texture could just as easily have come from cast iron.', '2004-05-05 16:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(699860, 74045, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, but the border is to thick and distracting.  8.  Would have been a 10.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, but the border is to thick and distracting.  8.  Would have been a 10.', '2004-05-05 16:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(699861, 73626, 20027, '<td valign="top">nice photo, slightly soft on focus</td>', 'nice photo, slightly soft on focus', '2004-05-05 16:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(699862, 74064, 19790, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the tree has fallen? The leaf appears to be defying the law of gravity! I like it.</td>', 'I''m assuming the tree has fallen? The leaf appears to be defying the law of gravity! I like it.', '2004-05-05 16:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(699864, 74516, 11518, '<td valign="top">Lightning not right.</td>', 'Lightning not right.', '2004-05-05 16:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(699866, 73792, 19608, '<td valign="top">The door itself is very nice, good find.  My suggestions for improvement are:  1) Image is under exposed giving it a flat feel.  I think the walls are probably white and not gray as shown.  When shooting white subjects be sure to open up  a bit.  2) The picture is in the door - so the entire right half of the image is unneeded and should be cropped out.  Instead get in tighter on the door, probably in a vertical format show you can get the entire door.</td>', 'The door itself is very nice, good find.  My suggestions for improvement are:  1) Image is under exposed giving it a flat feel.  I think the walls are probably white and not gray as shown.  When shooting white subjects be sure to open up  a bit.  2) The picture is in the door - so the entire right half of the image is unneeded and should be cropped out.  Instead get in tighter on the door, probably in a vertical format show you can get the entire door.', '2004-05-05 16:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(699867, 73200, 7322, '<td valign="top">This composition is a too busy. There''s too much in the foreground to really focus on the tractor. There is virtually no contrast beween the tractor and the barn. The entire image looks very flat and mundane. I suggest moving in closer or moving around the tractor for a different perspective. There''s snow on the ground in May. Is this Alaska? Minnesota?</td>', 'This composition is a too busy. There''s too much in the foreground to really focus on the tractor. There is virtually no contrast beween the tractor and the barn. The entire image looks very flat and mundane. I suggest moving in closer or moving around the tractor for a different perspective. There''s snow on the ground in May. Is this Alaska? Minnesota?', '2004-05-05 16:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(699869, 73402, 18202, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition..</td>', 'Interesting composition..', '2004-05-05 16:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(699870, 74291, 16957, '<td valign="top">A tricky shot in which to get the exposure right. Unfortunately, exposing correctly for the sky leaves the padlock badly underexposed. You could have tried a light fill in flash to solve this. As it is, the padlock, which is a key element in the photo is too dark for my liking. Otherwise it''s a nicely composed shot.</td>', 'A tricky shot in which to get the exposure right. Unfortunately, exposing correctly for the sky leaves the padlock badly underexposed. You could have tried a light fill in flash to solve this. As it is, the padlock, which is a key element in the photo is too dark for my liking. Otherwise it''s a nicely composed shot.', '2004-05-05 16:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(699871, 73167, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice macro but does not fit challenge.</td>', 'Nice macro but does not fit challenge.', '2004-05-05 16:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(699872, 74540, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. However, the chains are way too dark to show rusted detail. They just look black to me.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. However, the chains are way too dark to show rusted detail. They just look black to me.', '2004-05-05 16:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(699873, 74353, 20027, '<td valign="top">very nice color saturation.</td>', 'very nice color saturation.', '2004-05-05 16:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(699874, 73342, 18202, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2004-05-05 16:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(699875, 73626, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice tranquil image. The blossoms could pop a bit more. Most of the detail seems to have been captured in the clapboard siding.</td>', 'This is a nice tranquil image. The blossoms could pop a bit more. Most of the detail seems to have been captured in the clapboard siding.', '2004-05-05 16:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(699877, 73526, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, but the house should have been in focus instead of the tree. 8</td>', 'Beautiful picture, but the house should have been in focus instead of the tree. 8', '2004-05-05 16:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(699878, 73494, 18202, '<td valign="top">Good one!</td>', 'Good one!', '2004-05-05 16:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(699879, 74255, 9089, '<td valign="top">With the title of the photo being the view, what we see in focus is the rusty ''frame'' of the picture, which tends to lead my eyes right out of the picture in all directions</td>', 'With the title of the photo being the view, what we see in focus is the rusty ''frame'' of the picture, which tends to lead my eyes right out of the picture in all directions', '2004-05-05 16:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(699880, 73735, 7322, '<td valign="top">It might have been better if most of the detail in the wood wasn''t blurred out.</td>', 'It might have been better if most of the detail in the wood wasn''t blurred out.', '2004-05-05 16:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(699881, 74538, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the subject and effective framing. Simple background works well.</td>', 'Nice detail in the subject and effective framing. Simple background works well.', '2004-05-05 16:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(699882, 74024, 11518, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-05-05 16:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(699884, 73754, 16408, '<td valign="top">wish this one was bigger</td>', 'wish this one was bigger', '2004-05-05 16:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(699885, 74346, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of negative space. Nice strong detail in the subject.</td>', 'Interesting use of negative space. Nice strong detail in the subject.', '2004-05-05 16:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(699886, 73805, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Maybe if you moved in more. This point of view isn''t making a emphatic statement.</td>', 'Good subject. Maybe if you moved in more. This point of view isn''t making a emphatic statement.', '2004-05-05 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
