(699978, 74350, 19575, '<td valign="top">interesting photo, good lighting, like the extra water - appropriate for the solution</td>', 'interesting photo, good lighting, like the extra water - appropriate for the solution', '2004-05-05 17:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(699979, 74453, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro shot.  Not sure whether the focus could have been improved since it''s a macro.</td>', 'Very nice macro shot.  Not sure whether the focus could have been improved since it''s a macro.', '2004-05-05 17:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(699982, 73963, 19790, '<td valign="top">this is exactly why MY umbrella is made out of steel!</td>', 'this is exactly why MY umbrella is made out of steel!', '2004-05-05 17:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(699985, 74276, 6008, '<td valign="top">Color/toning: The typical colors of a sunset - nicely golden, warm, and inviting.<br/> <br/>Composition/cropping: The horizon looks a little tilted, but the placement of the balcony and sun on opposing sides balances it out nicely.<br/> <br/>Subject: I''m assuming the balcony fence is the thing that is rusty. Unfortunately because of the silhouette it''s not possible to see whether the fence is rusty or not. It''s easy enough to assume it is, but I dont immediately think of rust when I look at the shot.<br/> <br/>Technical: The sun is a little overexposed, horizon tilted, but the dog and balcong is nicely silhouetted. There also seems to be some jpeg compression around the balcony.<br/> <br/>Artistic: It''s a very peaceful shot and I really like that the dog is included and not just the balcony. It tells a story and it feels like I''m right there.<br/> <br/>Overall: It''s a good shot but I''m just not getting the feeling of rust from it.</td>', 'Color/toning: The typical colors of a sunset - nicely golden, warm, and inviting. Composition/cropping: The horizon looks a little tilted, but the placement of the balcony and sun on opposing sides balances it out nicely. Subject: I''m assuming the balcony fence is the thing that is rusty. Unfortunately because of the silhouette it''s not possible to see whether the fence is rusty or not. It''s easy enough to assume it is, but I dont immediately think of rust when I look at the shot. Technical: The sun is a little overexposed, horizon tilted, but the dog and balcong is nicely silhouetted. There also seems to be some jpeg compression around the balcony. Artistic: It''s a very peaceful shot and I really like that the dog is included and not just the balcony. It tells a story and it feels like I''m right there. Overall: It''s a good shot but I''m just not getting the feeling of rust from it.', '2004-05-05 17:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(699986, 73493, 17530, '<td valign="top">Leaf is a little out of focus. Might have overdone the unsharp mask. Bit brighter and a bit more colour might have helped make it stand out too.<br/>Apart from all that, it''s great.</td>', 'Leaf is a little out of focus. Might have overdone the unsharp mask. Bit brighter and a bit more colour might have helped make it stand out too.Apart from all that, it''s great.', '2004-05-05 17:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(699987, 74225, 15207, '<td valign="top">This looks very compressed. You may want to save your files without reducing jpeg compression in the future. This is a great shot and subject - you mway want to think about reallyc ropping in - maybe framing it from where the boat starts to teh rope and the pole where it is tied up (cutting out the extra poles adn the extra dead space beyond the pole with the rope. -6</td>', 'This looks very compressed. You may want to save your files without reducing jpeg compression in the future. This is a great shot and subject - you mway want to think about reallyc ropping in - maybe framing it from where the boat starts to teh rope and the pole where it is tied up (cutting out the extra poles adn the extra dead space beyond the pole with the rope. -6', '2004-05-05 17:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
