(701024, 74481, 19608, '<td valign="top">This image violates many of the traditional "standards" of artwork.  It''s lighter at the bottom than the top. It reads best from top-left-center toward bottom-right-center.  There''s no texture in the shadows.  But.. having said all that (take a breath) THIS IS THE IMAGE THAT PROVES THE EXCEPTION TO THE RULE!  Going against all common rules of composition and all that academic stuff - this is one of the very best images in this challenge for me.</td>', 'This image violates many of the traditional "standards" of artwork.  It''s lighter at the bottom than the top. It reads best from top-left-center toward bottom-right-center.  There''s no texture in the shadows.  But.. having said all that (take a breath) THIS IS THE IMAGE THAT PROVES THE EXCEPTION TO THE RULE!  Going against all common rules of composition and all that academic stuff - this is one of the very best images in this challenge for me.', '2004-05-06 02:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
