(701182, 73987, 18722, '<td valign="top">That is one very tight DOF!  Unfortunately it looks like you may have removed too much of the texture of the rust.  This is one macro shot I think would have worked better with a larger DOF.  As it is, the green and yellow on the left are simply distracting.<br/> <br/>David</td>', 'That is one very tight DOF!  Unfortunately it looks like you may have removed too much of the texture of the rust.  This is one macro shot I think would have worked better with a larger DOF.  As it is, the green and yellow on the left are simply distracting. David', '2004-05-06 05:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
