(701358, 73325, 17530, '<td valign="top">''Ah - a bit of rust never hurt anyone...<br/>Hang on a minute - they''re jammed, soon fix that.<br/>Aarg! I''ve just lost two fingers! Help - there''s blood<br/>everywhere.''<br/> <br/>Let that "reconstruction" be a lesson to you: NEVER TRUST RUST</td>', '''Ah - a bit of rust never hurt anyone...Hang on a minute - they''re jammed, soon fix that.Aarg! I''ve just lost two fingers! Help - there''s bloodeverywhere.'' Let that "reconstruction" be a lesson to you: NEVER TRUST RUST', '2004-05-06 08:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
