(701400, 74260, 20204, '<td valign="top">This looks like a picture of rust...  It seems to be lacking a piece of interest that sets it off, and would also benefit from more contrast between the shot''s elements.</td>', 'This looks like a picture of rust...  It seems to be lacking a piece of interest that sets it off, and would also benefit from more contrast between the shot''s elements.', '2004-05-06 09:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
