(701402, 73754, 20027, '<td valign="top">What a shame! This looks like a great photography but it''s way to small. If you have photoshop, make sure you use the maximum of 640 pixel limit and use the "save for the web" feature to get the file size below 150k. I still give it a 5 but this looks like it could have been a winner.</td>', 'What a shame! This looks like a great photography but it''s way to small. If you have photoshop, make sure you use the maximum of 640 pixel limit and use the "save for the web" feature to get the file size below 150k. I still give it a 5 but this looks like it could have been a winner.', '2004-05-06 09:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(701403, 74446, 1368, '<td valign="top">Cool rust stuff, picture is a little busy though, I kinda like it though - 7</td>', 'Cool rust stuff, picture is a little busy though, I kinda like it though - 7', '2004-05-06 09:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(701405, 73790, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, nice crop, Good job :)</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, nice crop, Good job :)', '2004-05-06 09:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(701409, 73221, 20027, '<td valign="top">To small. If there is rust in the photo, I can''t see it. If you have photoshop, make sure you use the 640 limit to your advantage and then use the save for web feature to get the file size under 150k.</td>', 'To small. If there is rust in the photo, I can''t see it. If you have photoshop, make sure you use the 640 limit to your advantage and then use the save for web feature to get the file size under 150k.', '2004-05-06 09:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(701410, 74027, 20027, '<td valign="top">Needs a higher DOF. Having the soft focus in the distance is good but I think more of the chain needs to be in focus to pull the effect off.</td>', 'Needs a higher DOF. Having the soft focus in the distance is good but I think more of the chain needs to be in focus to pull the effect off.', '2004-05-06 09:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(701414, 74073, 20204, '<td valign="top">The background seems to distract from the subject by not having enough contrast.  The image would benefit from a better light source as well.  It also looks like the scale needs to be rotated slightly.  The final suggestion I''d make is that this shot is what I would call a "memory picture", which is in contrast to an artistic picture.  For example, if this were an old barn, it might have been interesting to have the scale slightly off-center with more of the background in the shot, but with a depth of field that slightly obscured any objects hanging on the walls.</td>', 'The background seems to distract from the subject by not having enough contrast.  The image would benefit from a better light source as well.  It also looks like the scale needs to be rotated slightly.  The final suggestion I''d make is that this shot is what I would call a "memory picture", which is in contrast to an artistic picture.  For example, if this were an old barn, it might have been interesting to have the scale slightly off-center with more of the background in the shot, but with a depth of field that slightly obscured any objects hanging on the walls.', '2004-05-06 09:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(701415, 73742, 19474, '<td valign="top">a great find very well photographed love the color <br/>the change in perspective from bottom right to top left gives this photo real depth <br/>my only 10</td>', 'a great find very well photographed love the color the change in perspective from bottom right to top left gives this photo real depth my only 10', '2004-05-06 09:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(701416, 74402, 20204, '<td valign="top">You definitely captured the challenge theme in your image, but I don''t see anything built on that theme.  It''s just a barrel, but lacking a point of interest.  It would also have been nice to choose an angle that didn''t include the sign post in the upper left, as well as the sidewalk/road which is a bit distracting from the subject.</td>', 'You definitely captured the challenge theme in your image, but I don''t see anything built on that theme.  It''s just a barrel, but lacking a point of interest.  It would also have been nice to choose an angle that didn''t include the sign post in the upper left, as well as the sidewalk/road which is a bit distracting from the subject.', '2004-05-06 09:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(701418, 74412, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice angular composition though would be better if the snail were in the ROT sweet spot, and if this were in focus</td>', 'Nice idea, nice angular composition though would be better if the snail were in the ROT sweet spot, and if this were in focus', '2004-05-06 09:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(701421, 74499, 20027, '<td valign="top">Comes across as a snapshot. Use creative angles, put Natalie at the top of the slide and take a photo from the bottom looking up at a steep angle (making sure to get some rust textures in the picture). Or, take the same photo but have Natalie spinning on the wheel and capture a motion shot.</td>', 'Comes across as a snapshot. Use creative angles, put Natalie at the top of the slide and take a photo from the bottom looking up at a steep angle (making sure to get some rust textures in the picture). Or, take the same photo but have Natalie spinning on the wheel and capture a motion shot.', '2004-05-06 09:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(701425, 73104, 20027, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Should be a top 10 in my book. Great DOF</td>', 'Nicely done. Should be a top 10 in my book. Great DOF', '2004-05-06 09:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(701426, 73229, 20204, '<td valign="top">The glare in the upper left is distracting.  I''m not sure the top half of the picture is adding anything to the image either.  If the shot was taken from an angle that completely covered the grafiti in the chain link fence, it might have been interesting with a tight crop.</td>', 'The glare in the upper left is distracting.  I''m not sure the top half of the picture is adding anything to the image either.  If the shot was taken from an angle that completely covered the grafiti in the chain link fence, it might have been interesting with a tight crop.', '2004-05-06 09:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(701427, 74281, 18748, '<td valign="top">nice combination between life and deth, but frame is little bit too big for me.</td>', 'nice combination between life and deth, but frame is little bit too big for me.', '2004-05-06 09:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(701428, 74159, 12253, '<td valign="top">This was an interesting idea.  I think it might have worked better if it were the chain rather than hands hiding the nipples and without the rings.  Perhaps the chain would have been wrapped around a few times for better coverage.  Also, lighting and focus could be better here.</td>', 'This was an interesting idea.  I think it might have worked better if it were the chain rather than hands hiding the nipples and without the rings.  Perhaps the chain would have been wrapped around a few times for better coverage.  Also, lighting and focus could be better here.', '2004-05-06 09:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(701430, 74446, 20027, '<td valign="top">Is my mind playing tricks on me? Did someone else submit this same subject but zoomed out a bit farther?</td>', 'Is my mind playing tricks on me? Did someone else submit this same subject but zoomed out a bit farther?', '2004-05-06 09:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(701431, 74354, 10702, '<td valign="top">Nice  shot - like the shadows</td>', 'Nice  shot - like the shadows', '2004-05-06 09:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(701432, 74513, 10702, '<td valign="top">To blurry and a bit uninteresting</td>', 'To blurry and a bit uninteresting', '2004-05-06 09:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(701433, 74159, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think the background washes out the image.  The foreground hand is also out of focus, and the chains seem to be lackign in sharpness.  The rings are a bit distracting as well; It seems like the focus of the image is the chaining of a body rather than the body''s jewelry.</td>', 'I think the background washes out the image.  The foreground hand is also out of focus, and the chains seem to be lackign in sharpness.  The rings are a bit distracting as well; It seems like the focus of the image is the chaining of a body rather than the body''s jewelry.', '2004-05-06 09:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
