(701455, 74253, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the mind-games this image plays...   It''s great when you see a picture that rewards second glances.  I might suggest keeping more of those wooden posts in the frame as they add interest to me.</td>', 'I like the mind-games this image plays...   It''s great when you see a picture that rewards second glances.  I might suggest keeping more of those wooden posts in the frame as they add interest to me.', '2004-05-06 09:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
