(701495, 74298, 19474, '<td valign="top">shame this was wired to a dark background as it tends to "get lost" in the picture</td>', 'shame this was wired to a dark background as it tends to "get lost" in the picture', '2004-05-06 10:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(701501, 74398, 19831, '<td valign="top">I see what you''re trying to say, however, this looks like something very old and abandoned, not wrecked. And the beer bottles (which are glared and show no detail) are very obviously placed after the fact. They might look better strewn about, like as if they were part of the crash. This particular shot I think would be much better without the political statement.</td>', 'I see what you''re trying to say, however, this looks like something very old and abandoned, not wrecked. And the beer bottles (which are glared and show no detail) are very obviously placed after the fact. They might look better strewn about, like as if they were part of the crash. This particular shot I think would be much better without the political statement.', '2004-05-06 10:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(701503, 74388, 19831, '<td valign="top">I see the color is kind of rust, but the challenge was clearly "rusted"</td>', 'I see the color is kind of rust, but the challenge was clearly "rusted"', '2004-05-06 10:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(701506, 74044, 20956, '<td valign="top">excellent detail and contrast</td>', 'excellent detail and contrast', '2004-05-06 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(701509, 73342, 20070, '<td valign="top">an army of nuts!  i like their posture. i wonder if it would be possible to compose a shot that captured the same sort of lineup without the front edge or the background showing at the top of the photo? nice shot anyway</td>', 'an army of nuts!  i like their posture. i wonder if it would be possible to compose a shot that captured the same sort of lineup without the front edge or the background showing at the top of the photo? nice shot anyway', '2004-05-06 10:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(701512, 73751, 19831, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see some people took the time to find something interesting instead of running out and shooting the first rusty thing they could find. Nice shot! 8</td>', 'I''m glad to see some people took the time to find something interesting instead of running out and shooting the first rusty thing they could find. Nice shot! 8', '2004-05-06 10:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(701514, 74475, 19474, '<td valign="top">nice idea and like the composition<br/>but maybe you should have moved a bit closer to the can so it was 30% larger and tried reflecting some light onto the front of the can to make it standout and  focus on its detail more</td>', 'nice idea and like the compositionbut maybe you should have moved a bit closer to the can so it was 30% larger and tried reflecting some light onto the front of the can to make it standout and  focus on its detail more', '2004-05-06 10:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
