(702088, 73526, 18897, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Was going to complain about the rust not being dominant enough, but then I realize this was just plain nice to rest the eye upon after voting on some 300+ red images. And the object was to compose around rust, not shoot rust. Is it a golf course by chance? The grass behind the house seems golfy..<br/> <br/>However - must complain about something right? The focus is a bit off. Shorter DOF and the focus dead on the rusty house would have made this really good. Perhaps just a little less tree to the left too I think. Anyway, nice warm image. Good luck!</td>', 'Interesting composition. Was going to complain about the rust not being dominant enough, but then I realize this was just plain nice to rest the eye upon after voting on some 300+ red images. And the object was to compose around rust, not shoot rust. Is it a golf course by chance? The grass behind the house seems golfy.. However - must complain about something right? The focus is a bit off. Shorter DOF and the focus dead on the rusty house would have made this really good. Perhaps just a little less tree to the left too I think. Anyway, nice warm image. Good luck!', '2004-05-06 14:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(702089, 73801, 14476, '<td valign="top">...and once upon a time, this was a thing of beauty!  Well, it still makes a fine photograph with good clarity and your interpretation.  It may be a bit too centered for some tastes, but still the colors and design of the object bring it through.</td>', '...and once upon a time, this was a thing of beauty!  Well, it still makes a fine photograph with good clarity and your interpretation.  It may be a bit too centered for some tastes, but still the colors and design of the object bring it through.', '2004-05-06 14:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
