(702145, 74227, 18897, '<td valign="top">Very good, but a bit too centered main object. And there''s a "what''s-that-on-the-left-feeling". I would have moved to the left to bring that in (depending on what it was perhaps) or zoomed in a bit to get rid of the left thingie and get a more interesting composition around the main wreck.</td>', 'Very good, but a bit too centered main object. And there''s a "what''s-that-on-the-left-feeling". I would have moved to the left to bring that in (depending on what it was perhaps) or zoomed in a bit to get rid of the left thingie and get a more interesting composition around the main wreck.', '2004-05-06 15:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(702148, 74382, 18897, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what it is, and perhaps it''s a bit dark, but I like it. Very nice contrast against the sky.</td>', 'Don''t know what it is, and perhaps it''s a bit dark, but I like it. Very nice contrast against the sky.', '2004-05-06 15:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(702149, 74378, 20539, '<td valign="top">nice colours... -9</td>', 'nice colours... -9', '2004-05-06 15:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(702150, 74400, 10702, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - if only that flare was not there</td>', 'Nice shot - if only that flare was not there', '2004-05-06 15:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(702155, 74511, 10702, '<td valign="top">Haha - bet this has been inactive for quite some time</td>', 'Haha - bet this has been inactive for quite some time', '2004-05-06 15:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(702156, 74197, 10702, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot. Very good subject and the background is perfect. The only thing keeping me from giving it a 10 is that the DOF is a bit shallow for my taste. .:9:.</td>', 'I really love this shot. Very good subject and the background is perfect. The only thing keeping me from giving it a 10 is that the DOF is a bit shallow for my taste. .:9:.', '2004-05-06 15:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(702158, 74247, 10702, '<td valign="top">strange - but good</td>', 'strange - but good', '2004-05-06 15:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(702159, 74203, 18897, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Just a little less sky I think, the light up there steals the eye, but there''s nothing interesting up there. <br/> <br/>Great find by the way. Do tell us the poor thing''s story!</td>', 'Nice shot! Just a little less sky I think, the light up there steals the eye, but there''s nothing interesting up there.  Great find by the way. Do tell us the poor thing''s story!', '2004-05-06 15:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(702160, 73648, 10702, '<td valign="top">And hopefully will be rusted there for ever.</td>', 'And hopefully will be rusted there for ever.', '2004-05-06 15:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(702161, 74056, 10702, '<td valign="top">Cool, how perfect subject is that.</td>', 'Cool, how perfect subject is that.', '2004-05-06 15:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(702162, 74340, 18897, '<td valign="top">Funny how you even bothered to give this one a title. Going for the last spot? I think you might be on.</td>', 'Funny how you even bothered to give this one a title. Going for the last spot? I think you might be on.', '2004-05-06 15:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(702164, 73910, 10702, '<td valign="top">Haha - brilliant title and a very good shot.</td>', 'Haha - brilliant title and a very good shot.', '2004-05-06 15:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(702165, 73644, 15920, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the rust.</td>', 'I can''t see the rust.', '2004-05-06 15:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(702166, 74413, 14476, '<td valign="top">I very much llike the texture differences between the rocks and chains.  Perhaps the image could be a bit more in focus (just slightly) but still a good take on the challenge and good seeing to find this one.</td>', 'I very much llike the texture differences between the rocks and chains.  Perhaps the image could be a bit more in focus (just slightly) but still a good take on the challenge and good seeing to find this one.', '2004-05-06 15:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(702167, 74515, 10702, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you choose to have the grass in the foreground in focus but not the milkcan or the Ivy.</td>', 'I don''t understand why you choose to have the grass in the foreground in focus but not the milkcan or the Ivy.', '2004-05-06 15:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(702168, 74477, 10702, '<td valign="top">Lovely color.</td>', 'Lovely color.', '2004-05-06 15:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(702169, 74257, 14476, '<td valign="top">Cute title and very exciting image.  I like the starkness of it and appreciate the play of very light to very dark.  Good shadow effect.  Good luck in the Challenge.</td>', 'Cute title and very exciting image.  I like the starkness of it and appreciate the play of very light to very dark.  Good shadow effect.  Good luck in the Challenge.', '2004-05-06 15:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(702170, 73616, 10702, '<td valign="top">Really neat shot - might be cropped a bit closer.</td>', 'Really neat shot - might be cropped a bit closer.', '2004-05-06 15:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(702171, 74423, 18098, '<td valign="top">Looks like the cook was a little Rusty!</td>', 'Looks like the cook was a little Rusty!', '2004-05-06 15:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(702172, 73663, 10702, '<td valign="top">Love you DOF in this shot, great shot.</td>', 'Love you DOF in this shot, great shot.', '2004-05-06 15:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(702173, 74024, 14476, '<td valign="top">Love your title.  Yes, you can conjure up all sorts of stories with this image.  You''ve photographed it well and it certainly is a good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Love your title.  Yes, you can conjure up all sorts of stories with this image.  You''ve photographed it well and it certainly is a good take on the challenge.', '2004-05-06 15:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(702174, 73226, 18098, '<td valign="top">This is so nice for this challenge.</td>', 'This is so nice for this challenge.', '2004-05-06 15:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(702176, 74478, 14476, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, this guy''s sign isn''t very rust resistant, is it!  Good composition, excellent colors and sharp letters on the sign.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Hmmm, this guy''s sign isn''t very rust resistant, is it!  Good composition, excellent colors and sharp letters on the sign.  Nicely done.', '2004-05-06 15:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(702177, 74359, 10702, '<td valign="top">Good shot, nice macro and good subject. The lighting is a bit harsh though.</td>', 'Good shot, nice macro and good subject. The lighting is a bit harsh though.', '2004-05-06 15:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(702180, 74027, 10702, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, good DOF and the focuspoint is at the right place, a bit grainy though.</td>', 'Very nice shot, good DOF and the focuspoint is at the right place, a bit grainy though.', '2004-05-06 15:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(702185, 73233, 10702, '<td valign="top">I would love just one like it in my garden, brilliant use of an old car and a very good shot of it to.</td>', 'I would love just one like it in my garden, brilliant use of an old car and a very good shot of it to.', '2004-05-06 15:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(702186, 74454, 14476, '<td valign="top">The fluids dripping down this sign add to the feeling of danger that prevail in this exciting photograph.   It''s well seen, beautifully photographed and tells a compelling story.  What more is there!   10</td>', 'The fluids dripping down this sign add to the feeling of danger that prevail in this exciting photograph.   It''s well seen, beautifully photographed and tells a compelling story.  What more is there!   10', '2004-05-06 15:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(702188, 73861, 10702, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and colors, on of the top ten.</td>', 'Great contrast and colors, on of the top ten.', '2004-05-06 15:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(702191, 74496, 10702, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, I really like the title.</td>', 'Hahaha, I really like the title.', '2004-05-06 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(702192, 73514, 14476, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece you have here.  It could work on several levels.  As an abstract, (cutting out all the landscape) or as you have it, intruding on the countryside.  Good seeing.</td>', 'Interesting piece you have here.  It could work on several levels.  As an abstract, (cutting out all the landscape) or as you have it, intruding on the countryside.  Good seeing.', '2004-05-06 15:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
