(702194, 74209, 18897, '<td valign="top">Not at all sure what I''m looking at (apart from the obvious chess-board), but it''s a pretty unappealing picture. However bad the image, you did get the title right though, and my next move would be Nd4. :)</td>', 'Not at all sure what I''m looking at (apart from the obvious chess-board), but it''s a pretty unappealing picture. However bad the image, you did get the title right though, and my next move would be Nd4. :)', '2004-05-06 15:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
