(702211, 73855, 9089, '<td valign="top">My eyes are drawn to the car at the top of the picture, but since it is not in focus, my eyes start to cross.  Thus taking an interesting picture, and making it not one I want to look at for long.</td>', 'My eyes are drawn to the car at the top of the picture, but since it is not in focus, my eyes start to cross.  Thus taking an interesting picture, and making it not one I want to look at for long.', '2004-05-06 15:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
