(702231, 74293, 9089, '<td valign="top">I really like this, so I have to point out the one thing that bothers me, and that is the spider web? string? fuzz line between the topmost petal and the green leaf behind it.</td>', 'I really like this, so I have to point out the one thing that bothers me, and that is the spider web? string? fuzz line between the topmost petal and the green leaf behind it.', '2004-05-06 15:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
