(702253, 73866, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant take on the challenge here.  Good composition.  Perhaps a bit more depth of field to take in that wiindow view which appears to be scenic.   The border might be a bit heavy for the image, but not bad.</td>', 'Very pleasant take on the challenge here.  Good composition.  Perhaps a bit more depth of field to take in that wiindow view which appears to be scenic.   The border might be a bit heavy for the image, but not bad.', '2004-05-06 16:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(702254, 74490, 12583, '<td valign="top">I kind of felt that the focas should have been on the rusted part with the can blurry... but maybe it''s just me. Still, I liked the idea, and it made me laugh. :)</td>', 'I kind of felt that the focas should have been on the rusted part with the can blurry... but maybe it''s just me. Still, I liked the idea, and it made me laugh. :)', '2004-05-06 16:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(702255, 73213, 14476, '<td valign="top">Rain came, went, and came again for these plates.  And maybe some snow came too!   :&gt;)    Nice idea and quite well executed.  Maybe a closer crop would also be an interesting composition.</td>', 'Rain came, went, and came again for these plates.  And maybe some snow came too!   :>)    Nice idea and quite well executed.  Maybe a closer crop would also be an interesting composition.', '2004-05-06 16:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(702256, 74376, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot.  Good composition, unique idea, well photographed.  Nice!</td>', 'I like this one a lot.  Good composition, unique idea, well photographed.  Nice!', '2004-05-06 16:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(702257, 74403, 12583, '<td valign="top">This seems to be in the wrong contest? Was this supposed to be in proportion?</td>', 'This seems to be in the wrong contest? Was this supposed to be in proportion?', '2004-05-06 16:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(702258, 73391, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is so very good.  It took me a couple of looks to actually see what is going on in this image but "better late than never."   Everything works well here from the harmonizing colors to the elegant composition.  If I was going to "pick nits" I might wonder about the slightly blurred foreground, but not to worry, this photograph is so good, that would probably grow on me too!  10</td>', 'This is so very good.  It took me a couple of looks to actually see what is going on in this image but "better late than never."   Everything works well here from the harmonizing colors to the elegant composition.  If I was going to "pick nits" I might wonder about the slightly blurred foreground, but not to worry, this photograph is so good, that would probably grow on me too!  10', '2004-05-06 16:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(702259, 74108, 14476, '<td valign="top">Excellent seeing on this one.  Mercator would be proud of you!</td>', 'Excellent seeing on this one.  Mercator would be proud of you!', '2004-05-06 16:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(702260, 73342, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like your regimented rows here.  They add interest to an otherwise quiet image.   And the shallow depth of field works well here.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like your regimented rows here.  They add interest to an otherwise quiet image.   And the shallow depth of field works well here.  Nicely done.', '2004-05-06 16:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(702261, 73938, 9089, '<td valign="top">The red seems a little too saturated.</td>', 'The red seems a little too saturated.', '2004-05-06 16:25:46.000000', NULL, 1);
