(702467, 73462, 17166, '<td valign="top">I think there''s a bit too much dynamic range in this picture - between the bright highlights at the top of the wheel and the very dark shadows it''s hard to get a feel for the rust color.  An overcast day, or something to diffuse the light, or maybe some fill flash for the shadows could help here.</td>', 'I think there''s a bit too much dynamic range in this picture - between the bright highlights at the top of the wheel and the very dark shadows it''s hard to get a feel for the rust color.  An overcast day, or something to diffuse the light, or maybe some fill flash for the shadows could help here.', '2004-05-06 19:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
