(702473, 73337, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject, I can almost hear it squeaking as it tries to turn.  One idea: I think I would have liked this better if the perspective was looking up instead of down (which could have been done just by flipping over the photo - the background is so blurred that nobody could tell).  Just because most wind spinners I see I''m usually looking up at, which gives a feeling of it being up in the wind.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject, I can almost hear it squeaking as it tries to turn.  One idea: I think I would have liked this better if the perspective was looking up instead of down (which could have been done just by flipping over the photo - the background is so blurred that nobody could tell).  Just because most wind spinners I see I''m usually looking up at, which gives a feeling of it being up in the wind.', '2004-05-06 19:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
