(702480, 74341, 17166, '<td valign="top">This photo almost looks like it''s taken through thick smoke.  I personally don''t feel it complements this subject.  You might want to look at //www.lonestardigital.com/photoshop_quicktips.htm for a way to clear this up using your favorite image editor.</td>', 'This photo almost looks like it''s taken through thick smoke.  I personally don''t feel it complements this subject.  You might want to look at //www.lonestardigital.com/photoshop_quicktips.htm for a way to clear this up using your favorite image editor.', '2004-05-06 19:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(702481, 73523, 17166, '<td valign="top">Clever title, compliments the image.</td>', 'Clever title, compliments the image.', '2004-05-06 19:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(702487, 74422, 17166, '<td valign="top">Great picture - really like how the sculpture is echoed in the clouds.  Might be improved by bringing up the shadows in the dinosaur - maybe a bit of fill flash...</td>', 'Great picture - really like how the sculpture is echoed in the clouds.  Might be improved by bringing up the shadows in the dinosaur - maybe a bit of fill flash...', '2004-05-06 19:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(702492, 74348, 16957, '<td valign="top">Nice observation and clever title. Unusually I like the border (don''t usually like them). Well exposed too.</td>', 'Nice observation and clever title. Unusually I like the border (don''t usually like them). Well exposed too.', '2004-05-06 19:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(702493, 74440, 21202, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  I don''t know what is cooling, but I love the colors, lines, perspective, and lighting.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  I don''t know what is cooling, but I love the colors, lines, perspective, and lighting.', '2004-05-06 19:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(702494, 74034, 19608, '<td valign="top">Definitely rusted.  Nice textures and lines.  You are the victim of being one of many, many "chain link" images so competition is tough.  The best advise I''d offer on your entry is to do the exact same thing again when you have some dramatic lighting.  The flat lighting here nakes it pretty mundane.</td>', 'Definitely rusted.  Nice textures and lines.  You are the victim of being one of many, many "chain link" images so competition is tough.  The best advise I''d offer on your entry is to do the exact same thing again when you have some dramatic lighting.  The flat lighting here nakes it pretty mundane.', '2004-05-06 19:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(702495, 74374, 17166, '<td valign="top">Composition, lighting, depth of field all nicely done.  Good mood in this photo.</td>', 'Composition, lighting, depth of field all nicely done.  Good mood in this photo.', '2004-05-06 19:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(702496, 73870, 17166, '<td valign="top">Bad, bad pun.  Was this shot underwater?  The clouds of rust give this a very light, atmospheric feel - different than a lot of the pictures in this challenge.  I like it.</td>', 'Bad, bad pun.  Was this shot underwater?  The clouds of rust give this a very light, atmospheric feel - different than a lot of the pictures in this challenge.  I like it.', '2004-05-06 19:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(702497, 73536, 16957, '<td valign="top">Pity this is out of focus.</td>', 'Pity this is out of focus.', '2004-05-06 19:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(702499, 74374, 21202, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF, nice framing/cropping.  Perhaps a limited market, but I can see it hanging on the walls of factories and appearing as a magazine illustration.  Good job.</td>', 'Good use of DOF, nice framing/cropping.  Perhaps a limited market, but I can see it hanging on the walls of factories and appearing as a magazine illustration.  Good job.', '2004-05-06 19:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(702500, 73321, 16957, '<td valign="top">Excellent observation and a nice depth. So much interest to compell the viewer and well exposed. Good work.</td>', 'Excellent observation and a nice depth. So much interest to compell the viewer and well exposed. Good work.', '2004-05-06 19:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(702504, 74435, 17166, '<td valign="top">Hmm, the color is rusty, but the nail has a very smooth texture that''s emphasized by the catchlights, and that doesn''t give a very rusty feel at all.  Odd but visually interesting photo.</td>', 'Hmm, the color is rusty, but the nail has a very smooth texture that''s emphasized by the catchlights, and that doesn''t give a very rusty feel at all.  Odd but visually interesting photo.', '2004-05-06 19:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(702505, 73781, 21202, '<td valign="top">Too wide an aperture for me.</td>', 'Too wide an aperture for me.', '2004-05-06 19:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(702507, 74346, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your image, intentional or not, is an optical illusion.  Sometimes it looks like the ruty area is the object and other times like the green area is the object.  Nice rust and texture therin.  If you rotate it 90 degrees counter clockwise it may be a stronger image - kinda like a human figure.  If you re-shoot try to tone down the background a bit by making those bright yellow / orange objects fall into a shadowed area.</td>', 'Your image, intentional or not, is an optical illusion.  Sometimes it looks like the ruty area is the object and other times like the green area is the object.  Nice rust and texture therin.  If you rotate it 90 degrees counter clockwise it may be a stronger image - kinda like a human figure.  If you re-shoot try to tone down the background a bit by making those bright yellow / orange objects fall into a shadowed area.', '2004-05-06 19:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(702508, 74289, 18834, '<td valign="top">Good photo, in focus.</td>', 'Good photo, in focus.', '2004-05-06 19:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(702509, 74527, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is one of the only "rusted items out in a field" shots that I really like.  The colors and tones really are interesting and the composition is good.  A bit out of focus, but a good shot.</td>', 'This is one of the only "rusted items out in a field" shots that I really like.  The colors and tones really are interesting and the composition is good.  A bit out of focus, but a good shot.', '2004-05-06 19:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(702510, 73299, 21202, '<td valign="top">I just do not find this interesting.  Others may.</td>', 'I just do not find this interesting.  Others may.', '2004-05-06 19:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(702511, 73506, 17166, '<td valign="top">Classic photo.  I''ve seen some bleached wood out in the west that is very close to that shade of grey, which makes me wonder if this has been desaturated or if it really was that color.</td>', 'Classic photo.  I''ve seen some bleached wood out in the west that is very close to that shade of grey, which makes me wonder if this has been desaturated or if it really was that color.', '2004-05-06 19:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(702512, 74490, 18349, '<td valign="top">Clever...very clever.  I wish we could see the rusted object you''ve composed your picture around a bit better, but I give you props for originality.</td>', 'Clever...very clever.  I wish we could see the rusted object you''ve composed your picture around a bit better, but I give you props for originality.', '2004-05-06 19:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(702513, 74357, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and beautiful lighting on the cement building.  Too bad the rusted object is in shadow.</td>', 'Nice composition and beautiful lighting on the cement building.  Too bad the rusted object is in shadow.', '2004-05-06 19:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(702514, 74230, 16957, '<td valign="top">The colours appear to be over-saturated. Maybe I''m wrong. I''ll assume I am wrong! nice colours.</td>', 'The colours appear to be over-saturated. Maybe I''m wrong. I''ll assume I am wrong! nice colours.', '2004-05-06 19:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(702515, 73676, 18834, '<td valign="top">good subject focus</td>', 'good subject focus', '2004-05-06 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(702518, 74404, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern in the wood.  Very nice.<br/>BTW...your title sounds like two new band names..."next week at American Airlines Center..Moldy Wood with opening act Rusty Nails!"</td>', 'I like the pattern in the wood.  Very nice.BTW...your title sounds like two new band names..."next week at American Airlines Center..Moldy Wood with opening act Rusty Nails!"', '2004-05-06 19:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(702519, 74354, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.  Original subject, great color, love the lighting/shadows...one of my top three ratings!!!</td>', 'Nice framing.  Original subject, great color, love the lighting/shadows...one of my top three ratings!!!', '2004-05-06 19:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(702520, 73935, 18834, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, and it would have been better with less lighting.</td>', 'Out of focus, and it would have been better with less lighting.', '2004-05-06 19:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(702521, 73483, 17166, '<td valign="top">The Case logo looks too fresh and modern and spoils the mood a bit.  Nice composition otherwise.</td>', 'The Case logo looks too fresh and modern and spoils the mood a bit.  Nice composition otherwise.', '2004-05-06 19:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(702522, 74268, 18349, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this shot.  The colors are wonderful and the composition is terrific.  Who would have ever thought an old board and rusty wires/nails could be beautiful?  Great job.  One of my top three.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this shot.  The colors are wonderful and the composition is terrific.  Who would have ever thought an old board and rusty wires/nails could be beautiful?  Great job.  One of my top three.', '2004-05-06 19:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(702523, 74461, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the rubber wheel with the bicycle like chain.  Just a little too much light.  A very small aperture would not hurt this photo a bit.  Everything is interesting.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the rubber wheel with the bicycle like chain.  Just a little too much light.  A very small aperture would not hurt this photo a bit.  Everything is interesting.', '2004-05-06 19:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(702524, 74378, 18349, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Flat tire adds a nice touch.  Lighting and angle work well for this one, I think.  Good luck!  :0)</td>', 'Good shot.  Flat tire adds a nice touch.  Lighting and angle work well for this one, I think.  Good luck!  :0)', '2004-05-06 19:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(702525, 74293, 19507, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between teh delicate flower and the rusty chain (?).  Good detail and color.</td>', 'Nice contrast between teh delicate flower and the rusty chain (?).  Good detail and color.', '2004-05-06 19:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(702526, 74094, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting image with nice colors.  There just enough reflections on the water to add some impact.  On the other hand the white spots on the water upper left detract a bit.  Title''s play on words is choice.</td>', 'Interesting image with nice colors.  There just enough reflections on the water to add some impact.  On the other hand the white spots on the water upper left detract a bit.  Title''s play on words is choice.', '2004-05-06 19:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(702527, 74051, 17166, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  Might be nicer if cropped more tightly - i.e. cut off the sky.</td>', 'Great subject!  Might be nicer if cropped more tightly - i.e. cut off the sky.', '2004-05-06 19:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(702528, 74060, 18349, '<td valign="top">I love this composition.  The colors and the mood are just really cool.  I would crop a tad off the top, and maybe tweak the levels a bit as the white leaves/flowers are a bit hot, but it''s a great shot.</td>', 'I love this composition.  The colors and the mood are just really cool.  I would crop a tad off the top, and maybe tweak the levels a bit as the white leaves/flowers are a bit hot, but it''s a great shot.', '2004-05-06 19:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(702530, 74044, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Love the warmth and composition.  Good work!</td>', 'Nice shot.  Love the warmth and composition.  Good work!', '2004-05-06 19:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(702533, 74524, 19507, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any rust in this shot, but I like the simple composition and colors.</td>', 'I don''t see any rust in this shot, but I like the simple composition and colors.', '2004-05-06 19:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(702534, 74199, 19608, '<td valign="top">Simple yet effective.  Great colors and texture.  While a black border is probably appropriate for this image - it''s way too big for me.</td>', 'Simple yet effective.  Great colors and texture.  While a black border is probably appropriate for this image - it''s way too big for me.', '2004-05-06 19:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(702535, 74500, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is one of those great illusions where at first I was looking at a convex surface only on closer examination to find the surface concave.  Good photo quality throughout and good composition.  Belongs on someone''s wall somewhere.</td>', 'This is one of those great illusions where at first I was looking at a convex surface only on closer examination to find the surface concave.  Good photo quality throughout and good composition.  Belongs on someone''s wall somewhere.', '2004-05-06 19:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(702536, 73790, 18349, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.   The warm colors, the framing...it''s just a great shot!  Hope it places well.</td>', 'I really like this image.   The warm colors, the framing...it''s just a great shot!  Hope it places well.', '2004-05-06 19:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(702538, 74498, 17166, '<td valign="top">Would like this better if the whole thing were in sharp focus.  The blurring of the impeller suggests motion - but the title and the rust imply something that''s lifeless and immobile.</td>', 'Would like this better if the whole thing were in sharp focus.  The blurring of the impeller suggests motion - but the title and the rust imply something that''s lifeless and immobile.', '2004-05-06 19:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(702539, 73406, 19507, '<td valign="top">Interesting patterns and I like your use of the clouds and sky as the backdrop.</td>', 'Interesting patterns and I like your use of the clouds and sky as the backdrop.', '2004-05-06 19:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(702540, 74034, 16957, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the lighting in this photo - appears to be a harsh flash. it has the effect of flattening the colours and rendering an otherwise interesting image less so.</td>', 'I don''t like the lighting in this photo - appears to be a harsh flash. it has the effect of flattening the colours and rendering an otherwise interesting image less so.', '2004-05-06 19:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(702543, 74428, 17166, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge so far, and not just because it''s one of my favorite drinks.  Only criticism is the dust on the glass.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge so far, and not just because it''s one of my favorite drinks.  Only criticism is the dust on the glass.', '2004-05-06 19:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(702544, 74021, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but lighting is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Interesting, but lighting is a bit harsh.', '2004-05-06 19:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(702545, 74143, 21202, '<td valign="top">Seems like a great vacation snapshot.  Both the foreground and the background lack interest and the elephant itself seems more a curiosity than an object worthy of more than a passing interest.</td>', 'Seems like a great vacation snapshot.  Both the foreground and the background lack interest and the elephant itself seems more a curiosity than an object worthy of more than a passing interest.', '2004-05-06 19:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(702546, 73528, 19608, '<td valign="top">Effective composition, lines, texture, colors.  The black between your shapes makes the rusted color pop.  If you need a border at all (which I doubt) - my guess is that it should match the black color in the image.  This one competes with your subject matter.</td>', 'Effective composition, lines, texture, colors.  The black between your shapes makes the rusted color pop.  If you need a border at all (which I doubt) - my guess is that it should match the black color in the image.  This one competes with your subject matter.', '2004-05-06 19:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(702547, 73335, 17166, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit too over-processed.  Like the way the title fits the photo.</td>', 'Looks a bit too over-processed.  Like the way the title fits the photo.', '2004-05-06 19:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(702548, 74258, 19208, '<td valign="top">very good effort i think one horse ? may have been better</td>', 'very good effort i think one horse ? may have been better', '2004-05-06 19:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(702550, 73777, 19208, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2004-05-06 19:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(702551, 74351, 19208, '<td valign="top">brilliant</td>', 'brilliant', '2004-05-06 19:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(702552, 74029, 19507, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that instead of just taking a shot of rust, you have found a way to include another main subject, but include the rust in the surroundings.  Makes a more interesting shot than many.</td>', 'I like the fact that instead of just taking a shot of rust, you have found a way to include another main subject, but include the rust in the surroundings.  Makes a more interesting shot than many.', '2004-05-06 19:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(702553, 74433, 21202, '<td valign="top">Here strong light and well defined shadows really work together well as does the color of glaze and rust.  I like the forms, light, depth of field, and overall composition.  Very nice image. A 9 in my book.</td>', 'Here strong light and well defined shadows really work together well as does the color of glaze and rust.  I like the forms, light, depth of field, and overall composition.  Very nice image. A 9 in my book.', '2004-05-06 19:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(702554, 74496, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and punny title.  The catchlights make it look a bit too smooth and shiny for something that''s rusted out</td>', 'Nice composition and punny title.  The catchlights make it look a bit too smooth and shiny for something that''s rusted out', '2004-05-06 19:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(702556, 74421, 19208, '<td valign="top">to me the red is to out standing</td>', 'to me the red is to out standing', '2004-05-06 19:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(702557, 74144, 17166, '<td valign="top">Really like this photo - great composition and use of selective desaturation.</td>', 'Really like this photo - great composition and use of selective desaturation.', '2004-05-06 19:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(702558, 74412, 19507, '<td valign="top">Could use a little more sharpness and contrast, but I like that you have included the snail, instead of just a shot of the rusty pickaxe.</td>', 'Could use a little more sharpness and contrast, but I like that you have included the snail, instead of just a shot of the rusty pickaxe.', '2004-05-06 19:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(702559, 73753, 19208, '<td valign="top">to much colour and not enough rust</td>', 'to much colour and not enough rust', '2004-05-06 19:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(702561, 74455, 5354, '<td valign="top">I find the perspective of the rail quite nice, but the dof, the overexposed sea and the very dark foreground really let it down. I''m sure there was a better photo here. Jow many different angles and exposures did you try ?.<br/></td>', 'I find the perspective of the rail quite nice, but the dof, the overexposed sea and the very dark foreground really let it down. I''m sure there was a better photo here. Jow many different angles and exposures did you try ?.', '2004-05-06 19:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(702564, 73692, 17166, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition and use of shallow depth of feel.  This photo really feels three dimensional, almost like the wire is springing out of the photo.</td>', 'Fantastic composition and use of shallow depth of feel.  This photo really feels three dimensional, almost like the wire is springing out of the photo.', '2004-05-06 19:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(702567, 73526, 21202, '<td valign="top">The greens are a little on the idyllic side, but the colors of the barks, rust, and water ring true.  I guess just idyllic conditions of light and time of year.  The framing on the right hand side is obviously difficult.  From what I can see moving the side in to the left might work. I think I would love to play this course.  It should appeal to almost any golfer or lover of fairy tales.  You get a 9 from me.</td>', 'The greens are a little on the idyllic side, but the colors of the barks, rust, and water ring true.  I guess just idyllic conditions of light and time of year.  The framing on the right hand side is obviously difficult.  From what I can see moving the side in to the left might work. I think I would love to play this course.  It should appeal to almost any golfer or lover of fairy tales.  You get a 9 from me.', '2004-05-06 19:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(702568, 74340, 5354, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry I can''t find anything positive about this image, and I have tried.<br/>I don''t like the out of focus, indistinguishable ''object'', the central or nrear central positioning or the vignetting in the corners.</td>', 'I''m sorry I can''t find anything positive about this image, and I have tried.I don''t like the out of focus, indistinguishable ''object'', the central or nrear central positioning or the vignetting in the corners.', '2004-05-06 19:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(702571, 73610, 17166, '<td valign="top">Interesting question.  Was this deliberate soft focus to give an underwater look?  If so, I understand the intention but still would like it better with a bit more sharpness.</td>', 'Interesting question.  Was this deliberate soft focus to give an underwater look?  If so, I understand the intention but still would like it better with a bit more sharpness.', '2004-05-06 19:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(702572, 74045, 21202, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What vivid colors.  Having the blues on either side of the large expanse of rust really helps.  I am not much usually for abstract designs but this sure works for me.  A 10.</td>', 'Wow!  What vivid colors.  Having the blues on either side of the large expanse of rust really helps.  I am not much usually for abstract designs but this sure works for me.  A 10.', '2004-05-06 19:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(702573, 74044, 19507, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and detail.</td>', 'Nice texture and detail.', '2004-05-06 19:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(702574, 74496, 21202, '<td valign="top">Sorry.  Not my cup of tea.</td>', 'Sorry.  Not my cup of tea.', '2004-05-06 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(702575, 73456, 17166, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast between the rusted whatever-it-is and the flowers.</td>', 'Very nice contrast between the rusted whatever-it-is and the flowers.', '2004-05-06 19:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(702576, 73796, 17166, '<td valign="top">I like the color saturation and choice of subject here, but feel it could be improved with a tighter crop and more sharpness.</td>', 'I like the color saturation and choice of subject here, but feel it could be improved with a tighter crop and more sharpness.', '2004-05-06 19:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(702578, 74421, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject.  It''s more than just a "gratuitous rusted object"</td>', 'Nice choice of subject.  It''s more than just a "gratuitous rusted object"', '2004-05-06 19:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(702582, 73456, 19507, '<td valign="top">Nice addition of color to create more interest in the shot.</td>', 'Nice addition of color to create more interest in the shot.', '2004-05-06 19:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(702583, 73962, 17166, '<td valign="top">The rope/net in the upper right helps bring a nautical context to this rusted anchor.  Looks a little blown out, would like to see more detail in that part of the photo.</td>', 'The rope/net in the upper right helps bring a nautical context to this rusted anchor.  Looks a little blown out, would like to see more detail in that part of the photo.', '2004-05-06 19:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(702584, 74393, 21202, '<td valign="top">Not sure what your intent here is other than to show a dam for the generation of electricity with a small amount of rusting of some of the metal.  It has a snapshot quality and an overall faded appearance.    A different point of view which would use the falls as a backdrop for a foreground rusting part would work far better than this look straight down the top of the dam. It is too short for perspective to be interesting.  Some post processing that would enhance the colors and the contrast would also help.</td>', 'Not sure what your intent here is other than to show a dam for the generation of electricity with a small amount of rusting of some of the metal.  It has a snapshot quality and an overall faded appearance.    A different point of view which would use the falls as a backdrop for a foreground rusting part would work far better than this look straight down the top of the dam. It is too short for perspective to be interesting.  Some post processing that would enhance the colors and the contrast would also help.', '2004-05-06 19:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(702585, 73095, 19507, '<td valign="top">Interesting patterns and composition.</td>', 'Interesting patterns and composition.', '2004-05-06 19:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(702586, 73510, 17166, '<td valign="top">I find I like "follow the path through the photo" pictures better if the main line is more diagonal - maybe that''s just me.  Like the choice of subject.</td>', 'I find I like "follow the path through the photo" pictures better if the main line is more diagonal - maybe that''s just me.  Like the choice of subject.', '2004-05-06 19:48:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(702587, 74229, 21202, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of rust.  I feel like I am looking up at the bottom of something or the photo is upside down.  This one is okay, but does not blow me away.</td>', 'Interesting use of rust.  I feel like I am looking up at the bottom of something or the photo is upside down.  This one is okay, but does not blow me away.', '2004-05-06 19:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(702588, 73391, 19507, '<td valign="top">Good use of color to contrast with the rust.  The age of the rose complements the the rough rusty service fairly well.</td>', 'Good use of color to contrast with the rust.  The age of the rose complements the the rough rusty service fairly well.', '2004-05-06 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(702590, 74278, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject.  I think I would like this better if more of the fence was included so that the rusted elements were more connected.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject.  I think I would like this better if more of the fence was included so that the rusted elements were more connected.', '2004-05-06 19:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(702591, 73399, 21202, '<td valign="top">An excellent point well made photographically.  Very nice point of view and framing.  Would hang well in every bike shop and garage in the world.</td>', 'An excellent point well made photographically.  Very nice point of view and framing.  Would hang well in every bike shop and garage in the world.', '2004-05-06 19:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(702592, 74115, 19507, '<td valign="top">Nice tones.  I like your inclusion of the sheep to add to the interest of the shot, rather than just showing us the rusted farm implement.</td>', 'Nice tones.  I like your inclusion of the sheep to add to the interest of the shot, rather than just showing us the rusted farm implement.', '2004-05-06 19:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(702594, 73724, 18202, '<td valign="top">Kinda hard to understand what we see here</td>', 'Kinda hard to understand what we see here', '2004-05-06 19:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
