(702784, 73987, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	7<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	5<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	3<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	5<br/>Your DOF is too shallow to show much else than the flower. The rust is not very visible. As clichéd as it may sound, Rule of Thirds would have made it a better picture, in this case placing the flower where the axis of the right third and the lower third of the picture meet.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	7Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	5How well does it meet the challenge:	3Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	5Your DOF is too shallow to show much else than the flower. The rust is not very visible. As clichéd as it may sound, Rule of Thirds would have made it a better picture, in this case placing the flower where the axis of the right third and the lower third of the picture meet.', '2004-05-06 21:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
