(702799, 74389, 21202, '<td valign="top">I usually do not like objects framed or cropped through the middle, but it works well on this lock.  The perspective of the stone fence behind the gate and the immediate interest of the chain on the gate really make an excellent composition.  The DOF is just right to minimize the uninteresting portions of the picture and the crisp focus on the foreground are near perfection. Very close to an outstanding picture.</td>', 'I usually do not like objects framed or cropped through the middle, but it works well on this lock.  The perspective of the stone fence behind the gate and the immediate interest of the chain on the gate really make an excellent composition.  The DOF is just right to minimize the uninteresting portions of the picture and the crisp focus on the foreground are near perfection. Very close to an outstanding picture.', '2004-05-06 21:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
