(702919, 74204, 17175, '<td valign="top">The incongruous nature of the medium lends a vague congruity in and of itself. Circulars of rust, in coupling with the unrusted ring, becomes the most tangible of congruosities. And it is this that detracted me.</td>', 'The incongruous nature of the medium lends a vague congruity in and of itself. Circulars of rust, in coupling with the unrusted ring, becomes the most tangible of congruosities. And it is this that detracted me.', '2004-05-06 22:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
