(703070, 73870, 21202, '<td valign="top">NIce experiment.  I think its time to go back to the drawing board though.  This just quite does not make it.  The patterns near the point of impact are too blurred by a fog of dust.  The outlying patterns are great.  The spring itself is so incongruous as an impacter, that another weapon ought to be considered.</td>', 'NIce experiment.  I think its time to go back to the drawing board though.  This just quite does not make it.  The patterns near the point of impact are too blurred by a fog of dust.  The outlying patterns are great.  The spring itself is so incongruous as an impacter, that another weapon ought to be considered.', '2004-05-06 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
