(703082, 74481, 21202, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell the pipe is that rusted.  You get a 10 from me.   Just because I think this is an outstanding picture in every way.  The white speck on the cloud would not be there if you could do local editing.  The light blue of the sky is just in the right place.  The union of the pipes is nicely lit.  The rock is aesthetically piled and presents lots of variations on a theme of hardness as do the watery shapes of the cloud formations overhead.  A 10.</td>', 'Can''t tell the pipe is that rusted.  You get a 10 from me.   Just because I think this is an outstanding picture in every way.  The white speck on the cloud would not be there if you could do local editing.  The light blue of the sky is just in the right place.  The union of the pipes is nicely lit.  The rock is aesthetically piled and presents lots of variations on a theme of hardness as do the watery shapes of the cloud formations overhead.  A 10.', '2004-05-06 23:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
