(703278, 73715, 18677, '<td valign="top">noisy.  i see little (blue?) dots on the right edge.  the fuzzy border bothers me a little.  to be honest, I really don''t like the colors in this picture.. they make it a little depressing to look at.  but it succeeds in provoking an emotional response, and that alone is worth several points</td>', 'noisy.  i see little (blue?) dots on the right edge.  the fuzzy border bothers me a little.  to be honest, I really don''t like the colors in this picture.. they make it a little depressing to look at.  but it succeeds in provoking an emotional response, and that alone is worth several points', '2004-05-07 01:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(703280, 73071, 21158, '<td valign="top">nice concept  ..8</td>', 'nice concept  ..8', '2004-05-07 01:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
