(703474, 74027, 18552, '<td valign="top">Excellent color and texture. If more of this were in focus I''d like it a lot, as it is I feel frustrated by looking at it, wishing it would clear up so I could see this chain.</td>', 'Excellent color and texture. If more of this were in focus I''d like it a lot, as it is I feel frustrated by looking at it, wishing it would clear up so I could see this chain.', '2004-05-07 02:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(703477, 73492, 18552, '<td valign="top">Excellent color and focus. I don''t really like this kind of spoof though, it makes me very uncomfortable to see a gun pointed at someone''s head, even in jest and even though it''s an old rusted gun.</td>', 'Excellent color and focus. I don''t really like this kind of spoof though, it makes me very uncomfortable to see a gun pointed at someone''s head, even in jest and even though it''s an old rusted gun.', '2004-05-07 02:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(703481, 74316, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture would have been fabulous if you had left out the stuffed animal. The rusted metal is fantastic, it really has some sort of strength and power to it and would have been wonderful on it''s own.</td>', 'Your picture would have been fabulous if you had left out the stuffed animal. The rusted metal is fantastic, it really has some sort of strength and power to it and would have been wonderful on it''s own.', '2004-05-07 02:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
