(703484, 73987, 18552, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors. The only thing in focus is the dandelion and it''s very frustrating to look at the picture - my eyes would like ti to clear up so I can see the whole thing.</td>', 'Lovely colors. The only thing in focus is the dandelion and it''s very frustrating to look at the picture - my eyes would like ti to clear up so I can see the whole thing.', '2004-05-07 02:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
