(703698, 74227, 20070, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you wanted the horizon tilted so much. I also wonder if the shot might be improved by aiming to the left slightly - adding that rock to the left of the frame. I really like the shot though, especially how the wreck fits perfectly with the cloudy gloomy look that would spoil most other pictures. The blur in the waves also fits the picture well. good job.</td>', 'I don''t understand why you wanted the horizon tilted so much. I also wonder if the shot might be improved by aiming to the left slightly - adding that rock to the left of the frame. I really like the shot though, especially how the wreck fits perfectly with the cloudy gloomy look that would spoil most other pictures. The blur in the waves also fits the picture well. good job.', '2004-05-07 08:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
