(703788, 74280, 15152, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, the rust color against the steel, lighting is good too.<br/> <br/>It looks like the "tip" is out of focus. A bit more DOF would have captured it. It''s a bit grainy, maybe a bit lower ISO. The texture from the rust blends in with the white background. A nice smooth background would have given you a good contrast and really made the rust, "Pop" out.<br/></td>', 'I like the perspective, the rust color against the steel, lighting is good too. It looks like the "tip" is out of focus. A bit more DOF would have captured it. It''s a bit grainy, maybe a bit lower ISO. The texture from the rust blends in with the white background. A nice smooth background would have given you a good contrast and really made the rust, "Pop" out.', '2004-05-07 10:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
