(703815, 74374, 19841, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better with either more depth of field, or more of the blurry part cropped off at the top.  As it is, the perspective effect you seem to have been going for is lost with the focus.  Just cropping off the  white blurs at the top improves the composition greatly. (they are a bright distraction)</td>', 'I would have liked this better with either more depth of field, or more of the blurry part cropped off at the top.  As it is, the perspective effect you seem to have been going for is lost with the focus.  Just cropping off the  white blurs at the top improves the composition greatly. (they are a bright distraction)', '2004-05-07 10:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
