(704021, 73723, 15152, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. If I were to make any suggestions it would be to have tightened the shot on the rope/chains/bell. The rolled up sail in the upper left corner is distracting. It''s kind of a grey day and the background is uninteresting. If you pulled  in the shot you could have eliminated the sail, sky and minimized the background. Maybe positioned the bell in the upper left. But then agian I have no idea what you may have been avoiding below the photo.</td>', 'I like this shot. If I were to make any suggestions it would be to have tightened the shot on the rope/chains/bell. The rolled up sail in the upper left corner is distracting. It''s kind of a grey day and the background is uninteresting. If you pulled  in the shot you could have eliminated the sail, sky and minimized the background. Maybe positioned the bell in the upper left. But then agian I have no idea what you may have been avoiding below the photo.', '2004-05-07 12:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
