(704194, 74466, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	9	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	4	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	5	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	6	     Dick<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	9	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	4	How well does it meet the challenge:	5	Total Averaged Rating	6	     Dick', '2004-05-07 13:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(704195, 74159, 12573, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too flat.  You would have done well to soften the light and perhaps give it a yellowy hue.  Also, there is significant motion blur on the bottom of the left chain and the entire image is generally badly focused.  The composition is not so bad.  I might have even wanted to see less of the top and bottom of the image (i.e. cropped so just the breasts are in the frame).  The rings on the hands (and to an extent the hands themselves) are a distraction to the point being made, which is not altogether very clear to me.</td>', 'Lighting is too flat.  You would have done well to soften the light and perhaps give it a yellowy hue.  Also, there is significant motion blur on the bottom of the left chain and the entire image is generally badly focused.  The composition is not so bad.  I might have even wanted to see less of the top and bottom of the image (i.e. cropped so just the breasts are in the frame).  The rings on the hands (and to an extent the hands themselves) are a distraction to the point being made, which is not altogether very clear to me.', '2004-05-07 13:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(704196, 74294, 19831, '<td valign="top">seems kind of blurry. did you use a tripod? also i think the lighting is kind of bright.</td>', 'seems kind of blurry. did you use a tripod? also i think the lighting is kind of bright.', '2004-05-07 13:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
