(704935, 74172, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I would have liked it better if you cropped out the top part of the picture. It distracts from the subject.</td>', 'Nice shot. I would have liked it better if you cropped out the top part of the picture. It distracts from the subject.', '2004-05-07 21:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(704938, 73745, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting setup.</td>', 'Interesting setup.', '2004-05-07 21:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(704940, 73270, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured. Sharp and well placed.</td>', 'Nicely captured. Sharp and well placed.', '2004-05-07 21:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(704942, 73200, 3306, '<td valign="top">Definitley rusted but the picture is too busy.</td>', 'Definitley rusted but the picture is too busy.', '2004-05-07 21:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(704948, 74159, 19035, '<td valign="top">A very unique and original photo - with a great model, just a bit of better focus and this shot would be suberb, nice job.</td>', 'A very unique and original photo - with a great model, just a bit of better focus and this shot would be suberb, nice job.', '2004-05-07 21:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(704949, 73347, 20414, '<td valign="top">Extra credit for Socio-economic commentary.</td>', 'Extra credit for Socio-economic commentary.', '2004-05-07 21:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(704952, 74008, 20414, '<td valign="top">Oh sure, the old "Rusty nails as birthday candles" cliche''...</td>', 'Oh sure, the old "Rusty nails as birthday candles" cliche''...', '2004-05-07 21:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(704955, 74254, 806, '<td valign="top">clear, detailed, good exposure, neat angle. avg. interest level.</td>', 'clear, detailed, good exposure, neat angle. avg. interest level.', '2004-05-07 22:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(704957, 74294, 806, '<td valign="top">not sharp enough. subject matter has little interest value. needs more contrast too.</td>', 'not sharp enough. subject matter has little interest value. needs more contrast too.', '2004-05-07 22:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(704958, 74051, 19930, '<td valign="top">That building might need a root canal........</td>', 'That building might need a root canal........', '2004-05-07 22:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(704959, 74225, 20414, '<td valign="top">Distracting background.  Try narrower depth of field or shooting from lower point of view.  Could have been really good.</td>', 'Distracting background.  Try narrower depth of field or shooting from lower point of view.  Could have been really good.', '2004-05-07 22:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(704960, 72858, 806, '<td valign="top">nice to incorporate the flower to offset the subject. I think because of the use of DOF it becomes the subject. I like the curve  of the rusted object keeping me in the image though.</td>', 'nice to incorporate the flower to offset the subject. I think because of the use of DOF it becomes the subject. I like the curve  of the rusted object keeping me in the image though.', '2004-05-07 22:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(704961, 74446, 806, '<td valign="top">rythym, depth, contrast, cool geometrics.<br/>a tad over sharpened.</td>', 'rythym, depth, contrast, cool geometrics.a tad over sharpened.', '2004-05-07 22:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(704964, 74182, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting to view. becomes abstract.</td>', 'interesting to view. becomes abstract.', '2004-05-07 22:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(704965, 74302, 2978, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetric work. Only the candle holders are blended into the background. I think you could boost some top light. If you cannot work around od that, the other option is to lighten up the background to seperate it from the two.</td>', 'Nice symmetric work. Only the candle holders are blended into the background. I think you could boost some top light. If you cannot work around od that, the other option is to lighten up the background to seperate it from the two.', '2004-05-07 22:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(704966, 73237, 806, '<td valign="top">oversharpened. interesting subject. perhaps it needs less dof to isolate it from the background.</td>', 'oversharpened. interesting subject. perhaps it needs less dof to isolate it from the background.', '2004-05-07 22:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(704967, 74453, 19841, '<td valign="top">Is that rust, or lichen?</td>', 'Is that rust, or lichen?', '2004-05-07 22:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(704968, 74400, 806, '<td valign="top">there are so many opportunities for a close up of parts of this tractor. that would also eliminate the newer cars around it. right now it is a tractor.. a rusted one. could have more "feel".</td>', 'there are so many opportunities for a close up of parts of this tractor. that would also eliminate the newer cars around it. right now it is a tractor.. a rusted one. could have more "feel".', '2004-05-07 22:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(704974, 73140, 20414, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  Maybe even classic.  But completely off-topic.  8 or 9 if I could have found even a speck of rust somewhere.  Keep up the good work, though.</td>', 'Great photo!  Maybe even classic.  But completely off-topic.  8 or 9 if I could have found even a speck of rust somewhere.  Keep up the good work, though.', '2004-05-07 22:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(704977, 74029, 2978, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s a silvereye, isn''t it? Congrat for this capture. It''s not easy to get a shot like this.</td>', 'I guess it''s a silvereye, isn''t it? Congrat for this capture. It''s not easy to get a shot like this.', '2004-05-07 22:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(704983, 73506, 21330, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colours!</td>', 'Fantastic colours!', '2004-05-07 22:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(704988, 73233, 2978, '<td valign="top">Cute subject. I would look for some angles to present it in a different way, walking around, trying various background and moving back and forth.</td>', 'Cute subject. I would look for some angles to present it in a different way, walking around, trying various background and moving back and forth.', '2004-05-07 22:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(704989, 73237, 21330, '<td valign="top">Mayby a shallower dof would draw more attention to the wheel.</td>', 'Mayby a shallower dof would draw more attention to the wheel.', '2004-05-07 22:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(704990, 73618, 13305, '<td valign="top">I really like the human portion of this.  Good idea, well composed</td>', 'I really like the human portion of this.  Good idea, well composed', '2004-05-07 22:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(704992, 72858, 13305, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the flower for color.  So much of this challenge is simply red.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the flower for color.  So much of this challenge is simply red.', '2004-05-07 22:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(704994, 74429, 2978, '<td valign="top">Ah I like the way you interpret the challenge. It''s challenging isn''t it? The execution is fine.</td>', 'Ah I like the way you interpret the challenge. It''s challenging isn''t it? The execution is fine.', '2004-05-07 22:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(704995, 74522, 13305, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sculpture to be seen in Arizona.  I especially like the inclusion of other things to give scale.  Perhaps change to a more side view, but that''s minor. 10</td>', 'Looks like a sculpture to be seen in Arizona.  I especially like the inclusion of other things to give scale.  Perhaps change to a more side view, but that''s minor. 10', '2004-05-07 22:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(704996, 74209, 21330, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the point of focus is here?  Its a bit confusing to my eye.</td>', 'Not sure what the point of focus is here?  Its a bit confusing to my eye.', '2004-05-07 22:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(704998, 74096, 2978, '<td valign="top">Good macro shot. Great use of DOF. The space in the background makes it more interesting too. i could track to the right a bit just to hide the red post or to the left to get it out of the frame. Big distraction for the green background.</td>', 'Good macro shot. Great use of DOF. The space in the background makes it more interesting too. i could track to the right a bit just to hide the red post or to the left to get it out of the frame. Big distraction for the green background.', '2004-05-07 22:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(704999, 74342, 21330, '<td valign="top">wonderful colours, great contrast!!</td>', 'wonderful colours, great contrast!!', '2004-05-07 22:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(705000, 73233, 13305, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The flowers inject a much needed bit of color. The placement in front of a house, seperates it from the rural scenes making up most of the challenge entries. I might prefer a picture taken at a different time of day, particular if this view is from the east.  A sunrise photo would be awesom.  10</td>', 'I like this.  The flowers inject a much needed bit of color. The placement in front of a house, seperates it from the rural scenes making up most of the challenge entries. I might prefer a picture taken at a different time of day, particular if this view is from the east.  A sunrise photo would be awesom.  10', '2004-05-07 22:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(705002, 74221, 2978, '<td valign="top">Very well composed. I like you play with the diagonal lines here. Only it''s just too bight. Otherwise it''s cool</td>', 'Very well composed. I like you play with the diagonal lines here. Only it''s just too bight. Otherwise it''s cool', '2004-05-07 23:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(705003, 73649, 21330, '<td valign="top">Curious as to what this is. Sort of looks like a car tyre?  Great colours!</td>', 'Curious as to what this is. Sort of looks like a car tyre?  Great colours!', '2004-05-07 23:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(705014, 74253, 21330, '<td valign="top">Serious sense of depth...</td>', 'Serious sense of depth...', '2004-05-07 23:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
