(705324, 73754, 3936, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, shame you didn''t go larger on size to make it easier to see/judge.  But you''ve probably heard plenty of this by now.  Overall an interesting photo.  The wooden structure in the left foreground is a little distracting.  Good contrast.  6</td>', 'Interesting photo, shame you didn''t go larger on size to make it easier to see/judge.  But you''ve probably heard plenty of this by now.  Overall an interesting photo.  The wooden structure in the left foreground is a little distracting.  Good contrast.  6', '2004-05-08 04:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(705325, 74044, 3936, '<td valign="top">Man am I a sucker for pictures with texture and detail like this.  Saturation, contrast, lighting, all great.  Absolutely beautiful!  10!</td>', 'Man am I a sucker for pictures with texture and detail like this.  Saturation, contrast, lighting, all great.  Absolutely beautiful!  10!', '2004-05-08 04:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
