(705354, 74415, 21158, '<td valign="top">interesting.. Ilike it. Rusted but retaining its strenght. could have used a little fill flash to offset the shadows. 8</td>', 'interesting.. Ilike it. Rusted but retaining its strenght. could have used a little fill flash to offset the shadows. 8', '2004-05-08 05:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
