(705397, 73723, 9089, '<td valign="top">This looks like it has potential, but there is nothing that really draws my eye to focus on, in other words there are too many subjects, tighter crop with the bell at the top left third may have worked, mainly because the sail on the top left is making me look up at something that is not very interesting, instead of at the ropes, and really interesting stuff at the bottom right.</td>', 'This looks like it has potential, but there is nothing that really draws my eye to focus on, in other words there are too many subjects, tighter crop with the bell at the top left third may have worked, mainly because the sail on the top left is making me look up at something that is not very interesting, instead of at the ropes, and really interesting stuff at the bottom right.', '2004-05-08 07:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(705398, 74504, 9089, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you told me it wa a lizard because I doubt if I would have been able to recognize it.</td>', 'I''m glad you told me it wa a lizard because I doubt if I would have been able to recognize it.', '2004-05-08 07:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(705399, 73781, 9089, '<td valign="top">The purple edged triangle in the bottom left keeps drawing my focus.</td>', 'The purple edged triangle in the bottom left keeps drawing my focus.', '2004-05-08 07:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(705409, 74374, 9089, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see it either straight, or more diagonal, this is so close to straight, that it just seems crooked.</td>', 'I''d like to see it either straight, or more diagonal, this is so close to straight, that it just seems crooked.', '2004-05-08 07:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(705411, 74434, 20392, '<td valign="top">I love the photo, but docked a few points because the building in center came off as the subject to me, not the actual rusted object which was kind of what the challenge was about. =)</td>', 'I love the photo, but docked a few points because the building in center came off as the subject to me, not the actual rusted object which was kind of what the challenge was about. =)', '2004-05-08 07:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(705414, 74099, 4729, '<td valign="top">Nice find.!</td>', 'Nice find.!', '2004-05-08 08:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(705416, 74386, 9089, '<td valign="top">would have liked to see the lock in focus, as it is the true focal point of the picture, instead of the chain and hole in the background.</td>', 'would have liked to see the lock in focus, as it is the true focal point of the picture, instead of the chain and hole in the background.', '2004-05-08 08:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(705420, 74403, 4729, '<td valign="top">Where''s the rust? The fingers are distracting and blurred.</td>', 'Where''s the rust? The fingers are distracting and blurred.', '2004-05-08 08:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(705423, 74044, 16148, '<td valign="top">Great composition and striking image.  The black holes in the door/wall give your picture an element of mystery.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great composition and striking image.  The black holes in the door/wall give your picture an element of mystery.  Good luck!', '2004-05-08 08:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(705424, 74018, 16148, '<td valign="top">In my opinion you have the best rust macro shot.  Very nice composition!</td>', 'In my opinion you have the best rust macro shot.  Very nice composition!', '2004-05-08 08:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(705427, 73448, 3765, '<td valign="top">Sublime colours. Pity you didn''t get the wheel in front in. Think that would have added more to the composition. 7</td>', 'Sublime colours. Pity you didn''t get the wheel in front in. Think that would have added more to the composition. 7', '2004-05-08 08:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(705432, 73756, 3765, '<td valign="top">I find the image size rather small to be able to get a good view of the picture. Try a bit bigger next time if you can. As for the photo: it lacks contrast somewhat and I would crop out the left white blotch. Another tip: Next time when seeing a subject like this you could try to get closer and use the wide-angle of your camera. It will give you a more interesting picture. This of course if it is technically possible with your camera and the area you are working in.</td>', 'I find the image size rather small to be able to get a good view of the picture. Try a bit bigger next time if you can. As for the photo: it lacks contrast somewhat and I would crop out the left white blotch. Another tip: Next time when seeing a subject like this you could try to get closer and use the wide-angle of your camera. It will give you a more interesting picture. This of course if it is technically possible with your camera and the area you are working in.', '2004-05-08 08:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(705435, 73987, 13547, '<td valign="top">Too blurred for my liking, needs more focus on the rusty pipe</td>', 'Too blurred for my liking, needs more focus on the rusty pipe', '2004-05-08 08:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(705437, 73167, 13547, '<td valign="top">Interesting take, perhaps the picture relies too much on the title though.  Think it might be a little too sharp on the bug''s head, but that might be the light.</td>', 'Interesting take, perhaps the picture relies too much on the title though.  Think it might be a little too sharp on the bug''s head, but that might be the light.', '2004-05-08 08:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(705439, 73754, 13547, '<td valign="top">argh why isn''t it bigger!  looks fantastic but it''s too small!</td>', 'argh why isn''t it bigger!  looks fantastic but it''s too small!', '2004-05-08 08:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(705440, 74310, 13547, '<td valign="top">Great i dea, weather wasn''t on your side tho!  There''s something about the clarity of the heap itself that seems a little odd to me but I can''t put my finger on it.</td>', 'Great i dea, weather wasn''t on your side tho!  There''s something about the clarity of the heap itself that seems a little odd to me but I can''t put my finger on it.', '2004-05-08 08:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
