(705454, 74092, 11895, '<td valign="top">that''s a neat sculpture, definitely fits the challenge, but the shot is pretty plain and straight on, rule of thirds or maybe a lower to the ground point of view would have made it more interesting</td>', 'that''s a neat sculpture, definitely fits the challenge, but the shot is pretty plain and straight on, rule of thirds or maybe a lower to the ground point of view would have made it more interesting', '2004-05-08 09:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
