(705957, 74073, 21202, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be quite an interesting subject.  The lighting and contrast combine to make this image very muted.<br/> <br/>A 2.</td>', 'This looks like it could be quite an interesting subject.  The lighting and contrast combine to make this image very muted. A 2.', '2004-05-08 19:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
