(706039, 74351, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice work on foreground.  Reminds me of prow of ship.  But, one solid color for background, even if nearly right color for perfect contrast to rust?  It looks like the weather person on TV without the weather.<br/> <br/>A 7 for an excellent foreground.</td>', 'Nice work on foreground.  Reminds me of prow of ship.  But, one solid color for background, even if nearly right color for perfect contrast to rust?  It looks like the weather person on TV without the weather. A 7 for an excellent foreground.', '2004-05-08 20:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(706042, 73923, 21202, '<td valign="top">While well photographed, my interest in heaps of anonymous scrap metal has never been high, and looking at so many pictures of anonymous things rusting that interest has slightly ebbed.<br/> <br/>A 4 because of reasonably good photography although lighting could be immensely improved.</td>', 'While well photographed, my interest in heaps of anonymous scrap metal has never been high, and looking at so many pictures of anonymous things rusting that interest has slightly ebbed. A 4 because of reasonably good photography although lighting could be immensely improved.', '2004-05-08 20:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(706043, 73350, 21202, '<td valign="top">Your barrows got a hole in it and the circles of confusion surrounding background plants look very lovely.  The blue and rust colors combine well, and the back lighting you have achieved is excellent withou any sense of overexposure.<br/> <br/>A 10.  Well done.</td>', 'Your barrows got a hole in it and the circles of confusion surrounding background plants look very lovely.  The blue and rust colors combine well, and the back lighting you have achieved is excellent withou any sense of overexposure. A 10.  Well done.', '2004-05-08 20:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(706045, 73492, 18709, '<td valign="top">Thank the Lord for ''rust''.     Witty shot.</td>', 'Thank the Lord for ''rust''.     Witty shot.', '2004-05-08 20:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(706046, 74302, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very lovely work. I love this as it stands, but wonder how it would look if the queen could be more strongly lit.<br/> <br/>A 9.</td>', 'Very lovely work. I love this as it stands, but wonder how it would look if the queen could be more strongly lit. A 9.', '2004-05-08 20:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
