(706058, 74508, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very very nice.  The late afternoon shadow really helps with what would otherwise be too much negative space.  I fine inerest throughout.  The colors go together well.  This is one of the few entries to this competition that I could see hanging on someone''s wall.<br/> <br/>A 10.</td>', 'Very very nice.  The late afternoon shadow really helps with what would otherwise be too much negative space.  I fine inerest throughout.  The colors go together well.  This is one of the few entries to this competition that I could see hanging on someone''s wall. A 10.', '2004-05-08 20:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(706060, 74374, 18897, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what it is but it''s excellent use of shallow dof and you can''t meet the challenge better than this. The subject isn''t really that "interesting" though, however nice captured. No context. A good seven for me.</td>', 'Can''t tell what it is but it''s excellent use of shallow dof and you can''t meet the challenge better than this. The subject isn''t really that "interesting" though, however nice captured. No context. A good seven for me.', '2004-05-08 20:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
