(706062, 74182, 21202, '<td valign="top">Colors go together well.  Great lighting.  I just find that I do not find the subject itself very appealing.<br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'Colors go together well.  Great lighting.  I just find that I do not find the subject itself very appealing. A 6.', '2004-05-08 20:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
