(706078, 73528, 18897, '<td valign="top">Good one, whatever it is. Nice subtle border too. Had it been allowed, I''d cloned out the two small gaps. The top one steals my eye a bit.<br/> <br/>Really rusty indeed! 8!</td>', 'Good one, whatever it is. Nice subtle border too. Had it been allowed, I''d cloned out the two small gaps. The top one steals my eye a bit. Really rusty indeed! 8!', '2004-05-08 20:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(706079, 74230, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect use of evening sun.  I think you could have successfully cropped the tree at the left of the picture out. and taken the picture from just a slightly lower point of view to eliminate the shrubbery above the low middle section.<br/> <br/>A very lovely photograph.<br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'This is a perfect use of evening sun.  I think you could have successfully cropped the tree at the left of the picture out. and taken the picture from just a slightly lower point of view to eliminate the shrubbery above the low middle section. A very lovely photograph. An 8.', '2004-05-08 20:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(706080, 74029, 14476, '<td valign="top">These little guys are hard to get, and you did a good job!</td>', 'These little guys are hard to get, and you did a good job!', '2004-05-08 20:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(706081, 74400, 18709, '<td valign="top">A lot of this looks like verdigris, mixed with the rust.   Makes a good shot. (Prthaps it was just a green painted tractor), anyway, it is good.</td>', 'A lot of this looks like verdigris, mixed with the rust.   Makes a good shot. (Prthaps it was just a green painted tractor), anyway, it is good.', '2004-05-08 20:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
