(706084, 73347, 21202, '<td valign="top">A very interesting point of view, but the overall subject matter is not highly interesting or beautiful. The lighting is adequate, but the picture has a very muted feeling to it.<br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'A very interesting point of view, but the overall subject matter is not highly interesting or beautiful. The lighting is adequate, but the picture has a very muted feeling to it. A 4.', '2004-05-08 20:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(706087, 74511, 18709, '<td valign="top">No wonder it''s always cold, if the thermometer''s stuck.  Get it fixed.    Nice shot.  Glad you resisted the temptation to centre the  instrument.  Perhaps there is a shade TOO much blackness on the right, but I think it works.</td>', 'No wonder it''s always cold, if the thermometer''s stuck.  Get it fixed.    Nice shot.  Glad you resisted the temptation to centre the  instrument.  Perhaps there is a shade TOO much blackness on the right, but I think it works.', '2004-05-08 20:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(706089, 74054, 21202, '<td valign="top">I have complained over and over today about pictures which look up and leave us seeing only the unlit side of things.  Thanks for getting it so right.<br/> <br/>A 10.</td>', 'I have complained over and over today about pictures which look up and leave us seeing only the unlit side of things.  Thanks for getting it so right. A 10.', '2004-05-08 20:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(706090, 74516, 10339, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the way you have pulled out the red doors. IMO - the crop is a bit tight on the top. Would like to have seen the entire wind vane.</td>', 'Very nice. I love the way you have pulled out the red doors. IMO - the crop is a bit tight on the top. Would like to have seen the entire wind vane.', '2004-05-08 20:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
