(706092, 73344, 18897, '<td valign="top">Voiding the challenge in the title doesn''t do it for me. Even apart from that the shot doesn''t hold that much anyway.Could have been average with rust in it - but I''ll put this out of topic, sorry.</td>', 'Voiding the challenge in the title doesn''t do it for me. Even apart from that the shot doesn''t hold that much anyway.Could have been average with rust in it - but I''ll put this out of topic, sorry.', '2004-05-08 20:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
