(706111, 74057, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like this.   Something keeps it from being perfect for me, so I will blame the harsh lighting and time of day at which the shot was taken.<br/> <br/>Anyway, it is very close to perfection, a 9.</td>', 'I like this.   Something keeps it from being perfect for me, so I will blame the harsh lighting and time of day at which the shot was taken. Anyway, it is very close to perfection, a 9.', '2004-05-08 20:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
