(706113, 73907, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like the overall color and tones of the picutre.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like the overall color and tones of the picutre.', '2004-05-08 20:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(706114, 74509, 18709, '<td valign="top">What can I say that won''t incriminate me?    This is good fun, and a good shot too.<br/>We have to imagine  the rust.    (It doesn''t bear thinking about).</td>', 'What can I say that won''t incriminate me?    This is good fun, and a good shot too.We have to imagine  the rust.    (It doesn''t bear thinking about).', '2004-05-08 20:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(706116, 73938, 21202, '<td valign="top">Besides being overexposed, the colors are over saturated.  The compositon and subject matter look like this had the elements of a very interesting picture.<br/> <br/>A 3.</td>', 'Besides being overexposed, the colors are over saturated.  The compositon and subject matter look like this had the elements of a very interesting picture. A 3.', '2004-05-08 20:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(706117, 74092, 18709, '<td valign="top">A fabulous shot.  Well-placed.</td>', 'A fabulous shot.  Well-placed.', '2004-05-08 20:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(706119, 73342, 18897, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I''m thinking a bit more contrast, less light and perhaps saturate the blue tones a bit more? Good work!</td>', 'Nice shot. I''m thinking a bit more contrast, less light and perhaps saturate the blue tones a bit more? Good work!', '2004-05-08 20:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(706121, 73071, 10339, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite make out what is in focus here.</td>', 'I can''t quite make out what is in focus here.', '2004-05-08 20:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(706123, 74027, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is quite appealing.  I would prefer the focus to be on the very left most horizontal link and then let the chain fade into oblivion with distance.  <br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'This is quite appealing.  I would prefer the focus to be on the very left most horizontal link and then let the chain fade into oblivion with distance.   A 7.', '2004-05-08 20:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(706124, 74461, 18709, '<td valign="top">We will have to think up something better than iron to make things with because<br/>they all seem to end up looking like this.  It is sad to see things that were<br/>cherished and cared for just slung aside.  Good shot.</td>', 'We will have to think up something better than iron to make things with becausethey all seem to end up looking like this.  It is sad to see things that werecherished and cared for just slung aside.  Good shot.', '2004-05-08 20:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(706126, 73186, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice observation and nice pink eye story.  <br/> <br/>I like birds.  <br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'Nice observation and nice pink eye story.   I like birds.   A 6.', '2004-05-08 20:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(706127, 73745, 18709, '<td valign="top">Which is padlocked t which?  It''s a moot point.  Good contrast.</td>', 'Which is padlocked t which?  It''s a moot point.  Good contrast.', '2004-05-08 20:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(706128, 73483, 10339, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the composition. The focus seems a little soft. Perhaps some post-processing sharpening would help.</td>', 'I like the subject and the composition. The focus seems a little soft. Perhaps some post-processing sharpening would help.', '2004-05-08 20:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(706132, 74515, 10339, '<td valign="top">IMO - it appears that the camera focused on the vine in front of the main subject.</td>', 'IMO - it appears that the camera focused on the vine in front of the main subject.', '2004-05-08 20:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(706133, 73777, 21202, '<td valign="top">This composition does not work for me.  I certainly like the needlenose pliers lying on the spanner, and the readable print of the book or magazine cover is also appealing.  That leaves the plastic screwdriver handles, but they seem important to the shot as well.  The lighting, focus, and picture processing are all excellent.<br/> <br/>So, you get a 7 with my apologies for not knowing why I did not give you more.</td>', 'This composition does not work for me.  I certainly like the needlenose pliers lying on the spanner, and the readable print of the book or magazine cover is also appealing.  That leaves the plastic screwdriver handles, but they seem important to the shot as well.  The lighting, focus, and picture processing are all excellent. So, you get a 7 with my apologies for not knowing why I did not give you more.', '2004-05-08 20:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(706139, 74008, 10339, '<td valign="top">That is great! Love the concept!</td>', 'That is great! Love the concept!', '2004-05-08 20:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(706140, 73463, 21202, '<td valign="top">I would like this picture better without so much sky. I also would have liked it better if it were taken while the sun still lit the engine.  Unfortunately bullet holes remind me of the tears of those who have lost loved ones in all of human conflicts, not a pair of endearing thiefs.<br/> <br/>A 5.</td>', 'I would like this picture better without so much sky. I also would have liked it better if it were taken while the sun still lit the engine.  Unfortunately bullet holes remind me of the tears of those who have lost loved ones in all of human conflicts, not a pair of endearing thiefs. A 5.', '2004-05-08 20:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(706144, 74534, 21202, '<td valign="top">The ground does not offer much contrast for the ankles and feet.  Maybe taking th picture from ground level would help.  That would also emphasize the height of a bird designed to be tall.  The lighting could also be improved.<br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'The ground does not offer much contrast for the ankles and feet.  Maybe taking th picture from ground level would help.  That would also emphasize the height of a bird designed to be tall.  The lighting could also be improved. A 4.', '2004-05-08 20:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(706147, 74056, 10339, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured and framed.</td>', 'Very nicely captured and framed.', '2004-05-08 20:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(706148, 74029, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.    The lighting is a little harsh on the tile in the background and the shadow across the chest is also unfortunate.<br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'Very lovely.    The lighting is a little harsh on the tile in the background and the shadow across the chest is also unfortunate. A 6.', '2004-05-08 20:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(706151, 74281, 21202, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what I am looking at but it is lovely.  Reminds me of a salmon filet with green garnish.  I would have liked the lower left corner to be as well exposed as the rest of the picture, but something seems to be casting a shadow over my desires.<br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'I don''t know what I am looking at but it is lovely.  Reminds me of a salmon filet with green garnish.  I would have liked the lower left corner to be as well exposed as the rest of the picture, but something seems to be casting a shadow over my desires. An 8.', '2004-05-08 21:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(706152, 73791, 10339, '<td valign="top">IMO - the cropping is a bit close on the top and left. Would like to have seen the entire pot.</td>', 'IMO - the cropping is a bit close on the top and left. Would like to have seen the entire pot.', '2004-05-08 21:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(706154, 73106, 13223, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, it is really intersting. Great composition!</td>', 'I love this photo, it is really intersting. Great composition!', '2004-05-08 21:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(706155, 73708, 21202, '<td valign="top">I feel this could have been composed so as not to have the tree visually contacting the dancers.  Otherwise, I love subject and photo.<br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'I feel this could have been composed so as not to have the tree visually contacting the dancers.  Otherwise, I love subject and photo. A 6.', '2004-05-08 21:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(706156, 74353, 10339, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors from the grass to the sky to the subject.</td>', 'Wonderful colors from the grass to the sky to the subject.', '2004-05-08 21:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(706160, 74382, 17108, '<td valign="top">few too many shadows</td>', 'few too many shadows', '2004-05-08 21:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(706162, 74192, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I would crop out Nearly everything above the highest point on roof, everything to the left and right of roof.  The extraneous details detract from a what is a wonderful vintage scene.  I would also like to have seen a longer exposure.  There is not much moving here.<br/> <br/>A 5. Much higher if brighter and less distractions.</td>', 'Very nice.  I would crop out Nearly everything above the highest point on roof, everything to the left and right of roof.  The extraneous details detract from a what is a wonderful vintage scene.  I would also like to have seen a longer exposure.  There is not much moving here. A 5. Much higher if brighter and less distractions.', '2004-05-08 21:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(706165, 74272, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like seeing the world from the dog''s point of view.  Thanks for lying down on the job.   The train, builidings, telephone poles all add to locating this switch. Although it is near overexposure on the right, I feel the overall picture is a little too muted.<br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'I like seeing the world from the dog''s point of view.  Thanks for lying down on the job.   The train, builidings, telephone poles all add to locating this switch. Although it is near overexposure on the right, I feel the overall picture is a little too muted. An 8.', '2004-05-08 21:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(706166, 74394, 17108, '<td valign="top">I would have liked the rust to be a bit more prominent</td>', 'I would have liked the rust to be a bit more prominent', '2004-05-08 21:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(706168, 74225, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely picture that has a little too much distracting background.<br/> <br/>A 5.</td>', 'This is a lovely picture that has a little too much distracting background. A 5.', '2004-05-08 21:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(706170, 73801, 17108, '<td valign="top">The levels and saturation seem to be a bit high - the wall is lacking detail and the rust seems too bright orange.  Interesting subject.</td>', 'The levels and saturation seem to be a bit high - the wall is lacking detail and the rust seems too bright orange.  Interesting subject.', '2004-05-08 21:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(706174, 73233, 21202, '<td valign="top">The bench on the front fender and the building behind are distractions. The bench might be movable, and much of the building could be hidden by a different point of view and different cropping.  It is an excellent subject.  The building also results in the subject itself being underexposed.<br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'The bench on the front fender and the building behind are distractions. The bench might be movable, and much of the building could be hidden by a different point of view and different cropping.  It is an excellent subject.  The building also results in the subject itself being underexposed. A 4.', '2004-05-08 21:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(706175, 74502, 17108, '<td valign="top">nice way to naturally frame the photo</td>', 'nice way to naturally frame the photo', '2004-05-08 21:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(706178, 74307, 17108, '<td valign="top">the screw seems out of focus</td>', 'the screw seems out of focus', '2004-05-08 21:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(706179, 73528, 21202, '<td valign="top">This does not appeal to me.  Colors, shapes,shadows.  I can see that others might find it quite lovely.  I will give it a 5 though that is higher than its appeal to me.</td>', 'This does not appeal to me.  Colors, shapes,shadows.  I can see that others might find it quite lovely.  I will give it a 5 though that is higher than its appeal to me.', '2004-05-08 21:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(706181, 74225, 17108, '<td valign="top">should be a bit higher resolution photo - nice composition</td>', 'should be a bit higher resolution photo - nice composition', '2004-05-08 21:21:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(706182, 73907, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  How fortunate not to have clutter around building that requires cropping.  I get a real sense of prairie by the surrounding space.<br/> <br/>Exposure, focus, sharpening, noise filtration all superb.<br/> <br/>A 10.</td>', 'Very nice.  How fortunate not to have clutter around building that requires cropping.  I get a real sense of prairie by the surrounding space. Exposure, focus, sharpening, noise filtration all superb. A 10.', '2004-05-08 21:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(706183, 74268, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice.<br/> <br/>A 10.</td>', 'Very nice. A 10.', '2004-05-08 21:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(706186, 73457, 21202, '<td valign="top">My sympathies. Hope spring arrives soon.  A little muted even for late winter.<br/> <br/>A litlle tighter cropping at the bottom would not hurt.  The ground itself is not that appealing.<br/> <br/>A 5.</td>', 'My sympathies. Hope spring arrives soon.  A little muted even for late winter. A litlle tighter cropping at the bottom would not hurt.  The ground itself is not that appealing. A 5.', '2004-05-08 21:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(706187, 74491, 17108, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, the powerline is distracting</td>', 'I like the angle, the powerline is distracting', '2004-05-08 21:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(706190, 74268, 17108, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2004-05-08 21:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(706191, 74490, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of can.  This needs far more depth of field for the title to be confirmed.  I am also curious as to what this would look like at a much faster shutter speed.  The spray now looks much like the human eye perceives it.  What does it look like on a drop by drop basis?  It appears that you have a camera capable of answering that question.<br/> <br/>An 8 because the can is really marvellous.</td>', 'Nice shot of can.  This needs far more depth of field for the title to be confirmed.  I am also curious as to what this would look like at a much faster shutter speed.  The spray now looks much like the human eye perceives it.  What does it look like on a drop by drop basis?  It appears that you have a camera capable of answering that question. An 8 because the can is really marvellous.', '2004-05-08 21:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(706192, 74353, 21202, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  I hope all those others with farm equipment will learn from this shot.<br/> <br/>A 10.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  I hope all those others with farm equipment will learn from this shot. A 10.', '2004-05-08 21:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(706193, 74399, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and cropped.<br/> <br/>An 8, simply because of limited complexity and shadowed right eye.</td>', 'Nicely lit and cropped. An 8, simply because of limited complexity and shadowed right eye.', '2004-05-08 21:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(706194, 73171, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is just one of those things which rust unattractively.  The photo may be a tad overexposed, but I don''t know that there would be anyway of making this subject appealing.  Wonderful historic piece though.</td>', 'This is just one of those things which rust unattractively.  The photo may be a tad overexposed, but I don''t know that there would be anyway of making this subject appealing.  Wonderful historic piece though.', '2004-05-08 21:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(706196, 74469, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and lighting.<br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'Nice pose and lighting. A 7.', '2004-05-08 21:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(706197, 74092, 21202, '<td valign="top">To be more artful, I believe greater selection of what to include and what to exclude must be taken into consideration.  The lighting on the face of the miner also unhighlights the key element here.  I like the buildings and mountains in the background.  All I can really suggest is to take this from a lower point of view and frame out the left, bottom, and right edges.</td>', 'To be more artful, I believe greater selection of what to include and what to exclude must be taken into consideration.  The lighting on the face of the miner also unhighlights the key element here.  I like the buildings and mountains in the background.  All I can really suggest is to take this from a lower point of view and frame out the left, bottom, and right edges.', '2004-05-08 21:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(706205, 73350, 19841, '<td valign="top">I wish there were more contrast between the foreground and the background.  Even though it is focused, the background keeps trying to be part of the front texture.  Something as simple as propping up a piece of dark paper behind the hole might have made this much more dynamic.</td>', 'I wish there were more contrast between the foreground and the background.  Even though it is focused, the background keeps trying to be part of the front texture.  Something as simple as propping up a piece of dark paper behind the hole might have made this much more dynamic.', '2004-05-08 21:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(706208, 73483, 19841, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a little out of focus.   On some things a soft focus is nice, but it doesn''t work on this.  Machinery looks better with crisp, hard edges.</td>', 'This seems to be a little out of focus.   On some things a soft focus is nice, but it doesn''t work on this.  Machinery looks better with crisp, hard edges.', '2004-05-08 22:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(706214, 74440, 19670, '<td valign="top">Looks like Jupiter...</td>', 'Looks like Jupiter...', '2004-05-08 22:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
