(706304, 73502, 18485, '<td valign="top">great subject, well composed.  exposure is off: too bright in the upper left, to dull in the near ground.</td>', 'great subject, well composed.  exposure is off: too bright in the upper left, to dull in the near ground.', '2004-05-08 23:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(706308, 73106, 18485, '<td valign="top">love the negative space and good color contrasts.  nice work.</td>', 'love the negative space and good color contrasts.  nice work.', '2004-05-08 23:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(706322, 74536, 18147, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and lighting.</td>', 'I like the texture and lighting.', '2004-05-08 23:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(706324, 73790, 18147, '<td valign="top">Overall, the lighting is quite nice. However, I would like to have seen some very subtle light coming from the right somewhere to avoid making the shadows so heavy.</td>', 'Overall, the lighting is quite nice. However, I would like to have seen some very subtle light coming from the right somewhere to avoid making the shadows so heavy.', '2004-05-08 23:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(706337, 74144, 18147, '<td valign="top">This is one of the nicer shots in the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of the nicer shots in the challenge.', '2004-05-08 23:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(706345, 74239, 18147, '<td valign="top">Great exposure! The color of the sky works well with the rust color. The already strong composition could be made stronger still by cropping the right side just a little, to prevent the sky from going to the bottom edge. Try cropping it just to the left of where the right side of the pipe begins to curve. It helps the balance and keeps the curve of the pipe from overcoming the strong linear composition.</td>', 'Great exposure! The color of the sky works well with the rust color. The already strong composition could be made stronger still by cropping the right side just a little, to prevent the sky from going to the bottom edge. Try cropping it just to the left of where the right side of the pipe begins to curve. It helps the balance and keeps the curve of the pipe from overcoming the strong linear composition.', '2004-05-09 00:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(706350, 73949, 18147, '<td valign="top">The image has a nice abstract quality, with some subtle textural contrast.</td>', 'The image has a nice abstract quality, with some subtle textural contrast.', '2004-05-09 00:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(706352, 73921, 18868, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition!</td>', 'Very nice composition!', '2004-05-09 00:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(706356, 74227, 21516, '<td valign="top">A pity about the weather, colours would have been more interesting on a different day.</td>', 'A pity about the weather, colours would have been more interesting on a different day.', '2004-05-09 00:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(706357, 74386, 18868, '<td valign="top">Great title!  Perhaps for web viewing, a tad more unsharp masking would help.</td>', 'Great title!  Perhaps for web viewing, a tad more unsharp masking would help.', '2004-05-09 00:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(706359, 73644, 21516, '<td valign="top">Where''s the rust connection?</td>', 'Where''s the rust connection?', '2004-05-09 00:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(706361, 74124, 18147, '<td valign="top">I would have tried to take the picture when more natural light was available. Pictures exposed with only an on-camera flash almost never work. The harsh frontal lighting and the hard shadows make the image look like it is composed of three very flat planes. Cropping the top fourth from the image would help the composition dramatically.</td>', 'I would have tried to take the picture when more natural light was available. Pictures exposed with only an on-camera flash almost never work. The harsh frontal lighting and the hard shadows make the image look like it is composed of three very flat planes. Cropping the top fourth from the image would help the composition dramatically.', '2004-05-09 00:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(706362, 74228, 18677, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  Perfect focus on the chain.  Nice colors, nice blurred background.  Might be a little better if you used a slightly larger (or slightly smaller) DOF</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  Perfect focus on the chain.  Nice colors, nice blurred background.  Might be a little better if you used a slightly larger (or slightly smaller) DOF', '2004-05-09 00:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(706366, 73221, 20832, '<td valign="top">where is the rust?</td>', 'where is the rust?', '2004-05-09 00:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(706367, 74374, 18147, '<td valign="top">I like the visual rhythm and texture. The exposure level is right where it should be. The composition does cause a bit of visual stress though, as the lines tend to draw the eye away from the most interesting sharp texture and into the unfocused area.</td>', 'I like the visual rhythm and texture. The exposure level is right where it should be. The composition does cause a bit of visual stress though, as the lines tend to draw the eye away from the most interesting sharp texture and into the unfocused area.', '2004-05-09 00:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(706369, 74027, 21516, '<td valign="top">Predictable subject. Could have done some more work with focus, background colour, and colour contrast. A good perspective on an ordinary subject though.</td>', 'Predictable subject. Could have done some more work with focus, background colour, and colour contrast. A good perspective on an ordinary subject though.', '2004-05-09 00:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(706371, 74429, 21516, '<td valign="top">Extra point for adding more to the theme than just finding a rusty object and snapping a shot.</td>', 'Extra point for adding more to the theme than just finding a rusty object and snapping a shot.', '2004-05-09 00:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(706377, 74029, 21516, '<td valign="top">Could have chosen a better title, something about the</td>', 'Could have chosen a better title, something about the', '2004-05-09 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(706378, 74540, 18147, '<td valign="top">I like the light and atmosphere. I am not sure that I see anything rusty, though with the water and the metal, there is potential for rust. It seems as though the picture attempts to say something. Whatever it is, the message eludes me.</td>', 'I like the light and atmosphere. I am not sure that I see anything rusty, though with the water and the metal, there is potential for rust. It seems as though the picture attempts to say something. Whatever it is, the message eludes me.', '2004-05-09 00:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(706380, 74403, 19841, '<td valign="top">Um, I don''t think you were supposed to have your camera phone in that hangar...<br/></td>', 'Um, I don''t think you were supposed to have your camera phone in that hangar...', '2004-05-09 00:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(706385, 73938, 18147, '<td valign="top">The contrast might be a bit much. This effect may have been what you were after, but the blown-out upper left corner really detracts from the overall image. Otherwise, the texture and composition are quite nice.</td>', 'The contrast might be a bit much. This effect may have been what you were after, but the blown-out upper left corner really detracts from the overall image. Otherwise, the texture and composition are quite nice.', '2004-05-09 01:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(706387, 74512, 21516, '<td valign="top">Two points for doing something different and the effort, but one lost for being strange. :P</td>', 'Two points for doing something different and the effort, but one lost for being strange. :P', '2004-05-09 01:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(706388, 73921, 21516, '<td valign="top">Found a nice texture and interesting colour balance. Good crop too.</td>', 'Found a nice texture and interesting colour balance. Good crop too.', '2004-05-09 01:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(706390, 74542, 18147, '<td valign="top">The image has a nice subtle mood, an interesting title, and nice visual rhythm, though the composition could benefit from a tighter crop, with the top fifth removed.</td>', 'The image has a nice subtle mood, an interesting title, and nice visual rhythm, though the composition could benefit from a tighter crop, with the top fifth removed.', '2004-05-09 01:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(706395, 74241, 21516, '<td valign="top">Nice look at colour. It''s still just another rusty object, but the photo has been well constructed to make the most of the subject of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice look at colour. It''s still just another rusty object, but the photo has been well constructed to make the most of the subject of the challenge.', '2004-05-09 01:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(706398, 74008, 21516, '<td valign="top">Two points for effort and one point for an innovative concept. The <br/>Was the cake yum?</td>', 'Two points for effort and one point for an innovative concept. The Was the cake yum?', '2004-05-09 01:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(706399, 73746, 18147, '<td valign="top">The light and sharpness are good.</td>', 'The light and sharpness are good.', '2004-05-09 01:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(706401, 74193, 21516, '<td valign="top">Great colours and textures, nice collection of shapes.</td>', 'Great colours and textures, nice collection of shapes.', '2004-05-09 01:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(706405, 73449, 18147, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and color. I would have pushed the focus out just a bit to include more of the rounded object.</td>', 'I like the texture and color. I would have pushed the focus out just a bit to include more of the rounded object.', '2004-05-09 01:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(706409, 74318, 18147, '<td valign="top">This has a nice assortment of textures.</td>', 'This has a nice assortment of textures.', '2004-05-09 01:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(706410, 74548, 21516, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and colour, but the lack of focus spoils it, and also it''s just another rusty object.</td>', 'Nice perspective and colour, but the lack of focus spoils it, and also it''s just another rusty object.', '2004-05-09 01:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
