(706715, 74514, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but too abstract for me. The rust is barely visible and the indent is distracting. I also think there is too much light reflecting along the edge, which makes for too little contract between subject and background.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but too abstract for me. The rust is barely visible and the indent is distracting. I also think there is too much light reflecting along the edge, which makes for too little contract between subject and background.', '2004-05-09 10:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
