(706729, 73544, 17505, '<td valign="top">Good matching of colors. The skin is overexposed, which draws the eye to the left. By croppin goff the ear, and perhaps the hair, the focus might have been drawn back to the center of the picture.  Great idea, great focus.</td>', 'Good matching of colors. The skin is overexposed, which draws the eye to the left. By croppin goff the ear, and perhaps the hair, the focus might have been drawn back to the center of the picture.  Great idea, great focus.', '2004-05-09 10:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(706730, 73462, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	5	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	4	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	7	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	9	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	6.25	     Dick<br/>Overexposure of wheel rim ruin this for me, try with different lighting condition for more detail.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	5	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	4	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	7	How well does it meet the challenge:	9	Total Averaged Rating	6.25	     DickOverexposure of wheel rim ruin this for me, try with different lighting condition for more detail.', '2004-05-09 10:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(706733, 74238, 17505, '<td valign="top">Great detail, good use of background. O love the rust flakes below the chain links. I''m not sure that it was intentional, but by placing the links as you did it creates a circle, which leads the eye around the photo. Very nice job. I only wish that the upper left corner were not so bright.</td>', 'Great detail, good use of background. O love the rust flakes below the chain links. I''m not sure that it was intentional, but by placing the links as you did it creates a circle, which leads the eye around the photo. Very nice job. I only wish that the upper left corner were not so bright.', '2004-05-09 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(706736, 73106, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	9	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	10	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	7	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	10	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	9.00	     Dick<br/>More of the rusty subject maybe to define interesting shape would boost this image.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	9	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	10	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	7	How well does it meet the challenge:	10	Total Averaged Rating	9.00	     DickMore of the rusty subject maybe to define interesting shape would boost this image.', '2004-05-09 10:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(706739, 74536, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	8	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	8	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	6	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	10	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	8.00	     Dick<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	8	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	8	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	6	How well does it meet the challenge:	10	Total Averaged Rating	8.00	     Dick', '2004-05-09 10:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
