(706746, 74420, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling of tension created here.<br/> I think a little wider focus would have helped it out a bit. The left hand part of the wood and part of the bolt seem out of focus. While the rope and central wood seem to be your main focus. It''s a little distracting but it''s a minor flaw in an otherwise very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice feeling of tension created here. I think a little wider focus would have helped it out a bit. The left hand part of the wood and part of the bolt seem out of focus. While the rope and central wood seem to be your main focus. It''s a little distracting but it''s a minor flaw in an otherwise very nice shot.', '2004-05-09 11:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
