(706813, 74389, 16488, '<td valign="top">Gates, chains and locks are a popular subject in this challenge, but among them this one stands out.  I think you''ve expertly framed this picture.  It has "story."  If you could have lessened the highlights it would be that much closer to perfection.  Great interpretation!</td>', 'Gates, chains and locks are a popular subject in this challenge, but among them this one stands out.  I think you''ve expertly framed this picture.  It has "story."  If you could have lessened the highlights it would be that much closer to perfection.  Great interpretation!', '2004-05-09 11:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
