(706818, 74209, 19841, '<td valign="top">This image makes no sense.  That might be okay, but it doesn''t make a nice abstract image, either.   Squaring up on the chess board might have helped.  There is a lot of stuff in the background that doesn''s seem to have anything to do with your idea (whatever it was).    Cut it off.    And don''t use the flash attached to the camera when you are facing something shiny.</td>', 'This image makes no sense.  That might be okay, but it doesn''t make a nice abstract image, either.   Squaring up on the chess board might have helped.  There is a lot of stuff in the background that doesn''s seem to have anything to do with your idea (whatever it was).    Cut it off.    And don''t use the flash attached to the camera when you are facing something shiny.', '2004-05-09 11:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(706822, 73483, 16488, '<td valign="top">The subject is there but I think the focus could be sharper and the distracting wires at top cropped out.  The diagonal division of red and green was a good idea.</td>', 'The subject is there but I think the focus could be sharper and the distracting wires at top cropped out.  The diagonal division of red and green was a good idea.', '2004-05-09 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
