(707006, 74163, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great detail and color, the spider web really emphsizes the rustyness of the wire.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Great detail and color, the spider web really emphsizes the rustyness of the wire. Good luck...', '2004-05-09 14:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(707012, 74403, 19507, '<td valign="top">Is this intended to be an entry in last week''s proportion contest, instead of "Rust"?</td>', 'Is this intended to be an entry in last week''s proportion contest, instead of "Rust"?', '2004-05-09 14:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(707016, 74442, 21202, '<td valign="top">A very lovely location.  Very good photographic quality.Composition leaves a lot to be desired. The most forceful lines in the photo, the reflected inverted v at the bottom of the picture as well as the perspective of the rusted float drive the eye into a fallen log that leads the eye right off the right side of the picture as does the horizon of the trees right above.  It is very hard to keep one''s gaze on the rusted float.<br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'A very lovely location.  Very good photographic quality.Composition leaves a lot to be desired. The most forceful lines in the photo, the reflected inverted v at the bottom of the picture as well as the perspective of the rusted float drive the eye into a fallen log that leads the eye right off the right side of the picture as does the horizon of the trees right above.  It is very hard to keep one''s gaze on the rusted float. A 4.', '2004-05-09 14:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(707018, 73476, 19507, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot with an abstract feel to it.</td>', 'Interesting shot with an abstract feel to it.', '2004-05-09 14:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(707019, 73370, 19507, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract aspect of this one.  I had to look for a few seconds before I realized exactly what this was.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'I like the abstract aspect of this one.  I had to look for a few seconds before I realized exactly what this was.  Interesting shot.', '2004-05-09 14:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(707021, 74409, 19507, '<td valign="top">Good feeling of depth with the chains leading the eye nicely into the picture.</td>', 'Good feeling of depth with the chains leading the eye nicely into the picture.', '2004-05-09 14:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(707023, 74513, 19507, '<td valign="top">This shot really needs more depth of field to increase its effectiveness.  The leaves in the foreground are too prominent to be so out of focus, in my opinion.</td>', 'This shot really needs more depth of field to increase its effectiveness.  The leaves in the foreground are too prominent to be so out of focus, in my opinion.', '2004-05-09 14:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(707026, 73723, 19507, '<td valign="top">Interesting possibilities with your subject, but I think you should have changed the composition to eliminate the clutter.  The shot is so "busy" that my eye doesn''t know where to focus.</td>', 'Interesting possibilities with your subject, but I think you should have changed the composition to eliminate the clutter.  The shot is so "busy" that my eye doesn''t know where to focus.', '2004-05-09 14:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(707027, 74530, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, framing, cropping.  Many of the colors of metal and rust are pleasing though some are not.  Reducing the exposure could have helped provide detail in some of the bright areas, but I think actually a shot later in the day would help the most with the overall glare that is present.<br/> <br/>A 5 for the composition and choice of subject.</td>', 'I like the composition, framing, cropping.  Many of the colors of metal and rust are pleasing though some are not.  Reducing the exposure could have helped provide detail in some of the bright areas, but I think actually a shot later in the day would help the most with the overall glare that is present. A 5 for the composition and choice of subject.', '2004-05-09 14:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(707029, 74404, 19507, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and textures you captured here.  Nice abstract composition.</td>', 'I like the colors and textures you captured here.  Nice abstract composition.', '2004-05-09 14:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(707032, 73544, 19507, '<td valign="top">Interesting, creative composition.  A nice change from looking at all the shots with only rust in them :)</td>', 'Interesting, creative composition.  A nice change from looking at all the shots with only rust in them :)', '2004-05-09 14:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(707033, 73646, 19507, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The light on the rose and the leaves is a little harsh and I think you could have improved the composition by not having the main subject so centralized.</td>', 'Good idea.  The light on the rose and the leaves is a little harsh and I think you could have improved the composition by not having the main subject so centralized.', '2004-05-09 14:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(707034, 73527, 21202, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to like here.  The expanse of the grate creates the illusion of open sea as does the remarkable texture and colors of the material beneath.  I wish there were more focus on the nearest part of the iron and that the paper clips were replaced with others that had more the appearance of a ship at sea.<br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'There is a lot to like here.  The expanse of the grate creates the illusion of open sea as does the remarkable texture and colors of the material beneath.  I wish there were more focus on the nearest part of the iron and that the paper clips were replaced with others that had more the appearance of a ship at sea. A 6.', '2004-05-09 14:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(707035, 74050, 21202, '<td valign="top">The colors and composition are very pleasing.  I regret this is such a small image.<br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'The colors and composition are very pleasing.  I regret this is such a small image. A 7.', '2004-05-09 14:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(707038, 74199, 18868, '<td valign="top">Finally -- I voted on half of the photos, and I get to the Neil Young fan... I figured every other picture would have this title.  Interesting concept, nicely executed.  I''m not sure the heavy black border benefits the image.</td>', 'Finally -- I voted on half of the photos, and I get to the Neil Young fan... I figured every other picture would have this title.  Interesting concept, nicely executed.  I''m not sure the heavy black border benefits the image.', '2004-05-09 14:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(707040, 74502, 21202, '<td valign="top">A very interesting curve.  Lighting is very good.  The worn wood makes a lovely half frame and the leaves harmonize well with the wall and supply needed color.  I would have preferred that a little more be cropped from the right hand side and either more of most likely less from the top.  <br/> <br/>A 5.</td>', 'A very interesting curve.  Lighting is very good.  The worn wood makes a lovely half frame and the leaves harmonize well with the wall and supply needed color.  I would have preferred that a little more be cropped from the right hand side and either more of most likely less from the top.   A 5.', '2004-05-09 14:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(707042, 74352, 18868, '<td valign="top">As I''m sure you''ve noticed, this is one of many factory shots, but this is better than most because of the strong horizontal composition -- including the smoke.  Having a really nice day helps a lot as well.  Not very rusty tho (don''t worry, no points off for that).</td>', 'As I''m sure you''ve noticed, this is one of many factory shots, but this is better than most because of the strong horizontal composition -- including the smoke.  Having a really nice day helps a lot as well.  Not very rusty tho (don''t worry, no points off for that).', '2004-05-09 14:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(707043, 74396, 2792, '<td valign="top">Would suggest at landscape orientation instead of portrait.  Otherwise, neat idea! =-)</td>', 'Would suggest at landscape orientation instead of portrait.  Otherwise, neat idea! =-)', '2004-05-09 14:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(707044, 74464, 21202, '<td valign="top">The framing and light/shadow line crossing the doughnut shaped end piece bother me as does the very low depth of field.  The background is lost completely and it appears as if it might have helped if large circles of confusion had been left to add interest.<br/> <br/>A 4 based on the above and overall appeal.</td>', 'The framing and light/shadow line crossing the doughnut shaped end piece bother me as does the very low depth of field.  The background is lost completely and it appears as if it might have helped if large circles of confusion had been left to add interest. A 4 based on the above and overall appeal.', '2004-05-09 14:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(707045, 74053, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	5<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	5<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	4<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	7<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	5<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	5Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	5Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	4How well does it meet the challenge:	7Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	5', '2004-05-09 14:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(707046, 74483, 18868, '<td valign="top">The circular and linear elements in the subject offer some interesting graphic possibilities that were not capitalized on.  Also, the DOF seems a little too shallow to capture the whole subject, but it''s definitely a compromise re: getting nicely blurry background.  Since this seems to be a pile of junk, I''d suggest that you can move things around to compose your shot -- for example, the vertical thing in the background.</td>', 'The circular and linear elements in the subject offer some interesting graphic possibilities that were not capitalized on.  Also, the DOF seems a little too shallow to capture the whole subject, but it''s definitely a compromise re: getting nicely blurry background.  Since this seems to be a pile of junk, I''d suggest that you can move things around to compose your shot -- for example, the vertical thing in the background.', '2004-05-09 14:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(707048, 74481, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	7<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	7<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	6<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	7<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	7<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	7Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	7Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	6How well does it meet the challenge:	7Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	7', '2004-05-09 14:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(707049, 74253, 21202, '<td valign="top">Your title would be more compelling if we saw someone foolishly climbing this perilous looking ladder.  However, I am not going to judge the title, that is easily changed.   I really like the composition and point of view of this picture, the lighting, depth of field, colors, and especially the patterns in the water/mud are all excellent.  What keeps this from being an outstanding picture for me is that the ladder takes the eye to one of the most uninteresting parts of the photo.<br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'Your title would be more compelling if we saw someone foolishly climbing this perilous looking ladder.  However, I am not going to judge the title, that is easily changed.   I really like the composition and point of view of this picture, the lighting, depth of field, colors, and especially the patterns in the water/mud are all excellent.  What keeps this from being an outstanding picture for me is that the ladder takes the eye to one of the most uninteresting parts of the photo. An 8.', '2004-05-09 14:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(707050, 73769, 18868, '<td valign="top">The splashing or falling water makes the image very busy --- perhaps a very high shutter speed with a strong flash would stop the action, making a sharper image?</td>', 'The splashing or falling water makes the image very busy --- perhaps a very high shutter speed with a strong flash would stop the action, making a sharper image?', '2004-05-09 14:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(707051, 74407, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	7<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	4<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	7<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	6<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	7Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	4How well does it meet the challenge:	7Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	6', '2004-05-09 14:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(707052, 73277, 2792, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasting colors!</td>', 'Love the contrasting colors!', '2004-05-09 14:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(707054, 73671, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	5<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	6<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	7<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	6<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	5Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	6How well does it meet the challenge:	7Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	6', '2004-05-09 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(707055, 74144, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice use of Hue/Sat -- very effective for the image and topic.</td>', 'Nice use of Hue/Sat -- very effective for the image and topic.', '2004-05-09 14:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(707056, 73330, 21202, '<td valign="top">I am overwhelmed by the color and glare.  I am also lost as to what I am observing.  I find the background to be completely bland and uninteresting.<br/> <br/>Sorry, a 2.</td>', 'I am overwhelmed by the color and glare.  I am also lost as to what I am observing.  I find the background to be completely bland and uninteresting. Sorry, a 2.', '2004-05-09 14:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(707057, 73511, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	4<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	5<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	4<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	3<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	4<br/>Maybe if you had moved in closer and got a shot of the wheel guard. As it is the rusty fender is pretty well obscured and really doesn''t serve to enhance the composition. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	4Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	5Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	4How well does it meet the challenge:	3Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	4Maybe if you had moved in closer and got a shot of the wheel guard. As it is the rusty fender is pretty well obscured and really doesn''t serve to enhance the composition. Hope this is helpful.', '2004-05-09 14:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(707058, 74479, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a creature of the sea, an octupus, a sun star fish and the blue background perfectly complements it.  The lighting is harsher than I would like with unfortunately strong glare and heavy shadows.  A little later in the day this would have been a 10 for me.<br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'This is a creature of the sea, an octupus, a sun star fish and the blue background perfectly complements it.  The lighting is harsher than I would like with unfortunately strong glare and heavy shadows.  A little later in the day this would have been a 10 for me. A 7.', '2004-05-09 14:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(707059, 74018, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nicely graphic use of line and tension (althouh I want to see the points, this is perhaps part of the tension), good lighting and contrast on the subject.  The background color is bland and doesn''t contribute or support the strength of the subject.  I''d suggest a more saturated color, one that''s opposite on the color wheel from the color you''re trying to emphasize.</td>', 'Nice composition, nicely graphic use of line and tension (althouh I want to see the points, this is perhaps part of the tension), good lighting and contrast on the subject.  The background color is bland and doesn''t contribute or support the strength of the subject.  I''d suggest a more saturated color, one that''s opposite on the color wheel from the color you''re trying to emphasize.', '2004-05-09 14:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(707060, 74307, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	3<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	5<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	7<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	5<br/>The DOF you chose would have been better utilized if the screw had been in sharper focus. That''s the reason for the 3 rating in the technical category. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	3Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	5How well does it meet the challenge:	7Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	5The DOF you chose would have been better utilized if the screw had been in sharper focus. That''s the reason for the 3 rating in the technical category. Hope this is helpful.', '2004-05-09 14:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(707061, 74408, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.  I would have liked to see more at top, less at the bottom and right hand side. The framing / cropping on the right is ideal.  I love the bread shaped mound of hay in the background.<br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'Very lovely.  I would have liked to see more at top, less at the bottom and right hand side. The framing / cropping on the right is ideal.  I love the bread shaped mound of hay in the background. An 8.', '2004-05-09 14:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(707062, 74254, 2792, '<td valign="top">Great focus!</td>', 'Great focus!', '2004-05-09 14:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(707063, 74307, 21202, '<td valign="top">I love it.  I could be critical of tocus and glare, but I love the picture exactly as it is.<br/> <br/>A 10.</td>', 'I love it.  I could be critical of tocus and glare, but I love the picture exactly as it is. A 10.', '2004-05-09 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(707066, 74156, 18868, '<td valign="top">Very graphic, nice color (possibly a tad oversaturated, but it works) and technically well exectued.  The black border even works, which I''m usually against.  Nice entry -- it should do well.</td>', 'Very graphic, nice color (possibly a tad oversaturated, but it works) and technically well exectued.  The black border even works, which I''m usually against.  Nice entry -- it should do well.', '2004-05-09 15:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(707067, 74435, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	5<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	5<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	6<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	7<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	6<br/>I like the pure white BG but otherwise it looks a little over processed for my taste. I would have scored it higher a little less processed.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	5Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	5Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	6How well does it meet the challenge:	7Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	6I like the pure white BG but otherwise it looks a little over processed for my taste. I would have scored it higher a little less processed.', '2004-05-09 15:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(707068, 74483, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	5<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	7<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	6<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	5How well does it meet the challenge:	7Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	6', '2004-05-09 15:02:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(707070, 73807, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	6<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	0<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	5<br/>Fairly compelling image but the rust element is pretty much non-evident.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	6How well does it meet the challenge:	0Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	5Fairly compelling image but the rust element is pretty much non-evident.', '2004-05-09 15:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(707071, 74204, 19590, '<td valign="top">Nice, good composition</td>', 'Nice, good composition', '2004-05-09 15:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(707072, 74115, 21202, '<td valign="top">Sheep and rusty contraption are splendid.  Unfortunately even with panoramic clipping the background bothers.  I suffered the illusion, perhaps because of lack of color, that I was looking downhill toward the edge of a pond or the sea.  It took some time to convince myself that sheep and contraption were on the level and what I took to be water was the rise of a hill behind.<br/> <br/>So an 8, not a 10.</td>', 'Sheep and rusty contraption are splendid.  Unfortunately even with panoramic clipping the background bothers.  I suffered the illusion, perhaps because of lack of color, that I was looking downhill toward the edge of a pond or the sea.  It took some time to convince myself that sheep and contraption were on the level and what I took to be water was the rise of a hill behind. So an 8, not a 10.', '2004-05-09 15:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(707074, 74507, 19590, '<td valign="top">Tough light to work with.  Try same thing on a cloudy day with an interesting sky</td>', 'Tough light to work with.  Try same thing on a cloudy day with an interesting sky', '2004-05-09 15:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(707075, 74205, 21202, '<td valign="top">This composition just does not appeal to me.<br/> <br/>Sorry, a 3.</td>', 'This composition just does not appeal to me. Sorry, a 3.', '2004-05-09 15:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(707076, 74359, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice image, and well focused, but the strong shadow on the right side really detracts quite badly.  There are several things you could try: wait for your shot until the sun is positioned well, crop the shot to eliminate the right half, shoot with a muted fill flash, or use a large piece of white cardboard or other white material to reflect some light onto the dark part of the subject.</td>', 'Nice image, and well focused, but the strong shadow on the right side really detracts quite badly.  There are several things you could try: wait for your shot until the sun is positioned well, crop the shot to eliminate the right half, shoot with a muted fill flash, or use a large piece of white cardboard or other white material to reflect some light onto the dark part of the subject.', '2004-05-09 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(707077, 73269, 19590, '<td valign="top">Nice shot would be even better without the white showing thru the holes</td>', 'Nice shot would be even better without the white showing thru the holes', '2004-05-09 15:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(707078, 74382, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I would have liked the right hand side to end all the way out at the edge of one of the cups, preferably the fourth, but if not possible, the third.  I like the framing / cropping at the bottom, but think we see just a tad too much uniform blue at the top.  I like the blue / orange contrast.<br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'Very nice.  I would have liked the right hand side to end all the way out at the edge of one of the cups, preferably the fourth, but if not possible, the third.  I like the framing / cropping at the bottom, but think we see just a tad too much uniform blue at the top.  I like the blue / orange contrast. A 7.', '2004-05-09 15:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(707079, 73528, 19590, '<td valign="top">Leads my eye right into thr dsign</td>', 'Leads my eye right into thr dsign', '2004-05-09 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(707080, 73476, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, very crisp and graphic.  I don''t know if it''s legal, but when "cropping" the image in photoshop, you can correct perspective problems (the un-level lines in the background) by making a selection, then chosing "Free Transform" then holding the command-key (or control on a PC) down when you drag one of the handles -- this will allow you to distort the image non-uniformly.  Since it doesn''t involve a mask, and you can get the selection by doing "select all", it should be legal.</td>', 'Nice composition, very crisp and graphic.  I don''t know if it''s legal, but when "cropping" the image in photoshop, you can correct perspective problems (the un-level lines in the background) by making a selection, then chosing "Free Transform" then holding the command-key (or control on a PC) down when you drag one of the handles -- this will allow you to distort the image non-uniformly.  Since it doesn''t involve a mask, and you can get the selection by doing "select all", it should be legal.', '2004-05-09 15:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
