(707094, 74434, 21202, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing of Empire State Building which seems to disappear into a heavenly light.  I would have preferred though that you would have used photoshop to make the lines near the left and right edges vertical.  I feel like I am looking at the leaning tower of manhattan oon the right.    Additional lighting on this side of the erector set would also help.  Large expanses are only in silhouette.<br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'Excellent framing of Empire State Building which seems to disappear into a heavenly light.  I would have preferred though that you would have used photoshop to make the lines near the left and right edges vertical.  I feel like I am looking at the leaning tower of manhattan oon the right.    Additional lighting on this side of the erector set would also help.  Large expanses are only in silhouette. A 6.', '2004-05-09 15:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(707096, 74542, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	7<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	8<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	6<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	8<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	7<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	7Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	8Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	6How well does it meet the challenge:	8Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	7', '2004-05-09 15:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
