(707098, 74092, 4285, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	5<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	8<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	8<br/>Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	7<br/>Very compelling subject matter. Would have scored it much higher if your composition had been different. Maybe from a lower angle with a tighter crop.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	5Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.	8How well does it meet the challenge:	8Total Averaged Rating(Rounded)	7Very compelling subject matter. Would have scored it much higher if your composition had been different. Maybe from a lower angle with a tighter crop.', '2004-05-09 15:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
