(707199, 74279, 21202, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know what I am looking at.I like the piece of wood on the top but it seems to have an iron spike either through it or under it.  I cannot tell which.  The shallow depth of field hurts as the piece of wood in the background could add pictorial interest but is far out of focus.  The lighting is also quite dim.<br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'I don''t really know what I am looking at.I like the piece of wood on the top but it seems to have an iron spike either through it or under it.  I cannot tell which.  The shallow depth of field hurts as the piece of wood in the background could add pictorial interest but is far out of focus.  The lighting is also quite dim. A 4.', '2004-05-09 16:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(707200, 73269, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I would have liked a smaller aperture, this picture can handle more parts of it being in focus.  Nothing to hide her.<br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'Nice picture.  I would have liked a smaller aperture, this picture can handle more parts of it being in focus.  Nothing to hide her. A 7.', '2004-05-09 16:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(707202, 73104, 21202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful .  A 9.  Small deduction for heaviness of shadow under bolt housing.  Perhaps a reflector could have been placed to soften shadow without interfering with otherwise superb lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful .  A 9.  Small deduction for heaviness of shadow under bolt housing.  Perhaps a reflector could have been placed to soften shadow without interfering with otherwise superb lighting.', '2004-05-09 17:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(707208, 74100, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like this picture much more with everything to the right of the bridge cropped off.  The tree, barn, and house are nice, but they reduce the impact of the perspective and the very lovely trees on the left.  It is a very soft shot and I would like more sharpness in the foreground. Nevertheless, a beautiful setting and subject.<br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'I like this picture much more with everything to the right of the bridge cropped off.  The tree, barn, and house are nice, but they reduce the impact of the perspective and the very lovely trees on the left.  It is a very soft shot and I would like more sharpness in the foreground. Nevertheless, a beautiful setting and subject. A 7.', '2004-05-09 17:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(707213, 74384, 3765, '<td valign="top">The white above the U is rather distracting. Also try to play around with contrast a bit to give it a more dramatis effect.</td>', 'The white above the U is rather distracting. Also try to play around with contrast a bit to give it a more dramatis effect.', '2004-05-09 17:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(707217, 73337, 21202, '<td valign="top">Wonderful out of focus background.  The spinner itself  is slightly short of appealing.  Maybe a slight rotation of the spinner itself to bring the left cup more towards us, exposing some of the face of the nearest cup?   Also the curve of the support, if we could see more of that it might serve as a frame for the nearest cup?  Commend you very highly on aperture and colors.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wonderful out of focus background.  The spinner itself  is slightly short of appealing.  Maybe a slight rotation of the spinner itself to bring the left cup more towards us, exposing some of the face of the nearest cup?   Also the curve of the support, if we could see more of that it might serve as a frame for the nearest cup?  Commend you very highly on aperture and colors. ', '2004-05-09 17:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(707219, 73751, 3765, '<td valign="top">Vety nice concept. Perhaps if you could have used a lightsource at a low angle you would have been able to create an image with more depth to it.</td>', 'Vety nice concept. Perhaps if you could have used a lightsource at a low angle you would have been able to create an image with more depth to it.', '2004-05-09 17:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(707222, 73354, 21202, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  So nice to see so much yellow. I am almost sick of orange, brown, red, and black after going through so many rust pictures.  the light blue green and rose also art appealing.  Excellent use of DOF.<br/> <br/>A 9.</td>', 'Lovely.  So nice to see so much yellow. I am almost sick of orange, brown, red, and black after going through so many rust pictures.  the light blue green and rose also art appealing.  Excellent use of DOF. A 9.', '2004-05-09 17:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(707225, 73750, 21202, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this far better without any shore line visible.<br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'I would have liked this far better without any shore line visible. A 6.', '2004-05-09 17:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(707227, 74496, 3765, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. Perhaps a softer light from the back might improve this for me. Nice idea though.</td>', 'Very dramatic. Perhaps a softer light from the back might improve this for me. Nice idea though.', '2004-05-09 17:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
