(707752, 74072, 20251, '<td valign="top">i think this is another VW Beetle :) ...  could have focussed more on the rusted area</td>', 'i think this is another VW Beetle :) ...  could have focussed more on the rusted area', '2004-05-09 23:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(707753, 73545, 20251, '<td valign="top">carcass of a once proud beast .... needs a bit more color tho i think</td>', 'carcass of a once proud beast .... needs a bit more color tho i think', '2004-05-10 00:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(707754, 73170, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m really gonna have to say that I don''t see the rust in this image that was submitted to the Rust Challenge.  I may be overlooking something, but I''m pretty sure I studied this well.  It''s a nice photo of a notebook, and I think it would do well in a notebook challenge.  The focus and clarity are good, and the angle is very interesting.  But as a photo of rust, it is not so good.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m really gonna have to say that I don''t see the rust in this image that was submitted to the Rust Challenge.  I may be overlooking something, but I''m pretty sure I studied this well.  It''s a nice photo of a notebook, and I think it would do well in a notebook challenge.  The focus and clarity are good, and the angle is very interesting.  But as a photo of rust, it is not so good.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 00:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(707755, 74291, 20251, '<td valign="top">a bit underexposed on the underside :)</td>', 'a bit underexposed on the underside :)', '2004-05-10 00:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(707757, 74172, 20251, '<td valign="top">needs a bit more color saturation</td>', 'needs a bit more color saturation', '2004-05-10 00:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(707758, 74489, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like it!  It''s a rusty nail, and the wood even has a rust color too.  The texture is really nice here.  Focus and clarity bring out the details very nicely.  I think that this is a perfect shot for this challenge.  Lighting is good as well.  I like where you have placed the nail within the photo and there is nothing that I can find distracting.  Overall very nice shot.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I like it!  It''s a rusty nail, and the wood even has a rust color too.  The texture is really nice here.  Focus and clarity bring out the details very nicely.  I think that this is a perfect shot for this challenge.  Lighting is good as well.  I like where you have placed the nail within the photo and there is nothing that I can find distracting.  Overall very nice shot.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 00:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(707761, 73805, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your sky is white and boring.  Doesn''t look like the weather conditions were ideal for taking a shot like this.  I would love to see a blue sky behind this.  Your subject definately contains rust, and focus is alright.  The crop seems a bit odd to me.  I notice that this is not the entire tower, and the way it''s cut off at the top is a bit distracting.  I like the addition of the grass at the bottom.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Your sky is white and boring.  Doesn''t look like the weather conditions were ideal for taking a shot like this.  I would love to see a blue sky behind this.  Your subject definately contains rust, and focus is alright.  The crop seems a bit odd to me.  I notice that this is not the entire tower, and the way it''s cut off at the top is a bit distracting.  I like the addition of the grass at the bottom.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 00:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(707764, 73296, 20251, '<td valign="top">love the color transition ... seems a bit bare ... a crawling insect would have made stunning results ... but who has the time right ? :)</td>', 'love the color transition ... seems a bit bare ... a crawling insect would have made stunning results ... but who has the time right ? :)', '2004-05-10 00:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(707767, 74064, 14526, '<td valign="top">is it? do leaves undergo oxidation when they turn brown? (honestly curious)</td>', 'is it? do leaves undergo oxidation when they turn brown? (honestly curious)', '2004-05-10 00:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(707769, 73170, 20251, '<td valign="top">to paraphrase Black Eyed Peas ; where is the rust ?  :) .... could have focussed on the foreground rings</td>', 'to paraphrase Black Eyed Peas ; where is the rust ?  :) .... could have focussed on the foreground rings', '2004-05-10 00:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(707771, 74506, 20251, '<td valign="top">generally , i like it .... you did well in focussing on the water droplet .</td>', 'generally , i like it .... you did well in focussing on the water droplet .', '2004-05-10 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(707772, 73221, 14526, '<td valign="top">he he</td>', 'he he', '2004-05-10 00:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(707775, 74422, 20251, '<td valign="top">interesting composition ... just needed an errant bird or airplane :)</td>', 'interesting composition ... just needed an errant bird or airplane :)', '2004-05-10 00:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(707776, 74392, 20251, '<td valign="top">a good angle .... good colors ..... frame''s a bit distracting tho<br/> <br/></td>', 'a good angle .... good colors ..... frame''s a bit distracting tho ', '2004-05-10 00:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(707780, 74485, 20251, '<td valign="top">thank God , it''s not another Beetle ..... great sky ... and youre lucky the car had its windshield removed ...<br/> <br/></td>', 'thank God , it''s not another Beetle ..... great sky ... and youre lucky the car had its windshield removed ... ', '2004-05-10 00:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(707781, 74050, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad that this image isn''t larger. I like the colors in the background.  The shadows are a bit distracting.  I can see that the chains are rusty, but I can''t really see them well.  From the rules, it says "Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels."  So you could enter a photo that was 640x640 if you wanted to.  You should use the size to your advantage.  (sorry if you''ve heard this 10 times already)  ~Heather~</td>', 'It''s too bad that this image isn''t larger. I like the colors in the background.  The shadows are a bit distracting.  I can see that the chains are rusty, but I can''t really see them well.  From the rules, it says "Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels."  So you could enter a photo that was 640x640 if you wanted to.  You should use the size to your advantage.  (sorry if you''ve heard this 10 times already)  ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 00:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(707782, 73963, 14526, '<td valign="top">the umbrella more on its own - it''s got such beautiful colours - would have had more impact</td>', 'the umbrella more on its own - it''s got such beautiful colours - would have had more impact', '2004-05-10 00:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(707785, 73724, 20251, '<td valign="top">does blood makes things rust ? ... excellent detail</td>', 'does blood makes things rust ? ... excellent detail', '2004-05-10 00:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(707786, 74318, 14526, '<td valign="top">sincerely hope that cable was not conductive. I liked the simple composition and colour saturation</td>', 'sincerely hope that cable was not conductive. I liked the simple composition and colour saturation', '2004-05-10 00:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(707787, 74246, 19841, '<td valign="top">The flash killed the shot.</td>', 'The flash killed the shot.', '2004-05-10 00:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
