(708390, 74419, 8013, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective!  Maybe move a little bit towards the bottom of the frame to show the rails going further into the horizon. 7</td>', 'Nice perspective!  Maybe move a little bit towards the bottom of the frame to show the rails going further into the horizon. 7', '2004-05-10 06:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(708391, 74382, 8013, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! 8</td>', 'Nice capture! 8', '2004-05-10 06:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(708392, 74204, 8013, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! 9</td>', 'Excellent shot! 9', '2004-05-10 06:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(708393, 73402, 20407, '<td valign="top">The macro is quite good. I find the subject a bit cold though.</td>', 'The macro is quite good. I find the subject a bit cold though.', '2004-05-10 06:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(708394, 74360, 8013, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.</td>', 'Nice macro.', '2004-05-10 06:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(708397, 74294, 20407, '<td valign="top">I''d focus a bit closer on the subject and concentrate on the focus a little more. I like the place though, it looks nice and green.</td>', 'I''d focus a bit closer on the subject and concentrate on the focus a little more. I like the place though, it looks nice and green.', '2004-05-10 06:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(708398, 74220, 8013, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge very well! Great detail. 8</td>', 'Fits the challenge very well! Great detail. 8', '2004-05-10 06:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(708399, 74256, 8013, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2004-05-10 06:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(708400, 73366, 20407, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that this fits into the rusted challenge too well.  The colours and shapes are nice though.</td>', 'I''m not sure that this fits into the rusted challenge too well.  The colours and shapes are nice though.', '2004-05-10 06:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(708401, 73610, 8013, '<td valign="top">The specks and writing in the background are distracting.</td>', 'The specks and writing in the background are distracting.', '2004-05-10 06:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(708402, 73790, 8013, '<td valign="top">Great colours!</td>', 'Great colours!', '2004-05-10 06:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(708403, 74410, 20407, '<td valign="top">I think this would have more success if it was landscape format and cropped to have the horizontal vines at the top and bottom of the image.</td>', 'I think this would have more success if it was landscape format and cropped to have the horizontal vines at the top and bottom of the image.', '2004-05-10 06:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(708405, 73807, 20407, '<td valign="top">This is a very sad image. The sepia really adds to the feeling. It doesn''t really work for "rusted" for me though.</td>', 'This is a very sad image. The sepia really adds to the feeling. It doesn''t really work for "rusted" for me though.', '2004-05-10 06:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(708410, 74394, 8013, '<td valign="top">Try and focus a little bit closer to the camera (on the rust spot), then frame the shot and depress the shutter!</td>', 'Try and focus a little bit closer to the camera (on the rust spot), then frame the shot and depress the shutter!', '2004-05-10 06:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(708411, 73350, 8013, '<td valign="top">Interesting see-through part!  Might be improved with a less busy background (through the hole).</td>', 'Interesting see-through part!  Might be improved with a less busy background (through the hole).', '2004-05-10 06:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(708412, 73676, 8013, '<td valign="top">Nice macro!</td>', 'Nice macro!', '2004-05-10 06:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(708413, 74544, 8013, '<td valign="top">Good work focussing on the little things. 6</td>', 'Good work focussing on the little things. 6', '2004-05-10 06:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(708414, 74514, 8013, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  7</td>', 'Very creative!  7', '2004-05-10 06:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(708430, 73750, 14202, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, colour, focus, depth and lighting is all spot-on...well done  = 9</td>', 'Excellent shot, colour, focus, depth and lighting is all spot-on...well done  = 9', '2004-05-10 07:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(708432, 74008, 18644, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good idea, but i''m not sure about the lighting and the end result of the picture. Sorry!</td>', 'Nice composition, good idea, but i''m not sure about the lighting and the end result of the picture. Sorry!', '2004-05-10 08:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(708435, 74298, 20135, '<td valign="top">The rust doesn''t show well against the background.</td>', 'The rust doesn''t show well against the background.', '2004-05-10 08:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(708436, 74224, 20135, '<td valign="top">Amusing subject, uninteresting composition</td>', 'Amusing subject, uninteresting composition', '2004-05-10 08:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(708438, 74473, 20135, '<td valign="top">Like a lot, nice setup contrasting with the life in the foreground</td>', 'Like a lot, nice setup contrasting with the life in the foreground', '2004-05-10 08:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(708439, 74276, 20135, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but the competition asked specifically for rust, not rusty colours.</td>', 'Lovely shot, but the competition asked specifically for rust, not rusty colours.', '2004-05-10 08:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(708442, 74203, 20135, '<td valign="top">With more vibrant colours this could have been really good.</td>', 'With more vibrant colours this could have been really good.', '2004-05-10 08:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(708451, 74229, 17551, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, perhaps a bit overexposed around the white area</td>', 'Nice colours, perhaps a bit overexposed around the white area', '2004-05-10 08:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(708452, 73506, 17551, '<td valign="top">I like this, shows a lot of detail and character.</td>', 'I like this, shows a lot of detail and character.', '2004-05-10 08:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(708453, 74486, 20135, '<td valign="top">Kind of gruesome to look at if you let you imagination wander but a nice capture.</td>', 'Kind of gruesome to look at if you let you imagination wander but a nice capture.', '2004-05-10 08:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(708454, 74385, 17551, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and colourisation, but whats with the little red dot.. throws it off a little</td>', 'Nice subject and colourisation, but whats with the little red dot.. throws it off a little', '2004-05-10 08:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(708455, 73807, 17551, '<td valign="top">very grungy, you''ll get marked down for using a rusted colour instead of rust. But I like the rawness of it. 7</td>', 'very grungy, you''ll get marked down for using a rusted colour instead of rust. But I like the rawness of it. 7', '2004-05-10 08:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(708457, 74549, 17551, '<td valign="top">lighting needs work, but im sure you''ve got comments on that already. Background is good, except for the white blur on top left corner. Overall nice colors and lines.. just a shame about the lighting!</td>', 'lighting needs work, but im sure you''ve got comments on that already. Background is good, except for the white blur on top left corner. Overall nice colors and lines.. just a shame about the lighting!', '2004-05-10 08:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(708458, 74054, 17551, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like this colouring. Yellow gives a sickly type feel, and it sort of feels out place on an industrial type building.</td>', 'I don''t really like this colouring. Yellow gives a sickly type feel, and it sort of feels out place on an industrial type building.', '2004-05-10 08:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(708459, 73698, 17551, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, but just seems a little soft when you examine the rust detail. I think the composition would''ve been more powerful with the white dot in the frame. Other than that, I really like it.</td>', 'Interesting picture, but just seems a little soft when you examine the rust detail. I think the composition would''ve been more powerful with the white dot in the frame. Other than that, I really like it.', '2004-05-10 08:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(708460, 73545, 17551, '<td valign="top">Nice find.. sky is a bit dull and lifeless though, perhaps would be better at a different time of day. I love the sharpness of the details. 8</td>', 'Nice find.. sky is a bit dull and lifeless though, perhaps would be better at a different time of day. I love the sharpness of the details. 8', '2004-05-10 08:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(708461, 74531, 17551, '<td valign="top">A bit of sunflare ruins this otherwise great shot. I''m not sure if that was the intention, but it spoils some of the detail I think. 6</td>', 'A bit of sunflare ruins this otherwise great shot. I''m not sure if that was the intention, but it spoils some of the detail I think. 6', '2004-05-10 08:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(708463, 74340, 17551, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, poor colour. Needs work ;-) .. sorry 3 from me</td>', 'Out of focus, poor colour. Needs work ;-) .. sorry 3 from me', '2004-05-10 08:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(708465, 74275, 17551, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, although the building in the background.. hmm not sure if it adds to the composition, If it was all negative space I would''ve been happier. 7</td>', 'Lovely shot, although the building in the background.. hmm not sure if it adds to the composition, If it was all negative space I would''ve been happier. 7', '2004-05-10 08:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(708468, 74507, 17551, '<td valign="top">Good use of different perspectives to make the shot interesting. Lighting is a bit off, perhaps adjust exposure compensation for overcast days. 7</td>', 'Good use of different perspectives to make the shot interesting. Lighting is a bit off, perhaps adjust exposure compensation for overcast days. 7', '2004-05-10 08:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(708469, 74509, 17551, '<td valign="top">ummm.. lol</td>', 'ummm.. lol', '2004-05-10 08:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(708473, 73921, 17551, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Simplicity at its best.</td>', 'Very nice. Simplicity at its best.', '2004-05-10 08:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(708501, 74395, 6097, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors that you have captured here.  All of the colors play off of one another nicely.  From the greenish board in the foreground to the rust roof off of the nice blue sky.    Interesting capture and there enough here to keep the eyes interest just long enough to enjoy the photo.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'I really like the colors that you have captured here.  All of the colors play off of one another nicely.  From the greenish board in the foreground to the rust roof off of the nice blue sky.    Interesting capture and there enough here to keep the eyes interest just long enough to enjoy the photo.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2004-05-10 09:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(708503, 73610, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot.  I like that it gives an action sort of feel with all of the rust flying around.  Pretty cool!  Nice clarity and focus.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'This is a really cool shot.  I like that it gives an action sort of feel with all of the rust flying around.  Pretty cool!  Nice clarity and focus.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2004-05-10 09:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(708506, 73492, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on the challenge.  I like it.  It''s nice to see some humor mixed in with the bag.  It''s nice to have someone break up the monotony of just rusty object (I just did a plain old rusty object myself).  This is cool.  Nice focus and I like the expression on the face.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'This is an interesting take on the challenge.  I like it.  It''s nice to see some humor mixed in with the bag.  It''s nice to have someone break up the monotony of just rusty object (I just did a plain old rusty object myself).  This is cool.  Nice focus and I like the expression on the face.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2004-05-10 09:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(708510, 74051, 16478, '<td valign="top">A closer crop would have been better I feel, making the sign the object of the photo</td>', 'A closer crop would have been better I feel, making the sign the object of the photo', '2004-05-10 09:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(708511, 74115, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I really like the panoramic feel of this photo.  I really like this with the white border you have used.  It works well here.  I like the hairline black line you used in the border prior to the white.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Very nice.  I really like the panoramic feel of this photo.  I really like this with the white border you have used.  It works well here.  I like the hairline black line you used in the border prior to the white.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2004-05-10 09:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(708512, 74535, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of DOF.  Simple object but interesting photo.  Nice clarity on the main subject and just the right DOF.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Very nice use of DOF.  Simple object but interesting photo.  Nice clarity on the main subject and just the right DOF.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2004-05-10 09:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(708518, 73397, 6097, '<td valign="top">I really like the border you have used here.  This photo looks like you have used desaturation but I''m not sure if it is naturally desaturated or not.  Either way I really like how the rusted bolt stands out against everything else which appears to be silverish in color.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'I really like the border you have used here.  This photo looks like you have used desaturation but I''m not sure if it is naturally desaturated or not.  Either way I really like how the rusted bolt stands out against everything else which appears to be silverish in color.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2004-05-10 09:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(708527, 74485, 20977, '<td valign="top">gr8 snap.. nice coming together of elements</td>', 'gr8 snap.. nice coming together of elements', '2004-05-10 09:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(708531, 73490, 20977, '<td valign="top">fantastic resolution... our man dug deep eh?</td>', 'fantastic resolution... our man dug deep eh?', '2004-05-10 09:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(708559, 73935, 11467, '<td valign="top">Is this a grill in a Chinese Restaurant?<br/>A bit difficult to work out what it is. Too out of focus</td>', 'Is this a grill in a Chinese Restaurant?A bit difficult to work out what it is. Too out of focus', '2004-05-10 10:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(708573, 74399, 17505, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and background, the negative space works well.</td>', 'Good lighting and background, the negative space works well.', '2004-05-10 10:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(708576, 74115, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and nice framing. I''m not sure I like the sepia tone.</td>', 'Interesting idea and nice framing. I''m not sure I like the sepia tone.', '2004-05-10 10:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(708580, 74279, 17505, '<td valign="top">Good detail and I like the muted colors.  I would like to see more of the object you are photographing. It''s too close, I''m not sure if I''m looking at a mail or the handle of something larger. Nice shot overall.</td>', 'Good detail and I like the muted colors.  I would like to see more of the object you are photographing. It''s too close, I''m not sure if I''m looking at a mail or the handle of something larger. Nice shot overall.', '2004-05-10 10:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(708582, 73391, 17505, '<td valign="top">I like the way the wilted texture mirrors the rust texture. Very thoughtful. I also like the way you''ve arranged the elements, it creates a nice blending of colors and shapes. Very nice.</td>', 'I like the way the wilted texture mirrors the rust texture. Very thoughtful. I also like the way you''ve arranged the elements, it creates a nice blending of colors and shapes. Very nice.', '2004-05-10 10:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(708584, 74198, 17505, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better with more in focus. The whole object is equally beautiful and I wish I could examine it all. Great background.</td>', 'I would have liked this better with more in focus. The whole object is equally beautiful and I wish I could examine it all. Great background.', '2004-05-10 10:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(708586, 74402, 19841, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject, but it looks like you just walked over to it and snapped a picture.  Always walk around and check out angles.   By taking a step to the left, you could have gotten that sign post out of the picture.  It doesn''t do anything positive for your composition.  By crouching down a little, you could have gotten the white diagonal of the sidewalk lower, crossing the can at a more interesting level.    Walk around your subject, and keep taking pictures!</td>', 'Good choice of subject, but it looks like you just walked over to it and snapped a picture.  Always walk around and check out angles.   By taking a step to the left, you could have gotten that sign post out of the picture.  It doesn''t do anything positive for your composition.  By crouching down a little, you could have gotten the white diagonal of the sidewalk lower, crossing the can at a more interesting level.    Walk around your subject, and keep taking pictures!', '2004-05-10 10:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
