(708871, 74429, 14476, '<td valign="top">Another original take on the challenge.  Not only did you interpret the challenge nicely, you photographed it beautifully, taking advantage of the low sun angle to get rich colors.  Good one!</td>', 'Another original take on the challenge.  Not only did you interpret the challenge nicely, you photographed it beautifully, taking advantage of the low sun angle to get rich colors.  Good one!', '2004-05-10 12:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(708874, 74230, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good colors and composition in this one and good use of the time of day to get rich colors.  If it was mine, I''d probably crop the left just a bit to get rid of that tree in the upper left corner.  But still, that''s minor in this nice image.</td>', 'Good colors and composition in this one and good use of the time of day to get rich colors.  If it was mine, I''d probably crop the left just a bit to get rid of that tree in the upper left corner.  But still, that''s minor in this nice image.', '2004-05-10 12:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(708875, 74481, 19831, '<td valign="top">very dark and foreboding. I like how you''ve captured that mood. Kind of a lunar landscape feel. I can''t tell if it is a closeup of something small, or a shot of something really big, I like that. good job.</td>', 'very dark and foreboding. I like how you''ve captured that mood. Kind of a lunar landscape feel. I can''t tell if it is a closeup of something small, or a shot of something really big, I like that. good job.', '2004-05-10 12:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(708879, 74269, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a good take on the challenge and you''ve seen it well.  Probably, if I was doing it, I''d crop fairly close to the barbed wire to remove the slightly distracting  greenery on the right and some of the sky at the bottom.  Still, it''s a nice one.</td>', 'This is a good take on the challenge and you''ve seen it well.  Probably, if I was doing it, I''d crop fairly close to the barbed wire to remove the slightly distracting  greenery on the right and some of the sky at the bottom.  Still, it''s a nice one.', '2004-05-10 12:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(708881, 74034, 14476, '<td valign="top">There have been lots of chain pictures in this challenge, and each has it''s own personality.  This one has such harmonious colors and textures that, for me, it stands out from the rest.  Good use of light and shadow here as well.</td>', 'There have been lots of chain pictures in this challenge, and each has it''s own personality.  This one has such harmonious colors and textures that, for me, it stands out from the rest.  Good use of light and shadow here as well.', '2004-05-10 12:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(708883, 74045, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, the colors in this one are glorious.  Good seeing and fine photography.  Nicely composed and of course, it fits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Oh, the colors in this one are glorious.  Good seeing and fine photography.  Nicely composed and of course, it fits the challenge perfectly.', '2004-05-10 12:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
