(709100, 74320, 20685, '<td valign="top">Really like this, i love photographs with artistic appeal, this could make a beautiful painting. The green gives it exactly the colour saturation that is appealing against a rusty brown. The DOF in my opinion is spot on, i''m sure ppl will say right bucket should be more in focus, but the emphasis should be on the mosquito. Well done</td>', 'Really like this, i love photographs with artistic appeal, this could make a beautiful painting. The green gives it exactly the colour saturation that is appealing against a rusty brown. The DOF in my opinion is spot on, i''m sure ppl will say right bucket should be more in focus, but the emphasis should be on the mosquito. Well done', '2004-05-10 14:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(709105, 74256, 20685, '<td valign="top">really nice composition, very unusual. I do think though shadows could have been brighter and a bit of sharpening wouldn''t have gone amiss.</td>', 'really nice composition, very unusual. I do think though shadows could have been brighter and a bit of sharpening wouldn''t have gone amiss.', '2004-05-10 14:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(709106, 74545, 17505, '<td valign="top">Great color and feel. That tire''s really something! The only thing I''d change is the cropping/framing. The lines of the windshield and top of the pump both suggest that there''s more to the picture. It makes me feel like I''m missing something. I''d have cropped it either higher or lower, but as it is the lines across the top create a feeling of incompleteness. Just my opinion. Nice shot.</td>', 'Great color and feel. That tire''s really something! The only thing I''d change is the cropping/framing. The lines of the windshield and top of the pump both suggest that there''s more to the picture. It makes me feel like I''m missing something. I''d have cropped it either higher or lower, but as it is the lines across the top create a feeling of incompleteness. Just my opinion. Nice shot.', '2004-05-10 14:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(709107, 73807, 20822, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how this follows the theme. It looks over posed from the clean box, child''s unworn shoe and her clean white sweater.</td>', 'I don''t know how this follows the theme. It looks over posed from the clean box, child''s unworn shoe and her clean white sweater.', '2004-05-10 14:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
