(709164, 74163, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like diffused background.  There is immense realism and lack of pose in this shot.  The colors are right on, the cobweb help, and I really like how the diffusion of the background works.  This picture immediately made me aware that I do not know what the galvanization process for iron is or what causes the white spots I see on galvanized pipes.  Any picture that makes me think deserves a good rating.  I just am not too happy with the composition.<br/> <br/>For me clipping each side heavily results in a much stronger picture.  On the left just to the right of the open pipe end, and to the right just a little beyond the end of the wire.<br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'I like diffused background.  There is immense realism and lack of pose in this shot.  The colors are right on, the cobweb help, and I really like how the diffusion of the background works.  This picture immediately made me aware that I do not know what the galvanization process for iron is or what causes the white spots I see on galvanized pipes.  Any picture that makes me think deserves a good rating.  I just am not too happy with the composition. For me clipping each side heavily results in a much stronger picture.  On the left just to the right of the open pipe end, and to the right just a little beyond the end of the wire. An 8.', '2004-05-10 15:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(709176, 74071, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and components of this shot.    I would have liked a deeper depth of field here as the background is not a distraction but part of the interest of this picture.  The water also does not diffuse very well, nor do the steps.  I also think I would like the picture adjusted to make the verticals vertical.  I would also like to see the lower crop not cut off the bottom of the fence vertical.<br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'I like the colors and components of this shot.    I would have liked a deeper depth of field here as the background is not a distraction but part of the interest of this picture.  The water also does not diffuse very well, nor do the steps.  I also think I would like the picture adjusted to make the verticals vertical.  I would also like to see the lower crop not cut off the bottom of the fence vertical. A 7.', '2004-05-10 15:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(709181, 74528, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice title. I like the perspective and composition.  I am a lot less keen on the choice of subject and lighting.<br/> <br/>A 5.</td>', 'Nice title. I like the perspective and composition.  I am a lot less keen on the choice of subject and lighting. A 5.', '2004-05-10 15:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(709187, 73226, 21202, '<td valign="top">The subject is mostly well lit and the the diffused background provides good contrast to expose the geometry.  The shadow and what appears to be a burned out match in the lower left hand corner detract.<br/> <br/>The point of view and composition are the larger distractions for me.<br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'The subject is mostly well lit and the the diffused background provides good contrast to expose the geometry.  The shadow and what appears to be a burned out match in the lower left hand corner detract. The point of view and composition are the larger distractions for me. A 4.', '2004-05-10 15:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(709192, 73212, 21202, '<td valign="top">oh, for just enough more at the top to complete the arc.  This photo is about circles and curves.  I love the cropping at the lower left that includes the edge. A little less glare at bottom center and off the edges of the e and r would not hurt but lighting focus color expecially on the rust in the hole in the b are excellent as is the deep black contrast in the holes.  <br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'oh, for just enough more at the top to complete the arc.  This photo is about circles and curves.  I love the cropping at the lower left that includes the edge. A little less glare at bottom center and off the edges of the e and r would not hurt but lighting focus color expecially on the rust in the hole in the b are excellent as is the deep black contrast in the holes.   An 8.', '2004-05-10 15:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(709197, 74498, 21202, '<td valign="top">A very interesting point of view and relatively interesting subject matter.  The composition of this picture is disturbing in a good sense.  If the rating were on composition alone, I would give this a 10.  I long for better focus throughout and more light from the side we are seeing.  A 6 overall.</td>', 'A very interesting point of view and relatively interesting subject matter.  The composition of this picture is disturbing in a good sense.  If the rating were on composition alone, I would give this a 10.  I long for better focus throughout and more light from the side we are seeing.  A 6 overall.', '2004-05-10 15:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(709201, 74548, 21202, '<td valign="top">The colors of rust and sky go together well.  Crop off the bottom just below the pipe and the right before you run completely out of fence and this is a highly attractive and powerful foto.  As it stands, the uninteresting overpowers the interesting.  A 4.</td>', 'The colors of rust and sky go together well.  Crop off the bottom just below the pipe and the right before you run completely out of fence and this is a highly attractive and powerful foto.  As it stands, the uninteresting overpowers the interesting.  A 4.', '2004-05-10 16:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
