(709258, 74029, 12733, '<td valign="top">This shot has it all - great detail and texture on the bird, a humorous situation and, of course, the required rust. The bird''s pose and expression truly give an impression that it is thinking exactly what''s in the title.</td>', 'This shot has it all - great detail and texture on the bird, a humorous situation and, of course, the required rust. The bird''s pose and expression truly give an impression that it is thinking exactly what''s in the title.', '2004-05-10 16:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
