(709267, 73366, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures and colors. Kind of makes you keep looking to figure out what it all means, if anything. Unfortunatly, with the other painted colors the orange looks more like another shade of paint than rust.</td>', 'Interesting textures and colors. Kind of makes you keep looking to figure out what it all means, if anything. Unfortunatly, with the other painted colors the orange looks more like another shade of paint than rust.', '2004-05-10 16:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
