(709475, 74227, 18073, '<td valign="top">Fine image, nice composition, I like the angled horizon and the colour is really nice. 8/10</td>', 'Fine image, nice composition, I like the angled horizon and the colour is really nice. 8/10', '2004-05-10 18:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(709480, 74429, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great time of day to get the most out of the reds.  The shadow of the pail occupies just a little more space than I would like.  I was born in Tulsa, but moved three days after, to a geologically minded father who often spoke of the red mud but did not mention the iron in the soil.  <br/> <br/>A 9.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Very nice.  Great time of day to get the most out of the reds.  The shadow of the pail occupies just a little more space than I would like.  I was born in Tulsa, but moved three days after, to a geologically minded father who often spoke of the red mud but did not mention the iron in the soil.   A 9. ', '2004-05-10 18:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
