(709921, 74485, 21202, '<td valign="top">Extremely nice colors.  The open door helps but I feel that there is very little in the light to be photographed from this side of vehicle.  The sky makes a nice backdrop, but the sky to the right is a much nicer blue than the sky to the left.  I think a shot from almost ground level taken from the left side would be much more lovely.<br/> <br/>A 5.</td>', 'Extremely nice colors.  The open door helps but I feel that there is very little in the light to be photographed from this side of vehicle.  The sky makes a nice backdrop, but the sky to the right is a much nicer blue than the sky to the left.  I think a shot from almost ground level taken from the left side would be much more lovely. A 5.', '2004-05-10 20:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(709923, 74481, 16301, '<td valign="top">This is a really good photo, but i''m dissapointed that it doesn''t show the rust on the pipe, because it looks like a silhouette. You could have went back another time to catch the light on the side of the pipe. I do like the composition and perspective. The sky is very moody. And that bird adds a nice touch to the photo. <br/> <br/>I''m pretty sure this is Heida, good luck :)</td>', 'This is a really good photo, but i''m dissapointed that it doesn''t show the rust on the pipe, because it looks like a silhouette. You could have went back another time to catch the light on the side of the pipe. I do like the composition and perspective. The sky is very moody. And that bird adds a nice touch to the photo.  I''m pretty sure this is Heida, good luck :)', '2004-05-10 20:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(709928, 73935, 21202, '<td valign="top">A lusty picture indeed.  I would like a little less light exposure.  The vibrance of the colors might even show up more.<br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'A lusty picture indeed.  I would like a little less light exposure.  The vibrance of the colors might even show up more. A 6.', '2004-05-10 20:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
