(709939, 74314, 21202, '<td valign="top">I very much like this idea.  The colors in both light and shade work well and the focus is perfect as rust makes itself hard to place in focus being so dust like.<br/> <br/>I just kind of wish the model was holding camera to eye.  The shadow would have a little more of a story to tell.<br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'I very much like this idea.  The colors in both light and shade work well and the focus is perfect as rust makes itself hard to place in focus being so dust like. I just kind of wish the model was holding camera to eye.  The shadow would have a little more of a story to tell. An 8.', '2004-05-10 20:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
