(709985, 73822, 21202, '<td valign="top">The challenge is well met in choice of subject.  It is an interesting composition of rusted objects.  Aesthetically I like it far better when I crop off the Chain link fence.<br/> <br/>The lighting is very subdued on such a dark subject, and with repetitive objects it is hard to establish a point of foucus.  Overall this is a very soft picture of some very hard wheels.  The colors themselves are also dull as rust is said to be.  However, a study of other photos in this challenge, show that rust can exhibit some very lively and attractive colors.  <br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'The challenge is well met in choice of subject.  It is an interesting composition of rusted objects.  Aesthetically I like it far better when I crop off the Chain link fence. The lighting is very subdued on such a dark subject, and with repetitive objects it is hard to establish a point of foucus.  Overall this is a very soft picture of some very hard wheels.  The colors themselves are also dull as rust is said to be.  However, a study of other photos in this challenge, show that rust can exhibit some very lively and attractive colors.   A 4.', '2004-05-10 21:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
