(710006, 74108, 21202, '<td valign="top">Cartographer with a great sense of light and color.  I assume that is prime meridean so boldly rendered.<br/> <br/>Great job.  A 9, but only in comparison to some of the other pictures I have already rated.  This should end up in upper 10%.</td>', 'Cartographer with a great sense of light and color.  I assume that is prime meridean so boldly rendered. Great job.  A 9, but only in comparison to some of the other pictures I have already rated.  This should end up in upper 10%.', '2004-05-10 21:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(710011, 74115, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Very nice.  I was hoping to see a sepia or black and white in the challenge.  And you have mastered it.  Beautiful.  I hope to see this in the top when voting is over.  Lovely composition.  I love how you have placed your subjects within the photo.  The sheep is just out of the way of the rusty thing, but still in the photo, which makes your rusty thing look really cool.  Focus and clarity are amazing, and lighting appears to have been on your side this day.  I love the crop.  This would make a beautiful pring.  Excellent job.  10 ~Heather~</td>', 'Wow.  Very nice.  I was hoping to see a sepia or black and white in the challenge.  And you have mastered it.  Beautiful.  I hope to see this in the top when voting is over.  Lovely composition.  I love how you have placed your subjects within the photo.  The sheep is just out of the way of the rusty thing, but still in the photo, which makes your rusty thing look really cool.  Focus and clarity are amazing, and lighting appears to have been on your side this day.  I love the crop.  This would make a beautiful pring.  Excellent job.  10 ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 21:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(710012, 73296, 21202, '<td valign="top">This runs the full gamut of real ugliness to real beauty.  Give me more blue!<br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'This runs the full gamut of real ugliness to real beauty.  Give me more blue! An 8.', '2004-05-10 21:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(710018, 74056, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s rust.  A little more interesting that just plain rust due to the leaf that is stuck in it.  The color is well...rusty, and I think that the lighting brings that out nicely.  Placement of the subject is dead center.  I''m wondering if there may be some more interesting place to put it.  To the side of the photo, or maybe a dramatic angle, to make this really punch.  Focus and clarity are alright.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Well, it''s rust.  A little more interesting that just plain rust due to the leaf that is stuck in it.  The color is well...rusty, and I think that the lighting brings that out nicely.  Placement of the subject is dead center.  I''m wondering if there may be some more interesting place to put it.  To the side of the photo, or maybe a dramatic angle, to make this really punch.  Focus and clarity are alright.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 21:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(710021, 73914, 21202, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this taken with a wide enough angle in height to include the bottom of the turbine.  The tight cropping to the sides of the mill works well for me as does the setting lighting and focus.  The galvanized roof contrasts well with the turbine, and the faded paint contrasts well with the spring foliage.  Very nice job.<br/> <br/>A 9.</td>', 'I would have liked to see this taken with a wide enough angle in height to include the bottom of the turbine.  The tight cropping to the sides of the mill works well for me as does the setting lighting and focus.  The galvanized roof contrasts well with the turbine, and the faded paint contrasts well with the spring foliage.  Very nice job. A 9.', '2004-05-10 21:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(710023, 73577, 3080, '<td valign="top">Yup, it''s rust.  The texture is interesting, and I think that the cracks in the thing are neat.  The color stands out nicely.  DOF is good for this shot, and your focus on the subject really helps to bring out detail and texture.  Lighting looks to have been on your side this day.  Maybe it''s just this whole ''rust'' topic, but it does lack excitement.  Still technically well done though.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Yup, it''s rust.  The texture is interesting, and I think that the cracks in the thing are neat.  The color stands out nicely.  DOF is good for this shot, and your focus on the subject really helps to bring out detail and texture.  Lighting looks to have been on your side this day.  Maybe it''s just this whole ''rust'' topic, but it does lack excitement.  Still technically well done though.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 21:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(710029, 74236, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo of the unaesthetic appearance of rural sprawl.<br/> <br/>It is just not my cup of tea.<br/> <br/>A 2.</td>', 'This is a good photo of the unaesthetic appearance of rural sprawl. It is just not my cup of tea. A 2.', '2004-05-10 21:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(710035, 73753, 3080, '<td valign="top">I guess that the rust doesn''t just jump out and grab me here.  Is the dark car in the front rusted?  Or is it just dark.  Is the darkness rust? Or is that the color is should be?  I like how you are looking through the older looking car, towards the fresh painted beauties.  The color in the background near the upper right corner of the photo seems a bit muted, or blah.  Probably due to bright lighting conditions in that direction.  Definately a different take on the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'I guess that the rust doesn''t just jump out and grab me here.  Is the dark car in the front rusted?  Or is it just dark.  Is the darkness rust? Or is that the color is should be?  I like how you are looking through the older looking car, towards the fresh painted beauties.  The color in the background near the upper right corner of the photo seems a bit muted, or blah.  Probably due to bright lighting conditions in that direction.  Definately a different take on the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 21:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(710038, 73670, 7703, '<td valign="top">There is not much of rust in this photo but I like your idea. The colors are great.</td>', 'There is not much of rust in this photo but I like your idea. The colors are great.', '2004-05-10 21:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(710041, 73221, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really wish this photo were a bit larger.   The rules state that your photo can actually be up to 640x640.  I would take advantage of that size availability because I really can''t see anything in this tiny little photo.  Is there even rust in it??  I really can''t see any rust.  As for the photo itself, the angle is interesting.  I like the diagonals.  The man in the bottom left is too dark, and I can''t really tell how the focus is from the small size of the image.  Sorry.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I really wish this photo were a bit larger.   The rules state that your photo can actually be up to 640x640.  I would take advantage of that size availability because I really can''t see anything in this tiny little photo.  Is there even rust in it??  I really can''t see any rust.  As for the photo itself, the angle is interesting.  I like the diagonals.  The man in the bottom left is too dark, and I can''t really tell how the focus is from the small size of the image.  Sorry.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 21:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(710042, 74019, 7703, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how I like this picture ...hard to vote on but not bad photo I have to say. Nothing I would hang on my wall but it shows rust so I have to vote you something.</td>', 'Don''t know how I like this picture ...hard to vote on but not bad photo I have to say. Nothing I would hang on my wall but it shows rust so I have to vote you something.', '2004-05-10 21:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(710048, 73906, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very lovely scene.  The branch in ther foreground and the bridge in the back along with the spring leaves on the trees and their reflection in the still water all work for me. The rusted gears present a view of past human intervention placing in time the construction of dam and bridge.  The building itself is timeless although my mind imagines modern cars parked behind.  I like staying studying this picture, but must move on only after remarking tht it is a little dimly lit given the darkness of the rust.  A little fill flash might have helped.<br/> <br/>A 9.</td>', 'Very lovely scene.  The branch in ther foreground and the bridge in the back along with the spring leaves on the trees and their reflection in the still water all work for me. The rusted gears present a view of past human intervention placing in time the construction of dam and bridge.  The building itself is timeless although my mind imagines modern cars parked behind.  I like staying studying this picture, but must move on only after remarking tht it is a little dimly lit given the darkness of the rust.  A little fill flash might have helped. A 9.', '2004-05-10 21:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(710050, 74270, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting and unique take on the challenge.  Definately rusted, and definately not boring.  I think that you did a fine job of being creative here.  I like the placement of the guy with the pressure washer.  He is in the photo, yet out of the way enough to also let us focus on the rust too.  Focus and clarity are good.  Really nice detail on both the guy and the wall/fence thingy.  I like the way the water mists like that.  Lighting looks like it was on your side this day.  Overall a nice photo of rust.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Interesting and unique take on the challenge.  Definately rusted, and definately not boring.  I think that you did a fine job of being creative here.  I like the placement of the guy with the pressure washer.  He is in the photo, yet out of the way enough to also let us focus on the rust too.  Focus and clarity are good.  Really nice detail on both the guy and the wall/fence thingy.  I like the way the water mists like that.  Lighting looks like it was on your side this day.  Overall a nice photo of rust.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 21:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(710053, 74481, 7703, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but when I saw this photo I thought that Heida where the photographer ... but I''m propable wrong. I don''t see much of rust in this photo but it is there so I have to vote something ... love the sky, dark and blue.</td>', 'I don''t know why but when I saw this photo I thought that Heida where the photographer ... but I''m propable wrong. I don''t see much of rust in this photo but it is there so I have to vote something ... love the sky, dark and blue.', '2004-05-10 21:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(710058, 73769, 7703, '<td valign="top">To much movement in this phot for my taste ...  But if I ignore that then you have a rust in the photo so you got the challenge right.</td>', 'To much movement in this phot for my taste ...  But if I ignore that then you have a rust in the photo so you got the challenge right.', '2004-05-10 21:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
