(710066, 74224, 21202, '<td valign="top">The rust is not highly apparent, but I care not. Other than desiring a little less cropped from the bottom, a little more cropped from the left,  and a little more light / focus on the model''s face I reallly like this visual reminder of the age of european towns and cities.<br/> <br/>A 9.</td>', 'The rust is not highly apparent, but I care not. Other than desiring a little less cropped from the bottom, a little more cropped from the left,  and a little more light / focus on the model''s face I reallly like this visual reminder of the age of european towns and cities. A 9.', '2004-05-10 21:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(710068, 74299, 3080, '<td valign="top">definately rusty, however, the subject is not drawing me in.  To quote Simon from American Idot "boring".  I don''t like the way the subject is dead center in the photo.  not even a dramatic angle, or a close up.  the background is alright, although really grainy, there is nothing distracting in the background.  focus and clarity are alright, and lighting seems to be good for the photo.  Did you try to up the saturation?  I think that may help to bring out some added color in the reds of the rust.  just a suggestion. ~Heather~</td>', 'definately rusty, however, the subject is not drawing me in.  To quote Simon from American Idot "boring".  I don''t like the way the subject is dead center in the photo.  not even a dramatic angle, or a close up.  the background is alright, although really grainy, there is nothing distracting in the background.  focus and clarity are alright, and lighting seems to be good for the photo.  Did you try to up the saturation?  I think that may help to bring out some added color in the reds of the rust.  just a suggestion. ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 21:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
