(710124, 74021, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast.  The glare on the flower though indicates how much light is required to adequately photograph dark dusty rust.  I would suggest trying a very long exposure at very small aperture late in the day to fully bring out the colors of each without the strong shadows. <br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'Very nice contrast.  The glare on the flower though indicates how much light is required to adequately photograph dark dusty rust.  I would suggest trying a very long exposure at very small aperture late in the day to fully bring out the colors of each without the strong shadows.  A 6.', '2004-05-10 21:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
