(710138, 74418, 21202, '<td valign="top">This title reminds me of the one eyed one horned purple people eater.  Were the people purple or was the people eater purple.  It took a picture to answer the question.  This bike is the most rusted bike I have ever seen.  Nice lighting and beautiful setting with lovely spring blossoms, rocks, trees, and woods subdued but not lost in diffusion.  I hope a lot of the other entrants study this picture.<br/> <br/>A 10.</td>', 'This title reminds me of the one eyed one horned purple people eater.  Were the people purple or was the people eater purple.  It took a picture to answer the question.  This bike is the most rusted bike I have ever seen.  Nice lighting and beautiful setting with lovely spring blossoms, rocks, trees, and woods subdued but not lost in diffusion.  I hope a lot of the other entrants study this picture. A 10.', '2004-05-10 21:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
