(710303, 73796, 21202, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very lovely barn in a very lovely setting.  I would like this framed more to the left.  It appears as if there is more of interest to the left and the tall tree on the right is not needed to frame the barn.  The sky is lovely especially the cloud immediately over the center of the barn.<br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'I think this is a very lovely barn in a very lovely setting.  I would like this framed more to the left.  It appears as if there is more of interest to the left and the tall tree on the right is not needed to frame the barn.  The sky is lovely especially the cloud immediately over the center of the barn. A 6.', '2004-05-10 22:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(710304, 74482, 20822, '<td valign="top">background is to clean</td>', 'background is to clean', '2004-05-10 23:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(710305, 73945, 21202, '<td valign="top">The duct tape is surprisingly attractive, moreso than the rust.  The focus is good.<br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'The duct tape is surprisingly attractive, moreso than the rust.  The focus is good. A 4.', '2004-05-10 23:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(710306, 73921, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of negative space, and the remaining paint on the circular door really increases the interest of this very nice composition.<br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'Very nice use of negative space, and the remaining paint on the circular door really increases the interest of this very nice composition. A 7.', '2004-05-10 23:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(710309, 73754, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful image.  I am sorry you made it less than half what you could have submitted.<br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'This is a very beautiful image.  I am sorry you made it less than half what you could have submitted. A 6.', '2004-05-10 23:03:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(710313, 74163, 20613, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot!!  This is one of my favorites in the rust challenge.  I love how the spider webs surround the rust.  It helps the viewer to remember that rust is old, and it also gives a rather ancient, mysterious feeling.  Amazing job.  Also, the photo is perfectly in focus.  10!</td>', 'Amazing shot!!  This is one of my favorites in the rust challenge.  I love how the spider webs surround the rust.  It helps the viewer to remember that rust is old, and it also gives a rather ancient, mysterious feeling.  Amazing job.  Also, the photo is perfectly in focus.  10!', '2004-05-10 23:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(710316, 73861, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful!  Great shot!</td>', 'This is very beautiful!  Great shot!', '2004-05-10 23:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(710318, 73843, 21202, '<td valign="top">The spring leaves work very well in bringing life to the  dull brown of rust my eye is led to the far supporting arch, but the rest of the picture seems out of harmony  with the line of that arch.  A more traditional look down the bridge might serve this subject better than the one chosen.<br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'The spring leaves work very well in bringing life to the  dull brown of rust my eye is led to the far supporting arch, but the rest of the picture seems out of harmony  with the line of that arch.  A more traditional look down the bridge might serve this subject better than the one chosen. A 4.', '2004-05-10 23:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(710319, 74203, 20613, '<td valign="top">amazing shot!  i love the title.</td>', 'amazing shot!  i love the title.', '2004-05-10 23:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(710321, 74368, 21202, '<td valign="top">I hope you are referring to the car and not the picture.  Thie picture certainly should be headed to hanging on many walls.<br/> <br/>Very nice work.<br/> <br/>A 10.</td>', 'I hope you are referring to the car and not the picture.  Thie picture certainly should be headed to hanging on many walls. Very nice work. A 10.', '2004-05-10 23:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(710323, 73723, 21202, '<td valign="top">The background steals too much from a lovely photographed foreground.<br/> <br/>A 5.</td>', 'The background steals too much from a lovely photographed foreground. A 5.', '2004-05-10 23:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(710325, 74527, 21202, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the wagon will be.  But not this photo.  Lovely shot.<br/> <br/>A 9.</td>', 'Perhaps the wagon will be.  But not this photo.  Lovely shot. A 9.', '2004-05-10 23:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(710327, 74340, 21202, '<td valign="top">focus anyone?  Lovely colors and flow of light.<br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'focus anyone?  Lovely colors and flow of light. A 4.', '2004-05-10 23:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(710328, 74341, 3080, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are really muted and dull.  Possible result of too bright of a light, or if you raised the brightness in a photo editing program, that would do it too.  Your background is horribly tilted.  Straighten that up.  The sky is white and very blown out.  Your subject definately contains rust, but I think that''s all you have going for you.  Even the focus is soft.  I don''t mean to sound harsh, but you should really take your time when shooting.  Also, if you have a photo editing program, try upping the contrast and lessening the brightness.  I think that could help a bit with the washed out color.  Also, try upping the saturation slightly.  ~Heather~</td>', 'The colors in this shot are really muted and dull.  Possible result of too bright of a light, or if you raised the brightness in a photo editing program, that would do it too.  Your background is horribly tilted.  Straighten that up.  The sky is white and very blown out.  Your subject definately contains rust, but I think that''s all you have going for you.  Even the focus is soft.  I don''t mean to sound harsh, but you should really take your time when shooting.  Also, if you have a photo editing program, try upping the contrast and lessening the brightness.  I think that could help a bit with the washed out color.  Also, try upping the saturation slightly.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 23:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(710330, 73545, 20822, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2004-05-10 23:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(710333, 74509, 21585, '<td valign="top">That photo was taken in confidence, you shouldnt be posting things like that. Never even called me either. Nice shot though.</td>', 'That photo was taken in confidence, you shouldnt be posting things like that. Never even called me either. Nice shot though.', '2004-05-10 23:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(710335, 73646, 21202, '<td valign="top">Yes that is how much light it takes to photograph dark unreflective rust.  It is far too much for the rose whose beauty is lost in glare.  If the rose could be in the shade and the rust in full sunlight, I think you could have a really nice photo, although I would place the container so it did not bisect the lower square pipe and the picture itself.<br/> <br/>A 4.<br/></td>', 'Yes that is how much light it takes to photograph dark unreflective rust.  It is far too much for the rose whose beauty is lost in glare.  If the rose could be in the shade and the rust in full sunlight, I think you could have a really nice photo, although I would place the container so it did not bisect the lower square pipe and the picture itself. A 4.', '2004-05-10 23:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(710337, 73217, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think that this could have worked well in black and white.  I don''t think that the rust is strong enough to hold it''s own without the color here.  Also, your image seems a bit soft to me.  The tonal range seems harsh.  The light coming from the left side is stronger than on the left, which causes some washed out looking area on the left.  I like the subject.  Overall it''s ok, but it''s just not strong. ~Heather~</td>', 'I think that this could have worked well in black and white.  I don''t think that the rust is strong enough to hold it''s own without the color here.  Also, your image seems a bit soft to me.  The tonal range seems harsh.  The light coming from the left side is stronger than on the left, which causes some washed out looking area on the left.  I like the subject.  Overall it''s ok, but it''s just not strong. ~Heather~', '2004-05-10 23:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(710338, 74402, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	8	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	3	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	10	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	6.75	     Dick<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	6	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	8	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	3	How well does it meet the challenge:	10	Total Averaged Rating	6.75	     Dick', '2004-05-10 23:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(710339, 74053, 21202, '<td valign="top">The glare on the lower right hand corner unfortunately is more than the rest of the picture can compensate.  I do like the stack of rusty pancake like image though.  A sun shield over the lens could have saved this picture.<br/> <br/>A 3.</td>', 'The glare on the lower right hand corner unfortunately is more than the rest of the picture can compensate.  I do like the stack of rusty pancake like image though.  A sun shield over the lens could have saved this picture. A 3.', '2004-05-10 23:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
