(710345, 74018, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	9	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	10	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	7	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	10	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	9.00	     Dick<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	9	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	10	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	7	How well does it meet the challenge:	10	Total Averaged Rating	9.00	     Dick', '2004-05-10 23:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(710346, 74438, 21202, '<td valign="top">And a nice view it is even if that old rusty fence gets in the way.  Certainly better than the kid''s falling in the river.  I would be tempted, however, to thrust my head through the fence and get an unhindered view.  Lovely shot even with rust.  Hope you got one without.<br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'And a nice view it is even if that old rusty fence gets in the way.  Certainly better than the kid''s falling in the river.  I would be tempted, however, to thrust my head through the fence and get an unhindered view.  Lovely shot even with rust.  Hope you got one without. An 8.', '2004-05-10 23:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
