(710356, 73335, 21202, '<td valign="top">I was a little slow getting this.  Advanced years I guess.   A bright shiny new little set of pliers might have got me on board quicker than the screw did.  The orange background in marvellous with the deep blue green of the rusted steel. The red of the remaining paint is less attractive.  This image really requires an uneven treatment of light, less for the screw and more for the dark rust on the pliers.<br/> <br/> <br/>A 6.  I really like the orange.</td>', 'I was a little slow getting this.  Advanced years I guess.   A bright shiny new little set of pliers might have got me on board quicker than the screw did.  The orange background in marvellous with the deep blue green of the rusted steel. The red of the remaining paint is less attractive.  This image really requires an uneven treatment of light, less for the screw and more for the dark rust on the pliers.  A 6.  I really like the orange.', '2004-05-10 23:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
