(710369, 73171, 18868, '<td valign="top">I think the duotone detracts from what might be a very interesting image.  Perhaps a softer, nostalgic, even sentimental image might work really well with this particular subject -- which I really like.</td>', 'I think the duotone detracts from what might be a very interesting image.  Perhaps a softer, nostalgic, even sentimental image might work really well with this particular subject -- which I really like.', '2004-05-10 23:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
