(710379, 74044, 18868, '<td valign="top">Really nice title.  Perhaps there''s a touch too much adjustment on the saturation.  Awesome wood texture, nicely balanced composition.  I think this should do well.</td>', 'Really nice title.  Perhaps there''s a touch too much adjustment on the saturation.  Awesome wood texture, nicely balanced composition.  I think this should do well.', '2004-05-10 23:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
