(710388, 74182, 18868, '<td valign="top">Really nice color, really nice composition.  The border even works.</td>', 'Really nice color, really nice composition.  The border even works.', '2004-05-10 23:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(710392, 74365, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice color combination, as well as nice shapes.  The shadows though distract from the lines of the sculpture.<br/> <br/>An  8.</td>', 'Very nice color combination, as well as nice shapes.  The shadows though distract from the lines of the sculpture. An  8.', '2004-05-10 23:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(710399, 74531, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but shooting into the sun is poor practice.  Both the strange little white fleck in the center (a lens flare spot), and the washed out left side are results of this.  Additionally, the trees in the background are "growing" out of the tank on the firetruck: the framing of the subject is nice, but the overall composition is lacking in attention to detail.  Keep at it -- you have an eye for it.</td>', 'Nice subject, but shooting into the sun is poor practice.  Both the strange little white fleck in the center (a lens flare spot), and the washed out left side are results of this.  Additionally, the trees in the background are "growing" out of the tank on the firetruck: the framing of the subject is nice, but the overall composition is lacking in attention to detail.  Keep at it -- you have an eye for it.', '2004-05-10 23:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(710400, 74519, 21202, '<td valign="top">The rust on the base of the oldest object is the most interesting part of this picture for me, although it is not where the spotlight lights.  These objects lack harmony in color and do not really appear to be stages of the same disintegration.  I would also favor a change in both setting and composition.<br/> <br/>A 3.</td>', 'The rust on the base of the oldest object is the most interesting part of this picture for me, although it is not where the spotlight lights.  These objects lack harmony in color and do not really appear to be stages of the same disintegration.  I would also favor a change in both setting and composition. A 3.', '2004-05-10 23:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(710404, 74531, 21202, '<td valign="top">Quite nice although a little to much glare.  <br/> <br/>An 8.<br/></td>', 'Quite nice although a little to much glare.   An 8.', '2004-05-10 23:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(710410, 73355, 18868, '<td valign="top">Pretty dramatically oversharpened.  This looks to me like a flat pic that had the contrast boosted too much.  It needs less emphasis on the highlights and more range in the mid-tones.</td>', 'Pretty dramatically oversharpened.  This looks to me like a flat pic that had the contrast boosted too much.  It needs less emphasis on the highlights and more range in the mid-tones.', '2004-05-10 23:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(710417, 74490, 18868, '<td valign="top">FABULOUS title!  Really unique and witty shot, almost like a Hitchcock where you know there''s rust there, but you can''t see it, yet the implication is vivid.  I think (and hope) this should do well, at least with the US voters -- I don''t know if WD40 is an international product.</td>', 'FABULOUS title!  Really unique and witty shot, almost like a Hitchcock where you know there''s rust there, but you can''t see it, yet the implication is vivid.  I think (and hope) this should do well, at least with the US voters -- I don''t know if WD40 is an international product.', '2004-05-10 23:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(710420, 74392, 21202, '<td valign="top">I will ignore the title.  This is quite a lovely composition, with very lovely colors and great lighting.  Very interesting how trees have taken root in the engine compartment.   Also the chrome and some of the paint have held up very well when the fate of the unprotected has been so great.<br/> <br/>A 9.</td>', 'I will ignore the title.  This is quite a lovely composition, with very lovely colors and great lighting.  Very interesting how trees have taken root in the engine compartment.   Also the chrome and some of the paint have held up very well when the fate of the unprotected has been so great. A 9.', '2004-05-10 23:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(710421, 73221, 21202, '<td valign="top">And the rust?<br/> <br/>A 1.</td>', 'And the rust? A 1.', '2004-05-10 23:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(710430, 74227, 21202, '<td valign="top">Truly a gorgeous image.The horizon just seems a little off, and I don''t mean from the horizontal, but off of where the perspective of horizontal eyes viewing this would lead. I want to tilt my head to the right to look at this.  The highlight in the sky right at the prow is very serendipitous and the overall lighting, colors, textures, superb.  <br/> <br/>A 10.</td>', 'Truly a gorgeous image.The horizon just seems a little off, and I don''t mean from the horizontal, but off of where the perspective of horizontal eyes viewing this would lead. I want to tilt my head to the right to look at this.  The highlight in the sky right at the prow is very serendipitous and the overall lighting, colors, textures, superb.   A 10.', '2004-05-10 23:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(710431, 73914, 18868, '<td valign="top">You might want to consider a little less information in your titles...<br/> <br/>Technically speaking, the image is somewhat over exposed-- the sky and the tin roof are both blown out to white.  Use less exposure or focus/meter on a lighter subject to force the camera to automatically expose less.</td>', 'You might want to consider a little less information in your titles... Technically speaking, the image is somewhat over exposed-- the sky and the tin roof are both blown out to white.  Use less exposure or focus/meter on a lighter subject to force the camera to automatically expose less.', '2004-05-10 23:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(710436, 74241, 21202, '<td valign="top">A mirrored light at that.  The glare is a little unfortunate as theis is a remarkable picture and the shades of gold and orange are wonderful.<br/> <br/>An 8.</td>', 'A mirrored light at that.  The glare is a little unfortunate as theis is a remarkable picture and the shades of gold and orange are wonderful. An 8.', '2004-05-10 23:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(710442, 74391, 18868, '<td valign="top">I get -- and just barely -- that the nail is in a drink.  Perhaps this information could be better understood if you pulled back a little bit and included the rim of the glass.</td>', 'I get -- and just barely -- that the nail is in a drink.  Perhaps this information could be better understood if you pulled back a little bit and included the rim of the glass.', '2004-05-10 23:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(710444, 74172, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of the tractor and orchard.  The residential area behind seems out of place.  Spring grass is so yellow that a better contrast for the orange of the tractor might come later in the year, especially with a deeper blue in the sky.<br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'Nice picture of the tractor and orchard.  The residential area behind seems out of place.  Spring grass is so yellow that a better contrast for the orange of the tractor might come later in the year, especially with a deeper blue in the sky. A 6.', '2004-05-11 00:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(710447, 74538, 21202, '<td valign="top">But an amazingly well lit underside.  Nice choice of timeof day.<br/> <br/>If only the sky were a little deeper blue.<br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'But an amazingly well lit underside.  Nice choice of timeof day. If only the sky were a little deeper blue. A 7.', '2004-05-11 00:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(710450, 73211, 21202, '<td valign="top">I take it this is a work in progress then.  The humidity is a little muddy in appearance and detracts from the loveliness of the rust that has already formed.<br/> <br/>A 5.</td>', 'I take it this is a work in progress then.  The humidity is a little muddy in appearance and detracts from the loveliness of the rust that has already formed. A 5.', '2004-05-11 00:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(710451, 74537, 18868, '<td valign="top">The shot seems pretty over-exposed.  There is too much light color, and even the darkest shadows aren''t very dark, which wouldn''t be so bad, but the mid-tones are also quite pale.  A session with Levels in Photoshop will fix this.</td>', 'The shot seems pretty over-exposed.  There is too much light color, and even the darkest shadows aren''t very dark, which wouldn''t be so bad, but the mid-tones are also quite pale.  A session with Levels in Photoshop will fix this.', '2004-05-11 00:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
