(710461, 73913, 21202, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t mind if you found another title for this shot.  The bird is definitely cute.  You might want to compare to the finch I got a picture of in my birds album at webshots.  (See my profile for url.)  The orange of the out of focus building in helps create a beautiful setting for this shot.  Very, very nice.<br/> <br/>A 9.</td>', 'I wouldn''t mind if you found another title for this shot.  The bird is definitely cute.  You might want to compare to the finch I got a picture of in my birds album at webshots.  (See my profile for url.)  The orange of the out of focus building in helps create a beautiful setting for this shot.  Very, very nice. A 9.', '2004-05-11 00:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(710463, 73492, 21202, '<td valign="top">Great model, great expression and wonderful skin tones.  All I wonder about is the source of the bang itself.  Beautifully composed, framed and cropped.  Very imaginative.  Great work.<br/> <br/>A 9.</td>', 'Great model, great expression and wonderful skin tones.  All I wonder about is the source of the bang itself.  Beautifully composed, framed and cropped.  Very imaginative.  Great work. A 9.', '2004-05-11 00:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(710464, 74272, 18868, '<td valign="top">cool idea, but marred by a couple of technical details: the frog (the real name of that wedge thing in the middle) isn''t centered -- cropping in photoshop would have been totally appropriate; the sky is almost completely blown out as is the rail on the right; and I might suggest a little more saturation in Pshop as some was lost due to the over-exposure.  A potentially very nice shot.</td>', 'cool idea, but marred by a couple of technical details: the frog (the real name of that wedge thing in the middle) isn''t centered -- cropping in photoshop would have been totally appropriate; the sky is almost completely blown out as is the rail on the right; and I might suggest a little more saturation in Pshop as some was lost due to the over-exposure.  A potentially very nice shot.', '2004-05-11 00:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
