(710548, 74227, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this a great deal. In spite of a few flaws it may well be best of show. The sloping horizon bothers me a bit but it seems to work with the rest of the composition. Love the colors and levels. Misty sky with a hint of sun about to emerge adds drama. Good luck. - 10</td>', 'I like this a great deal. In spite of a few flaws it may well be best of show. The sloping horizon bothers me a bit but it seems to work with the rest of the composition. Love the colors and levels. Misty sky with a hint of sun about to emerge adds drama. Good luck. - 10', '2004-05-11 01:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(710550, 74489, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simply a beautiful picture. the abstract/macro appeals to me. Focus is incredible. Colors and contrast really make it pop. Good candidate for best of show. - 10</td>', 'Simply a beautiful picture. the abstract/macro appeals to me. Focus is incredible. Colors and contrast really make it pop. Good candidate for best of show. - 10', '2004-05-11 01:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
