(710747, 74466, 21158, '<td valign="top">If your camera supports it I would have adjusted the EV to capture the rocks in the water..7</td>', 'If your camera supports it I would have adjusted the EV to capture the rocks in the water..7', '2004-05-11 07:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
