(710752, 74224, 21158, '<td valign="top">driving in Milan I see....nice concept shot. Could be a little sharper..</td>', 'driving in Milan I see....nice concept shot. Could be a little sharper..', '2004-05-11 07:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(710757, 74540, 20204, '<td valign="top">The rain makes a great effect in this shot.  Kind of eerie overall but creative.</td>', 'The rain makes a great effect in this shot.  Kind of eerie overall but creative.', '2004-05-11 08:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(710758, 74536, 20204, '<td valign="top">The patterns created by the foreground are very cool.  It''s also nice to see the blending red sky in the background.  Depth of field seems perfect and the foreground is well composed.  8 from me - very well done!</td>', 'The patterns created by the foreground are very cool.  It''s also nice to see the blending red sky in the background.  Depth of field seems perfect and the foreground is well composed.  8 from me - very well done!', '2004-05-11 08:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(710759, 74034, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry at the top of the image, and the subject is definitely interesting.  I would like to see some more saturation in this image.</td>', 'I like the symmetry at the top of the image, and the subject is definitely interesting.  I would like to see some more saturation in this image.', '2004-05-11 08:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(710760, 74044, 20204, '<td valign="top">This image has my favorite quality - reward for a secnod glance.  So much detail in the wood, the assorted hardware, and yet the image isn''t cluttered at all.  I also like the lock / chain being off-center.  I enjoyed this one!</td>', 'This image has my favorite quality - reward for a secnod glance.  So much detail in the wood, the assorted hardware, and yet the image isn''t cluttered at all.  I also like the lock / chain being off-center.  I enjoyed this one!', '2004-05-11 08:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(710761, 74115, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the depth of field in this, and its softness.  This image captures a kind of a peaceful mood - I can almost feel a breeze coming out of it.  The lack of color in this shot is perfect for the mood as well.  Great picture!</td>', 'I love the depth of field in this, and its softness.  This image captures a kind of a peaceful mood - I can almost feel a breeze coming out of it.  The lack of color in this shot is perfect for the mood as well.  Great picture!', '2004-05-11 08:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(710762, 74544, 21432, '<td valign="top">I like the use of color.</td>', 'I like the use of color.', '2004-05-11 08:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(710763, 74382, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness, excellent lighting, and I like the composition.  Leaving a bit of pure blue sky ,akes a nice contrast.  Great picture!</td>', 'Great sharpness, excellent lighting, and I like the composition.  Leaving a bit of pure blue sky ,akes a nice contrast.  Great picture!', '2004-05-11 08:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(710764, 74340, 21432, '<td valign="top">I can''t even tell what this is.</td>', 'I can''t even tell what this is.', '2004-05-11 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(710765, 74409, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective on this shot, and the border is a great compliment to the image.  I wish I''d been able to get lighting this good in my entry!  Very well done.</td>', 'I love the perspective on this shot, and the border is a great compliment to the image.  I wish I''d been able to get lighting this good in my entry!  Very well done.', '2004-05-11 08:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(710767, 73955, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and b/w in this shot.  Its grainy quality also adds to the aging vibe.  The open doors almost make it seem alive, betraying its original look of being a relic.  Great shot!</td>', 'I like the contrast and b/w in this shot.  Its grainy quality also adds to the aging vibe.  The open doors almost make it seem alive, betraying its original look of being a relic.  Great shot!', '2004-05-11 08:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(710768, 74469, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the black background - it really emphasizes the subject.  The depth of field seems excellent as well.  I also like the composition; I wouldn''t have thought to crop it this way - but I''m glad you did as I both enjoyed and learned from it.  Great shot!</td>', 'I like the black background - it really emphasizes the subject.  The depth of field seems excellent as well.  I also like the composition; I wouldn''t have thought to crop it this way - but I''m glad you did as I both enjoyed and learned from it.  Great shot!', '2004-05-11 08:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(710769, 73490, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic!  There is so much detail in this shot, and the nail is so nicely contrasted on the old wood.  8 from me - really enjoyed it!</td>', 'This is fantastic!  There is so much detail in this shot, and the nail is so nicely contrasted on the old wood.  8 from me - really enjoyed it!', '2004-05-11 08:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(710771, 74281, 20204, '<td valign="top">This looks like a microscope image!  I love the colors, patterns, etc.  This is a very creative entry - great shot!</td>', 'This looks like a microscope image!  I love the colors, patterns, etc.  This is a very creative entry - great shot!', '2004-05-11 08:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(710772, 74096, 21432, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp image againist the very blurred background.</td>', 'I like the sharp image againist the very blurred background.', '2004-05-11 08:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(710773, 73914, 21432, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2004-05-11 08:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(710774, 74498, 21432, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh.</td>', 'Nice bokeh.', '2004-05-11 08:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(710775, 74241, 21432, '<td valign="top">Neat subject, sharp, good bokeh and lighting.</td>', 'Neat subject, sharp, good bokeh and lighting.', '2004-05-11 08:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(710776, 74353, 20204, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are fanstastic!   The subject is interesting, and the whicpy clouds in the background contribute to a sense of timelessness.  Great shot!</td>', 'The colors in this shot are fanstastic!   The subject is interesting, and the whicpy clouds in the background contribute to a sense of timelessness.  Great shot!', '2004-05-11 08:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(710777, 74230, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great point of view - it makes the shot!</td>', 'Great point of view - it makes the shot!', '2004-05-11 08:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(710778, 73868, 21432, '<td valign="top">Creative.</td>', 'Creative.', '2004-05-11 08:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(710779, 74165, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the way this is cropped, and the image quality is excellent.  Well done!</td>', 'I like the way this is cropped, and the image quality is excellent.  Well done!', '2004-05-11 08:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(710780, 73756, 21432, '<td valign="top">Image to small and soft.</td>', 'Image to small and soft.', '2004-05-11 08:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(710781, 73343, 20204, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting to see such an obviously old and abandoned train with its stairs and bench right there.  Great subject.  I also like the composition - great shot.</td>', 'It''s interesting to see such an obviously old and abandoned train with its stairs and bench right there.  Great subject.  I also like the composition - great shot.', '2004-05-11 08:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(710782, 74352, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not normally into the industrial shots, but I think this image has a great balance of patterns, and is uniquely softened by the smoke trails from the stacks.  The entire image is in excellent focus as well, so a well done image overall.</td>', 'I''m not normally into the industrial shots, but I think this image has a great balance of patterns, and is uniquely softened by the smoke trails from the stacks.  The entire image is in excellent focus as well, so a well done image overall.', '2004-05-11 08:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(710783, 74198, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think your choice of backgrouns is excellent - blends nicely.  The shadows are also perfect.  Great shot!</td>', 'I think your choice of backgrouns is excellent - blends nicely.  The shadows are also perfect.  Great shot!', '2004-05-11 08:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(710784, 73626, 20204, '<td valign="top">It looks like some areas might be a touch out of focus, but I absolutely love the subject and the contrast between the flowering trees and the old rusty barn.  You had a great eye for picking this!</td>', 'It looks like some areas might be a touch out of focus, but I absolutely love the subject and the contrast between the flowering trees and the old rusty barn.  You had a great eye for picking this!', '2004-05-11 08:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(710786, 73391, 20204, '<td valign="top">The dried flower on the rust is a great emotive shot, as well as obviously meeting the challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'The dried flower on the rust is a great emotive shot, as well as obviously meeting the challenge.  Well done!', '2004-05-11 08:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(710788, 74241, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, and a creative cropping.  Well done!</td>', 'Interesting subject, and a creative cropping.  Well done!', '2004-05-11 08:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(710789, 73126, 20204, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling that the uncropped image totally changes the feel of this shot.  I love the feel of it - can''t put my finger on how to explain it technically, but I definitely enjoyed this image.</td>', 'I have a feeling that the uncropped image totally changes the feel of this shot.  I love the feel of it - can''t put my finger on how to explain it technically, but I definitely enjoyed this image.', '2004-05-11 08:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(710791, 74372, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition with the old rusty pipe/spring in the background and the white soft foreground.  It looks like part of the subject is eithe rmoving or out of focus.  If it had been sharp 100% I would have given this an 8.  This is definitely a creative shot - well done!</td>', 'This is a great composition with the old rusty pipe/spring in the background and the white soft foreground.  It looks like part of the subject is eithe rmoving or out of focus.  If it had been sharp 100% I would have given this an 8.  This is definitely a creative shot - well done!', '2004-05-11 08:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(710792, 74056, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the subject being centered in this shot, and I find it to have a lot of interest.  Creative!</td>', 'I like the subject being centered in this shot, and I find it to have a lot of interest.  Creative!', '2004-05-11 08:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(710793, 74453, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  Just when you though you''d seen every shade of red...  The texture is great as well - excellent image.</td>', 'Great colors!  Just when you though you''d seen every shade of red...  The texture is great as well - excellent image.', '2004-05-11 08:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(710794, 73545, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice uncluttered background, and good composition.</td>', 'Nice uncluttered background, and good composition.', '2004-05-11 08:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(710795, 74256, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative subject.  The lower cropping is a alittle distracting as the shell''s cut off feels unatural.  Great depth of field.</td>', 'Creative subject.  The lower cropping is a alittle distracting as the shell''s cut off feels unatural.  Great depth of field.', '2004-05-11 08:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(710796, 74156, 20204, '<td valign="top">Lighting and color are excellent.  The persepctive makes the shot - well done!</td>', 'Lighting and color are excellent.  The persepctive makes the shot - well done!', '2004-05-11 08:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(710797, 74289, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective of this shot!</td>', 'I love the perspective of this shot!', '2004-05-11 08:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(710798, 73807, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not too much rust in the image, but seems like something out of Time Magazine.  Despite not feeling like the challenge (just my interpretation) I think this is a very well composed shot.</td>', 'Not too much rust in the image, but seems like something out of Time Magazine.  Despite not feeling like the challenge (just my interpretation) I think this is a very well composed shot.', '2004-05-11 08:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(710799, 74074, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting persepctive.  The background on the right is a little distracting.</td>', 'Interesting persepctive.  The background on the right is a little distracting.', '2004-05-11 08:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(710800, 73649, 21432, '<td valign="top">Love your lighting and colors</td>', 'Love your lighting and colors', '2004-05-11 08:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(710802, 74511, 20204, '<td valign="top">The lines of the door and it''s screen frame, and the siding make for an interesting line study in themselves, Throw in the old thermometer and you''ve got a perfect subject on a great background.  Very well done!</td>', 'The lines of the door and it''s screen frame, and the siding make for an interesting line study in themselves, Throw in the old thermometer and you''ve got a perfect subject on a great background.  Very well done!', '2004-05-11 08:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(710803, 73544, 21432, '<td valign="top">Creative.</td>', 'Creative.', '2004-05-11 08:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(710804, 73523, 21432, '<td valign="top">I like your use of shadows, nicely done.</td>', 'I like your use of shadows, nicely done.', '2004-05-11 08:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(710805, 73742, 20204, '<td valign="top">Net symmetry / pattern in this, and the yellow is refreshing given how much red rust we''ve all looked at in these ratings!</td>', 'Net symmetry / pattern in this, and the yellow is refreshing given how much red rust we''ve all looked at in these ratings!', '2004-05-11 08:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(710806, 73781, 21432, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.</td>', 'Nice DOF.', '2004-05-11 08:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(710807, 74275, 21432, '<td valign="top">You should have cropped your image closer around your subject and eliminated the building which is distracting.</td>', 'You should have cropped your image closer around your subject and eliminated the building which is distracting.', '2004-05-11 08:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(710808, 74420, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  There is a lot fo interest in this shot, and the depth of field does an excellent job of directing your attention.  I can almost feel the rope pulling on that bent screw eye.  Really enjoyed this image!</td>', 'Great subject!  There is a lot fo interest in this shot, and the depth of field does an excellent job of directing your attention.  I can almost feel the rope pulling on that bent screw eye.  Really enjoyed this image!', '2004-05-11 08:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(710809, 74053, 1368, '<td valign="top">Lovely rust, I love the details and the textures, just wish the white thing in the right corner wasnt there, Great abstract rust shot :)</td>', 'Lovely rust, I love the details and the textures, just wish the white thing in the right corner wasnt there, Great abstract rust shot :)', '2004-05-11 08:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(710810, 74518, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures on the nails, and great lighting.</td>', 'Interesting textures on the nails, and great lighting.', '2004-05-11 08:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(710812, 73448, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective on this image, and the bright blue sky is a great contrast with the old rusting wagon.</td>', 'I like the perspective on this image, and the bright blue sky is a great contrast with the old rusting wagon.', '2004-05-11 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(710813, 74115, 21432, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2004-05-11 08:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(710814, 73918, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the patterns created by the steel, and the way the rusty floor seems almost solid in this angle.  Nice sharpeness and detail.</td>', 'I love the patterns created by the steel, and the way the rusty floor seems almost solid in this angle.  Nice sharpeness and detail.', '2004-05-11 08:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(710815, 73344, 21432, '<td valign="top">Where''s the rust?</td>', 'Where''s the rust?', '2004-05-11 08:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(710816, 73404, 1368, '<td valign="top">This in looks a bit flat, could have been more alive with better lighting and shadows in it, I guess the sun was not shining at all that day, anyway its sharp and good detiails but I feel the composition could be a little different as this one seems a little unstable if you know what I mean :o like all the weight is in the right side. Good luck ;)</td>', 'This in looks a bit flat, could have been more alive with better lighting and shadows in it, I guess the sun was not shining at all that day, anyway its sharp and good detiails but I feel the composition could be a little different as this one seems a little unstable if you know what I mean :o like all the weight is in the right side. Good luck ;)', '2004-05-11 08:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(710817, 74380, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great detail and colors.  I like the way this is composed - the rusty band is a great compliment to the image.</td>', 'Great detail and colors.  I like the way this is composed - the rusty band is a great compliment to the image.', '2004-05-11 08:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(710819, 73801, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  I think the shadow from the handle detracts somewhat from an otherwise great image.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  I think the shadow from the handle detracts somewhat from an otherwise great image.', '2004-05-11 08:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(710820, 74024, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think a slightly lower angle would have drawn more attention to the "atlantis" aspect.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I think a slightly lower angle would have drawn more attention to the "atlantis" aspect.  Nice shot.', '2004-05-11 08:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(710821, 73229, 1368, '<td valign="top">Just remeber one thing when you are taking pictures with flash, Be sure there is no window in front of you :-)  The fence there seems to be in way of the subject, I also think you could have cropped a bit of the right side as there seems to be some more space there than on the left and leaves the picture kind of unbalanced, anyway Good luck :)</td>', 'Just remeber one thing when you are taking pictures with flash, Be sure there is no window in front of you :-)  The fence there seems to be in way of the subject, I also think you could have cropped a bit of the right side as there seems to be some more space there than on the left and leaves the picture kind of unbalanced, anyway Good luck :)', '2004-05-11 08:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(710822, 74227, 20204, '<td valign="top">What a great find!  I love the slow shutter effect, and the old hull is a great point of interest.  The dull blue/grey also works great in the image, but I would have like to see a bit more sharpness in the hull details.</td>', 'What a great find!  I love the slow shutter effect, and the old hull is a great point of interest.  The dull blue/grey also works great in the image, but I would have like to see a bit more sharpness in the hull details.', '2004-05-11 08:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(710824, 73315, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject!  I''m wondering if a bit more saturation would have brought out the red in the rust more to help it contrast with the wood its in?  Hard to say, but a great image overall.</td>', 'Very interesting subject!  I''m wondering if a bit more saturation would have brought out the red in the rust more to help it contrast with the wood its in?  Hard to say, but a great image overall.', '2004-05-11 08:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(710825, 74354, 20204, '<td valign="top">Kind of a creepy thing to look at, but I like the shadows you''ve captured here, they work well with the spikes,.  The point of view is also interesting.</td>', 'Kind of a creepy thing to look at, but I like the shadows you''ve captured here, they work well with the spikes,.  The point of view is also interesting.', '2004-05-11 08:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(710828, 74207, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and detail.</td>', 'Interesting colors and detail.', '2004-05-11 08:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(710829, 74258, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is a great image!  The dark skys are perfect for slaying a dragon.  Seems like it could use a little sharpening, but very well composed.</td>', 'This is a great image!  The dark skys are perfect for slaying a dragon.  Seems like it could use a little sharpening, but very well composed.', '2004-05-11 08:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(710830, 74350, 20204, '<td valign="top">The lighting and cropping are excellent in this image,</td>', 'The lighting and cropping are excellent in this image,', '2004-05-11 08:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(710831, 74045, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great subject, and tones of detail in the image to keep you looking at it.  Well done!</td>', 'Great subject, and tones of detail in the image to keep you looking at it.  Well done!', '2004-05-11 08:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(710832, 74455, 20204, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the depth of field emphasize the foreground more than the background.  You rpoint of view and composition is creative.</td>', 'I would have liked to see the depth of field emphasize the foreground more than the background.  You rpoint of view and composition is creative.', '2004-05-11 09:00:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(710833, 73397, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the way the red is emphasized by the light background.</td>', 'I like the way the red is emphasized by the light background.', '2004-05-11 09:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(710834, 74374, 20204, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and depth of field.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and depth of field.', '2004-05-11 09:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(710835, 74378, 19653, '<td valign="top">I think this is a perfect photo!  Its interesting and very well taken.</td>', 'I think this is a perfect photo!  Its interesting and very well taken.', '2004-05-11 09:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(710837, 74491, 21432, '<td valign="top">I think you had a great idea but should have carried it a little further, too much in picture, would have decreased my DOF to keep interest focused on the track.  Composition is good and I like the angle.</td>', 'I think you had a great idea but should have carried it a little further, too much in picture, would have decreased my DOF to keep interest focused on the track.  Composition is good and I like the angle.', '2004-05-11 09:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(710838, 73676, 20204, '<td valign="top">The shiny rust is very interesting, and I like the depth of field emphasizing the detail of the gear''s teeth.</td>', 'The shiny rust is very interesting, and I like the depth of field emphasizing the detail of the gear''s teeth.', '2004-05-11 09:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(710839, 73750, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  The water and reflections make for additional interest.</td>', 'This is a great image.  The water and reflections make for additional interest.', '2004-05-11 09:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(710840, 74228, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice background...  Great detail as well.</td>', 'Nice background...  Great detail as well.', '2004-05-11 09:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(710862, 73493, 14224, '<td valign="top">would of been nice without the leaf.  subject has potental   maybe a different angle</td>', 'would of been nice without the leaf.  subject has potental   maybe a different angle', '2004-05-11 09:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
