(710998, 73259, 20204, '<td valign="top">This could just as well have made it into Serendipity.  Seems like the lighting may be slightly overexposed in the bee''s head and the top of the chain link, but that''s really nit-picky as overall it is an amazing image with great focus.</td>', 'This could just as well have made it into Serendipity.  Seems like the lighting may be slightly overexposed in the bee''s head and the top of the chain link, but that''s really nit-picky as overall it is an amazing image with great focus.', '2004-05-11 10:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
