(711005, 73843, 20204, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of interest in this shot, but I feel like the dramatic lines of the bridge are lost in the background.  With a more open aperture that slightly blurred the background I think the subject would be more highlighted.   If it were possible to get a lower and more to the right point of view,  the sweeping curves of the bridge side might be more emphasized as well.  I like the desing elements overall - you''ve got an eye for a good image!</td>', 'There''s a lot of interest in this shot, but I feel like the dramatic lines of the bridge are lost in the background.  With a more open aperture that slightly blurred the background I think the subject would be more highlighted.   If it were possible to get a lower and more to the right point of view,  the sweeping curves of the bridge side might be more emphasized as well.  I like the desing elements overall - you''ve got an eye for a good image!', '2004-05-11 10:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
