(711030, 73792, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is another "less is more" shot which I really like.  The plain background makes you want to pay more attention to the subtle details in the door.  The pipe on the right is a great balancing detail, and I''m glad you left it in the image.  Well done!</td>', 'This is another "less is more" shot which I really like.  The plain background makes you want to pay more attention to the subtle details in the door.  The pipe on the right is a great balancing detail, and I''m glad you left it in the image.  Well done!', '2004-05-11 10:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
