(711189, 73317, 17505, '<td valign="top">It has a neat abstract feel to it. I like that the tops are all jagged.</td>', 'It has a neat abstract feel to it. I like that the tops are all jagged.', '2004-05-11 11:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(711190, 74053, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting color in this rust, and a unique shape / texture.  The overexposure at the right is a significant distraction though.</td>', 'Interesting color in this rust, and a unique shape / texture.  The overexposure at the right is a significant distraction though.', '2004-05-11 11:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(711192, 74393, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  It''s hard to determine exactly what the subject in this is.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  It''s hard to determine exactly what the subject in this is.', '2004-05-11 11:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(711193, 74412, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	7	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	10	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	10	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	8.25	     Dick<br/>With less exposure, and a little lower angle this would be killer.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	7	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	10	How well does it meet the challenge:	10	Total Averaged Rating	8.25	     DickWith less exposure, and a little lower angle this would be killer.', '2004-05-11 11:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(711194, 74310, 19312, '<td valign="top">cool name......8</td>', 'cool name......8', '2004-05-11 11:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(711195, 74018, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot.  Good DOF and detail</td>', 'Nice macro shot.  Good DOF and detail', '2004-05-11 11:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(711196, 73301, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m having some trouble with the depth of field on this one.  I want the fencepost in the foreground to be in focus as its blurring distracts from the wood which is in focus.  I''d want the wood to be the focus, but not have it be so challenged by the large metal post.  Otherwise, point of view and composition are good.</td>', 'I''m having some trouble with the depth of field on this one.  I want the fencepost in the foreground to be in focus as its blurring distracts from the wood which is in focus.  I''d want the wood to be the focus, but not have it be so challenged by the large metal post.  Otherwise, point of view and composition are good.', '2004-05-11 11:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(711197, 73884, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	3	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	2	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	10	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	5.25	     Dick<br/>Not really that interesting to me.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	3	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	2	How well does it meet the challenge:	10	Total Averaged Rating	5.25	     DickNot really that interesting to me.', '2004-05-11 11:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(711199, 73648, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	3	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	2	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	10	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	5.25	     Dick<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	3	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	2	How well does it meet the challenge:	10	Total Averaged Rating	5.25	     Dick', '2004-05-11 11:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(711200, 74256, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think a more contrasty background would help set off the rusted doughnut better.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think a more contrasty background would help set off the rusted doughnut better.', '2004-05-11 11:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(711201, 74378, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	5	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	4	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	10	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	6.25	     Dick<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	5	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	6	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	4	How well does it meet the challenge:	10	Total Averaged Rating	6.25	     Dick', '2004-05-11 11:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(711202, 74291, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, lighting and contrast.</td>', 'Nice DOF, lighting and contrast.', '2004-05-11 11:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(711203, 73835, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	8	<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	7	<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	6	<br/>How well does it meet the challenge:	10	<br/>Total Averaged Rating	7.75	     Dick<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background	8	Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing	7	Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 	6	How well does it meet the challenge:	10	Total Averaged Rating	7.75	     Dick', '2004-05-11 11:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(711205, 73448, 17505, '<td valign="top">Great colors. What a beautiful day!I like your crop on the front wheel, it mirrors the shape of the bucket. Nice job.</td>', 'Great colors. What a beautiful day!I like your crop on the front wheel, it mirrors the shape of the bucket. Nice job.', '2004-05-11 11:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(711208, 74269, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, although the tree branches are distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot, although the tree branches are distracting.', '2004-05-11 11:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(711211, 74547, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice shot overall.  IMHO the upper right quadrent of the picture lacks interest/color.  Maybe try a tighter composition around the flowers and center of the rusted piece.</td>', 'Nice shot overall.  IMHO the upper right quadrent of the picture lacks interest/color.  Maybe try a tighter composition around the flowers and center of the rusted piece.', '2004-05-11 11:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(711212, 73192, 19312, '<td valign="top">like it....</td>', 'like it....', '2004-05-11 11:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(711213, 73824, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice play between the vertical and horizontal lines. It seems a bit off kilter though, like it''s leaning to the left. Perhaps that was your intent.</td>', 'Nice play between the vertical and horizontal lines. It seems a bit off kilter though, like it''s leaning to the left. Perhaps that was your intent.', '2004-05-11 11:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(711214, 73492, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very crisp shot.  I like the focus, framing and DOF.</td>', 'Very crisp shot.  I like the focus, framing and DOF.', '2004-05-11 11:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(711215, 73448, 18374, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I like the lighting and color in this photo.  Very crisp.</td>', 'Great shot!  I like the lighting and color in this photo.  Very crisp.', '2004-05-11 11:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(711216, 74464, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting shape, and nice colors, but I don''t like the cropping. I want to see more of the top and the left.</td>', 'Interesting shape, and nice colors, but I don''t like the cropping. I want to see more of the top and the left.', '2004-05-11 11:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(711217, 73889, 19312, '<td valign="top">cool....i give it a 9</td>', 'cool....i give it a 9', '2004-05-11 11:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(711218, 74506, 17505, '<td valign="top">your focus seems to be in the wrong place. Perhaps that what you wanted, but to me it looks like a mistake.</td>', 'your focus seems to be in the wrong place. Perhaps that what you wanted, but to me it looks like a mistake.', '2004-05-11 11:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(711220, 74302, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I think there is some room for improvement on the lighting.  The brighter reflections on the tops of the lanterns are a little distracting.  I would prefer a softer light, maybe a front light aimed down, to help the tops of the lanterns stand out from the background a little more.</td>', 'Nice picture.  I think there is some room for improvement on the lighting.  The brighter reflections on the tops of the lanterns are a little distracting.  I would prefer a softer light, maybe a front light aimed down, to help the tops of the lanterns stand out from the background a little more.', '2004-05-11 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(711222, 74502, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the simple detail in the curve, and the subtle plant growing in the corener.  This image''s simple but textured background has a great contrast with the design lements that reward the viewer for taking more time than a quick glance.  Well done.</td>', 'I love the simple detail in the curve, and the subtle plant growing in the corener.  This image''s simple but textured background has a great contrast with the design lements that reward the viewer for taking more time than a quick glance.  Well done.', '2004-05-11 12:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(711223, 74480, 17505, '<td valign="top">The flash created harsh shadows which I personally don''t like. It makes your photo look flat and unreal. Nice idea though, it could have looked very nice with a secondary light source instead of a flash. (If you have the ability, try to turn down the brightness on your flash. Not all cameras can do that.)</td>', 'The flash created harsh shadows which I personally don''t like. It makes your photo look flat and unreal. Nice idea though, it could have looked very nice with a secondary light source instead of a flash. (If you have the ability, try to turn down the brightness on your flash. Not all cameras can do that.)', '2004-05-11 12:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(711225, 74236, 20204, '<td valign="top">The tools on the ground, and the red post on the left of the image are distracting from the subject.  Onfortunately, the subject itself doesn''t have neough contrast throughout it for how much of the image it dominates.  Might have worked better to show more of its edges, or take the shot in a different lighting configuration (maybe with a lower sun).</td>', 'The tools on the ground, and the red post on the left of the image are distracting from the subject.  Onfortunately, the subject itself doesn''t have neough contrast throughout it for how much of the image it dominates.  Might have worked better to show more of its edges, or take the shot in a different lighting configuration (maybe with a lower sun).', '2004-05-11 12:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
