(711256, 73259, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and detail.  Unfotunately it looks like the bright parts of the head are a little overexposed, but the rusted chain looks about right.  It looks like you used a flash.  Maybe setting up a different lighting source or bouncing the flash (or diffusing the flash) would help eliminate the blooming on the highlights but still give you good detail and shadows.</td>', 'Nice DOF and detail.  Unfotunately it looks like the bright parts of the head are a little overexposed, but the rusted chain looks about right.  It looks like you used a flash.  Maybe setting up a different lighting source or bouncing the flash (or diffusing the flash) would help eliminate the blooming on the highlights but still give you good detail and shadows.', '2004-05-11 12:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
