(711348, 74348, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great cropping.  The border works very well here.</td>', 'Great cropping.  The border works very well here.', '2004-05-11 12:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(711349, 74072, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of view.</td>', 'Interesting point of view.', '2004-05-11 12:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(711350, 74340, 20204, '<td valign="top">Too out of focus for me to know what''s going on here, and the overly bright background seem too much of a contrast.</td>', 'Too out of focus for me to know what''s going on here, and the overly bright background seem too much of a contrast.', '2004-05-11 12:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(711352, 74063, 20204, '<td valign="top">The pump here (I think that''s what it is!) is fighting for attention, but being beaten down by all the other stuff in the image.  The light in the upper left is very distracting.</td>', 'The pump here (I think that''s what it is!) is fighting for attention, but being beaten down by all the other stuff in the image.  The light in the upper left is very distracting.', '2004-05-11 12:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(711353, 73715, 20204, '<td valign="top">The darkness at the base of the chairs feels underexposed.</td>', 'The darkness at the base of the chairs feels underexposed.', '2004-05-11 12:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(711357, 73457, 20204, '<td valign="top">This image feels washed out.  Close up with a few of the weeds blending in, this would be a very nice picture.<br/></td>', 'This image feels washed out.  Close up with a few of the weeds blending in, this would be a very nice picture.', '2004-05-11 12:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(711358, 74474, 20204, '<td valign="top">The shadow in the lower left is distracting, and the contrast seems a bit harsh between the bright piece of rust and the fairly dark ground.  The blueish object in the top of the frame also distracts from the subject and would have been nice to crop out.</td>', 'The shadow in the lower left is distracting, and the contrast seems a bit harsh between the bright piece of rust and the fairly dark ground.  The blueish object in the top of the frame also distracts from the subject and would have been nice to crop out.', '2004-05-11 12:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(711360, 73984, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines and composition, but feels washed out somewhat.  Maybe more saturation or different lighting would help.</td>', 'Interesting lines and composition, but feels washed out somewhat.  Maybe more saturation or different lighting would help.', '2004-05-11 12:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(711361, 74398, 20204, '<td valign="top">Background is a little distracting from the foreground, and the bottles/cans feel too posed.  A more natural scattering of them would blend better to me.</td>', 'Background is a little distracting from the foreground, and the bottles/cans feel too posed.  A more natural scattering of them would blend better to me.', '2004-05-11 12:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(711362, 73922, 20204, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting, and the top of the bar is overexposed.  Looks like this may have been taken when was a bit too high.</td>', 'The background is distracting, and the top of the bar is overexposed.  Looks like this may have been taken when was a bit too high.', '2004-05-11 12:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(711364, 74512, 20204, '<td valign="top">There''s definitely some creativity working here, but I think it''s stretching the rust concept.  To critique the actual photo, I see the lower right penny is blurred, and the lighting doesn''t seem to be exposing the upper left one well enough.  The picture is also lacking in sharpness.</td>', 'There''s definitely some creativity working here, but I think it''s stretching the rust concept.  To critique the actual photo, I see the lower right penny is blurred, and the lighting doesn''t seem to be exposing the upper left one well enough.  The picture is also lacking in sharpness.', '2004-05-11 12:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(711366, 74294, 20204, '<td valign="top">This image is lacking in sharpness and feels overexposed.</td>', 'This image is lacking in sharpness and feels overexposed.', '2004-05-11 12:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(711367, 74490, 20204, '<td valign="top">I wish the background was a bit more in focus to emphasize that you were squirting somethign rusty.</td>', 'I wish the background was a bit more in focus to emphasize that you were squirting somethign rusty.', '2004-05-11 12:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(711369, 74407, 1368, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful rust, I like the colors and the details, good job :-)</td>', 'Very beautiful rust, I like the colors and the details, good job :-)', '2004-05-11 12:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(711370, 73945, 20204, '<td valign="top">Needs a point of interest, and woudl benefit from a more consistent background with less contrast.</td>', 'Needs a point of interest, and woudl benefit from a more consistent background with less contrast.', '2004-05-11 12:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(711371, 73689, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting focus, and good use of upward angle to avoid background distractions.  Unfortunately I''m not finding enough contrast in design elements to get excited about this.</td>', 'Interesting focus, and good use of upward angle to avoid background distractions.  Unfortunately I''m not finding enough contrast in design elements to get excited about this.', '2004-05-11 12:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(711372, 74403, 20204, '<td valign="top">Is this proportion, or rusted?  Image looks like in either reduction or expansion it gained some jaggies.</td>', 'Is this proportion, or rusted?  Image looks like in either reduction or expansion it gained some jaggies.', '2004-05-11 12:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(711374, 74472, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the background, but nothing seems to act as a point of interest.  It''s just a big pile of rust.</td>', 'Nice colors in the background, but nothing seems to act as a point of interest.  It''s just a big pile of rust.', '2004-05-11 12:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(711377, 74064, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and contrast with an interesting background.   But not enough interest overall.  Perhaps from closer up the curves of the leaf would develop something more interesting than it does as a whole.</td>', 'Great sharpness and contrast with an interesting background.   But not enough interest overall.  Perhaps from closer up the curves of the leaf would develop something more interesting than it does as a whole.', '2004-05-11 12:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(711382, 74160, 20204, '<td valign="top">This feels very busy, and looks like it might be overexposed near the bends in the pipe on the right.</td>', 'This feels very busy, and looks like it might be overexposed near the bends in the pipe on the right.', '2004-05-11 12:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(711384, 74478, 20204, '<td valign="top">Feels like its lacking sharpness, and there is too much competition between foreground and background.  If someone could have helpd back those two branches on the right while you shot it would have worked better for me.</td>', 'Feels like its lacking sharpness, and there is too much competition between foreground and background.  If someone could have helpd back those two branches on the right while you shot it would have worked better for me.', '2004-05-11 12:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(711386, 74285, 20204, '<td valign="top">Getting this off-center would have helped.  Also, I''d suggest a tighter crop.</td>', 'Getting this off-center would have helped.  Also, I''d suggest a tighter crop.', '2004-05-11 12:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(711387, 74307, 20204, '<td valign="top">Screw is out of focus.</td>', 'Screw is out of focus.', '2004-05-11 12:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(711389, 74524, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nothing seems to be fitting in with rust to me...  The leaves at the bottom don''t seem to work well either.</td>', 'Nothing seems to be fitting in with rust to me...  The leaves at the bottom don''t seem to work well either.', '2004-05-11 12:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(711392, 73868, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow play.</td>', 'Nice shadow play.', '2004-05-11 12:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(711395, 74224, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble figuring out what the subject should be in this image (ignoring the title).  The motorcycle seems to be what''s catching mym eye, yet I think you intended the "knight".</td>', 'I''m having trouble figuring out what the subject should be in this image (ignoring the title).  The motorcycle seems to be what''s catching mym eye, yet I think you intended the "knight".', '2004-05-11 13:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(711396, 74297, 20204, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed on the chrome, and feels like it may have sharpening artifacts.</td>', 'A bit overexposed on the chrome, and feels like it may have sharpening artifacts.', '2004-05-11 13:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(711397, 74405, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast with the shy, but wish it had a more dramatic point of interest.</td>', 'I like the contrast with the shy, but wish it had a more dramatic point of interest.', '2004-05-11 13:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(711398, 74421, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, but lacking in a strong point of interest for me.</td>', 'Nice depth of field, but lacking in a strong point of interest for me.', '2004-05-11 13:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(711400, 74032, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the sideways  orientation, and the lighting.  There''s not enough strength in the subject to make this really stand out for me though.  Perhaps a more close-up so it''s not washed out by the similar-toned sand background.</td>', 'I like the sideways  orientation, and the lighting.  There''s not enough strength in the subject to make this really stand out for me though.  Perhaps a more close-up so it''s not washed out by the similar-toned sand background.', '2004-05-11 13:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(711431, 74198, 19034, '<td valign="top">this picture is too set up. try to take things in their natural states</td>', 'this picture is too set up. try to take things in their natural states', '2004-05-11 13:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(711432, 74238, 19034, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful picture. captures the challenge.</td>', 'this is a beautiful picture. captures the challenge.', '2004-05-11 13:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(711434, 74261, 19034, '<td valign="top">very nice. i love the depth of field</td>', 'very nice. i love the depth of field', '2004-05-11 13:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(711436, 73595, 19034, '<td valign="top">colors are great. is this natural color? or was this photoshoped</td>', 'colors are great. is this natural color? or was this photoshoped', '2004-05-11 13:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(711437, 74227, 19034, '<td valign="top">is this rusted? beautiful picture...</td>', 'is this rusted? beautiful picture...', '2004-05-11 13:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(711440, 74051, 19034, '<td valign="top">this is a fantastic picture.</td>', 'this is a fantastic picture.', '2004-05-11 13:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(711441, 74045, 19034, '<td valign="top">great colors</td>', 'great colors', '2004-05-11 13:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(711443, 73745, 19034, '<td valign="top">too set up.<br/>try taking shots in their natural state</td>', 'too set up.try taking shots in their natural state', '2004-05-11 13:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(711444, 73766, 20204, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more contrast between the subject and the background in this shot.  Depth of field looks nice.</td>', 'I would like to see more contrast between the subject and the background in this shot.  Depth of field looks nice.', '2004-05-11 13:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(711445, 73106, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m loving the sky in this.  Very nice day for taking photos.  I really don''t know what your B-700 is, so I guess this is like an abstract for me, but I''m thinking it''s either an airplane or a car?  Definately rusted, and your focus and clarity are really good to show the details of the rust.  I like how the B-700 looks practically new among the rust.  Good angle and framing/cropping.  Love the object on that blue sky. ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m loving the sky in this.  Very nice day for taking photos.  I really don''t know what your B-700 is, so I guess this is like an abstract for me, but I''m thinking it''s either an airplane or a car?  Definately rusted, and your focus and clarity are really good to show the details of the rust.  I like how the B-700 looks practically new among the rust.  Good angle and framing/cropping.  Love the object on that blue sky. ~Heather~', '2004-05-11 13:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(711447, 74071, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great combination of angles and textures.  The lighting is nice in this as well.</td>', 'Great combination of angles and textures.  The lighting is nice in this as well.', '2004-05-11 13:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(711449, 74269, 19034, '<td valign="top">the tree in the background is a little distracting... i love the picture</td>', 'the tree in the background is a little distracting... i love the picture', '2004-05-11 13:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(711450, 74419, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''d like this to be a bit sharper, but I love the point of view.</td>', 'I''d like this to be a bit sharper, but I love the point of view.', '2004-05-11 13:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(711451, 74238, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful colored rust.  lol  I think that your focus and clarity help to bring out texture in the links, and your lighting helps bring out color and texture.  So you did a great job with both.  I like how the subject fills the frame and I like the layout.  Keeps my eyes moving around and lots to look at.  overall a very nice shot of rust. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is a beautiful colored rust.  lol  I think that your focus and clarity help to bring out texture in the links, and your lighting helps bring out color and texture.  So you did a great job with both.  I like how the subject fills the frame and I like the layout.  Keeps my eyes moving around and lots to look at.  overall a very nice shot of rust. ~Heather~', '2004-05-11 13:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(711452, 74392, 20204, '<td valign="top">Good saturation, nice point of view.</td>', 'Good saturation, nice point of view.', '2004-05-11 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(711453, 73577, 19034, '<td valign="top">are you sure this is rust? looks like paint to me</td>', 'are you sure this is rust? looks like paint to me', '2004-05-11 13:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(711454, 73742, 19034, '<td valign="top">AWESOME</td>', 'AWESOME', '2004-05-11 13:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(711455, 74117, 19034, '<td valign="top">great picture</td>', 'great picture', '2004-05-11 13:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(711456, 73297, 20204, '<td valign="top">This image is a bit too bright - it washes out the color.  It would also be nice to see the square base of the subject align better with the border of the image, but that may not have been possible, so hard to know without seeing the original.  Good point of view.</td>', 'This image is a bit too bright - it washes out the color.  It would also be nice to see the square base of the subject align better with the border of the image, but that may not have been possible, so hard to know without seeing the original.  Good point of view.', '2004-05-11 13:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(711457, 73935, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract quality.  The highlights on the grilling show up a little too bright for my tastes though focusing on the background is a unique choice.  Color is attractive.</td>', 'Interesting abstract quality.  The highlights on the grilling show up a little too bright for my tastes though focusing on the background is a unique choice.  Color is attractive.', '2004-05-11 13:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(711459, 74094, 20204, '<td valign="top">I completely agree with the title.  Nice image.</td>', 'I completely agree with the title.  Nice image.', '2004-05-11 13:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(711462, 74287, 20204, '<td valign="top">The ball seems out of focus, but I like the blue sky background, and love the point of view.</td>', 'The ball seems out of focus, but I like the blue sky background, and love the point of view.', '2004-05-11 13:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(711463, 73095, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and lighting in this.  There seems to be a subtle shadow which emhpasizes the pattern.  Very well done.</td>', 'I like the composition and lighting in this.  There seems to be a subtle shadow which emhpasizes the pattern.  Very well done.', '2004-05-11 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(711465, 74442, 16488, '<td valign="top">What an unusual find.  This picture raises more quesitons than it answers--good conversation piece.  Exposure, cropping are nice, but I wish they sky was not so flat, it causes loss of definition in the tree tops.</td>', 'What an unusual find.  This picture raises more quesitons than it answers--good conversation piece.  Exposure, cropping are nice, but I wish they sky was not so flat, it causes loss of definition in the tree tops.', '2004-05-11 13:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(711466, 73646, 19034, '<td valign="top">too set up.</td>', 'too set up.', '2004-05-11 13:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(711467, 74473, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The foreground is out of focus, so I think depth of field is off.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The foreground is out of focus, so I think depth of field is off.', '2004-05-11 13:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(711468, 74413, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems like the chain is slightly out of focus.  Could also use a bit more lighting as the shadows are too strong for my liking.  I love the contrast between the chain and background.</td>', 'Seems like the chain is slightly out of focus.  Could also use a bit more lighting as the shadows are too strong for my liking.  I love the contrast between the chain and background.', '2004-05-11 13:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(711471, 73527, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I love the pattern created by this fencing / decking material.</td>', 'Great composition.  I love the pattern created by this fencing / decking material.', '2004-05-11 13:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(711473, 74531, 16488, '<td valign="top">Like the angle of the light but not how hazy it makes the entire upper left and corner.  Background could be less distracting, though I like the texture and color of the gravel.  Is that bluish streak a lens artifact on the water tank portion of the toy?  It detracts.</td>', 'Like the angle of the light but not how hazy it makes the entire upper left and corner.  Background could be less distracting, though I like the texture and color of the gravel.  Is that bluish streak a lens artifact on the water tank portion of the toy?  It detracts.', '2004-05-11 13:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(711474, 74408, 19034, '<td valign="top">is this rust?</td>', 'is this rust?', '2004-05-11 13:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(711475, 74346, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the way this is almost a silhoutette with texture.  Great depth of field and excellent lighting.</td>', 'I love the way this is almost a silhoutette with texture.  Great depth of field and excellent lighting.', '2004-05-11 13:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(711477, 74461, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more of the chain in focus, but I like the composition.</td>', 'I''d like to see more of the chain in focus, but I like the composition.', '2004-05-11 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(711478, 74393, 16488, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the subject of your title is as evident to me as it is to you.  Pic seems overexposed.</td>', 'I don''t think the subject of your title is as evident to me as it is to you.  Pic seems overexposed.', '2004-05-11 13:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(711480, 74069, 20204, '<td valign="top">The wires in the images'' right side are distracting.  Interesting point of view.</td>', 'The wires in the images'' right side are distracting.  Interesting point of view.', '2004-05-11 13:52:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(711481, 74489, 20204, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail, excellent point of view, perfect lighting.  This is a great image I really enjoyed.</td>', 'Incredible detail, excellent point of view, perfect lighting.  This is a great image I really enjoyed.', '2004-05-11 13:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(711482, 74255, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think the background may be a bit too dar out of field, but I like the portal view and the rusty quality of the foreground.</td>', 'I think the background may be a bit too dar out of field, but I like the portal view and the rusty quality of the foreground.', '2004-05-11 13:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(711484, 74410, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative title.  I like the idea here, but it''s not contrasting enough from the background.  I''m not sure how to suggest improvement, only that it would be nice to have the vine stand out more.  Also seems slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Creative title.  I like the idea here, but it''s not contrasting enough from the background.  I''m not sure how to suggest improvement, only that it would be nice to have the vine stand out more.  Also seems slightly out of focus.', '2004-05-11 13:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(711486, 74136, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this.  The backgground and depth of field is perfect, and the foreground subject is nicely in focus and sharp throughout.  Very well done!</td>', 'I love the composition of this.  The backgground and depth of field is perfect, and the foreground subject is nicely in focus and sharp throughout.  Very well done!', '2004-05-11 13:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(711488, 74477, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting combination of lines and textures.</td>', 'Interesting combination of lines and textures.', '2004-05-11 13:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(711493, 74355, 20204, '<td valign="top">This feels like its tilted counter clockwise which I find a bit distracting to me, but overall I love the composition, and numerous points of interest in the image.  Nice composition.</td>', 'This feels like its tilted counter clockwise which I find a bit distracting to me, but overall I love the composition, and numerous points of interest in the image.  Nice composition.', '2004-05-11 13:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(711495, 74418, 20204, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, and the background works well.  The background is underexposed, and the foreground seems to have a spot of light rather than a nice filling light.  The focus is also a bit off.</td>', 'The colors are nice, and the background works well.  The background is underexposed, and the foreground seems to have a spot of light rather than a nice filling light.  The focus is also a bit off.', '2004-05-11 13:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(711498, 74426, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  I like the way the traffic light balances the bridge.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  I like the way the traffic light balances the bridge.', '2004-05-11 13:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(711499, 73976, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and interesting contrast of textures.  I''d like to see this a little more bright.</td>', 'Great perspective and interesting contrast of textures.  I''d like to see this a little more bright.', '2004-05-11 14:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(711500, 73963, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, and great composition - everything seems to go well together.</td>', 'Interesting subject, and great composition - everything seems to go well together.', '2004-05-11 14:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(711501, 74019, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the window against the consistent brick background.   Makes for an interesting subject.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the window against the consistent brick background.   Makes for an interesting subject.', '2004-05-11 14:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(711504, 74507, 20204, '<td valign="top">Focus in the foreground seems off, and I''d like to see the background trees slightly more in focus, but not completely.  Overall I love the composition.</td>', 'Focus in the foreground seems off, and I''d like to see the background trees slightly more in focus, but not completely.  Overall I love the composition.', '2004-05-11 14:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(711506, 74545, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative cropping works well in this image.  the pump seems to be too bright to work well with the car''s brightness.</td>', 'Creative cropping works well in this image.  the pump seems to be too bright to work well with the car''s brightness.', '2004-05-11 14:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
