(711918, 74209, 19831, '<td valign="top">bllurry. big patch of glare on the bottom. the blue towel under the rocks really takes a lot away. the white stuff on the right of the board is also distracting.</td>', 'bllurry. big patch of glare on the bottom. the blue towel under the rocks really takes a lot away. the white stuff on the right of the board is also distracting.', '2004-05-11 16:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
