(711930, 73106, 20992, '<td valign="top">oh my! voting and voting and voting rusted pictures and then suddenly get wakened up by this picture! It''s so clean and clear that even the rust  looks classy. I love the colours and the air (polar or burning?), that B700 finishes it off, because without it, it wouldn''t have a fixed focusing point. The only minor thing is the small DOF, it looks like the far left site isn''t sharp, it would be great if that was also razorsharp like the rest..</td>', 'oh my! voting and voting and voting rusted pictures and then suddenly get wakened up by this picture! It''s so clean and clear that even the rust  looks classy. I love the colours and the air (polar or burning?), that B700 finishes it off, because without it, it wouldn''t have a fixed focusing point. The only minor thing is the small DOF, it looks like the far left site isn''t sharp, it would be great if that was also razorsharp like the rest..', '2004-05-11 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(711937, 74272, 19831, '<td valign="top">this is a good shot, but there was potential to be really great. it needs to be centered, by better cropping, there is either too much on left or not enough on right. I think also the top should be cropped down to the bottom of the train in the distance.</td>', 'this is a good shot, but there was potential to be really great. it needs to be centered, by better cropping, there is either too much on left or not enough on right. I think also the top should be cropped down to the bottom of the train in the distance.', '2004-05-11 17:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(711942, 74044, 20992, '<td valign="top">it''s not that this picture is amazingly original, but somehow it immediately caught my eye. Maybe it''s the colour monochromity that struck me or the sharpness (on the edge though!). I think this is a schoolbook example of well spotted how nature composed a perfectly nice picture, with a little help from mankind!</td>', 'it''s not that this picture is amazingly original, but somehow it immediately caught my eye. Maybe it''s the colour monochromity that struck me or the sharpness (on the edge though!). I think this is a schoolbook example of well spotted how nature composed a perfectly nice picture, with a little help from mankind!', '2004-05-11 17:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(711986, 74495, 18505, '<td valign="top">Looks like a difficult lighting situation.  Very interesting shapes and textures.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a difficult lighting situation.  Very interesting shapes and textures.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-05-11 17:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(711987, 74532, 21430, '<td valign="top">The little snippet of a building in the distance on the right is slightly distracting. I have found my eyes drawn to it as a point of interest a few times. It''s probably because of the additional ''open'' area in that portion of the image. <br/> <br/></td>', 'The little snippet of a building in the distance on the right is slightly distracting. I have found my eyes drawn to it as a point of interest a few times. It''s probably because of the additional ''open'' area in that portion of the image.  ', '2004-05-11 17:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(711995, 73523, 21430, '<td valign="top">I like the way the shadows are cast over this rusting hulk. It convinces me that this must be resting just inside a wooded area, perhaps forgotten by some long ago contractor that was to busy with other things to remember where he left his ''toy''.<br/> <br/>  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the way the shadows are cast over this rusting hulk. It convinces me that this must be resting just inside a wooded area, perhaps forgotten by some long ago contractor that was to busy with other things to remember where he left his ''toy''.   Nice shot.', '2004-05-11 17:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(711997, 73297, 19780, '<td valign="top">The textures and different types of rust here are quite interesting. The exposure on the foreground roller is a bit hot for my tastes, but I like your framing very much.</td>', 'The textures and different types of rust here are quite interesting. The exposure on the foreground roller is a bit hot for my tastes, but I like your framing very much.', '2004-05-11 17:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(711999, 74453, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and abstract use of DOF. The textures and exposure create a pleasing organic quality to this composition.</td>', 'Wonderful color and abstract use of DOF. The textures and exposure create a pleasing organic quality to this composition.', '2004-05-11 17:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(712000, 73200, 17505, '<td valign="top">This photo is too busy. Some elements are in silhouette, others are lighted. There are a lot of individual objects which attempt to capture our attention. The lines of the objects lead the eye in many different directions. It''s interesting, but too chaotic to be successful. Good luck on future challenges, you seem to have good technique, but need to work on your composition.</td>', 'This photo is too busy. Some elements are in silhouette, others are lighted. There are a lot of individual objects which attempt to capture our attention. The lines of the objects lead the eye in many different directions. It''s interesting, but too chaotic to be successful. Good luck on future challenges, you seem to have good technique, but need to work on your composition.', '2004-05-11 17:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(712002, 74156, 17505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Nice soft feel, like ripples of water.</td>', 'Beautiful. Nice soft feel, like ripples of water.', '2004-05-11 17:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
