(712005, 73355, 19780, '<td valign="top">an interesting composition - I enjoy the long wide format. The colors could be more saturated and perhaps less sharp so that we could enjoy the colors to highlight the rusted nature of the object. I like your subject very much.</td>', 'an interesting composition - I enjoy the long wide format. The colors could be more saturated and perhaps less sharp so that we could enjoy the colors to highlight the rusted nature of the object. I like your subject very much.', '2004-05-11 17:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
