(712627, 73750, 7570, '<td valign="top">what are there actually? but nice to look at. 7</td>', 'what are there actually? but nice to look at. 7', '2004-05-12 00:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(712631, 74099, 7570, '<td valign="top">restore this baby, it rocks!<br/></td>', 'restore this baby, it rocks!', '2004-05-12 00:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(712632, 73528, 8891, '<td valign="top">ahhhhhhh....very nice and I don''t even mind the frame...just endough shadows and darke so that the rust does take over the shot...quite fine.  10</td>', 'ahhhhhhh....very nice and I don''t even mind the frame...just endough shadows and darke so that the rust does take over the shot...quite fine.  10', '2004-05-12 00:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(712633, 73984, 3080, '<td valign="top">while it is rusted, it is not particularily interesting.  I think that the lighting is ok, and the angle at which you chose to shoot your subject is ok, but it''s just not drawing me in and holding me there.  I think it''s pretty plain.  While technically well done, just not exciting. ~Heather~</td>', 'while it is rusted, it is not particularily interesting.  I think that the lighting is ok, and the angle at which you chose to shoot your subject is ok, but it''s just not drawing me in and holding me there.  I think it''s pretty plain.  While technically well done, just not exciting. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(712634, 73170, 7570, '<td valign="top">cant see rust. your brain rust? lol. nice angle</td>', 'cant see rust. your brain rust? lol. nice angle', '2004-05-12 00:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(712637, 74204, 8891, '<td valign="top">this is quite fine except for the crop that leaves the image to crowded for my tastes....the detail, colors, and exposure are all very good.</td>', 'this is quite fine except for the crop that leaves the image to crowded for my tastes....the detail, colors, and exposure are all very good.', '2004-05-12 00:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(712638, 74354, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love the shadows.  I think that is what makes this photo for me.  I also like the rusted color on the blue background.  The angle at which you chose to shoot your subject is dramatic and adds much interest to the shot.  Focus and clarity are really good, and I think that the lighting is not only perfect, but is what really makes the photo.  Very nice rusted subject.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I love the shadows.  I think that is what makes this photo for me.  I also like the rusted color on the blue background.  The angle at which you chose to shoot your subject is dramatic and adds much interest to the shot.  Focus and clarity are really good, and I think that the lighting is not only perfect, but is what really makes the photo.  Very nice rusted subject.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(712643, 73807, 8891, '<td valign="top">very nice image, nicely shot and rendered in a very nice moody sepia like tone, but I really fail to see (and I hate having to say this) this image''s relationship to the challenge.</td>', 'very nice image, nicely shot and rendered in a very nice moody sepia like tone, but I really fail to see (and I hate having to say this) this image''s relationship to the challenge.', '2004-05-12 00:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(712644, 73483, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your focus seems quite soft here.  I think that I would prefer this to have a sharper focus throughout the photo.  Especially since it''s a ''sharp'' subject.  The rust does look good on the green grass.  I wonder what would happen if you upped the saturation a slight bit?  Definately a rusted subject and fits the challenge nicely.  The bright white sky is a bit of a distraction, too bad you couldn''t have caught some blue there. ~Heather~</td>', 'Your focus seems quite soft here.  I think that I would prefer this to have a sharper focus throughout the photo.  Especially since it''s a ''sharp'' subject.  The rust does look good on the green grass.  I wonder what would happen if you upped the saturation a slight bit?  Definately a rusted subject and fits the challenge nicely.  The bright white sky is a bit of a distraction, too bad you couldn''t have caught some blue there. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(712646, 74376, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I think your DOF is wonderful.  The in focus subject with the out of focus background works great.  Nothing distracting in the background.  Focus on your subject is great.  I like the angle at which you took the photo and also the crop you chose.  Definately a rusted subject, fits the challenge perfectly.  Very nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'Very nice.  I think your DOF is wonderful.  The in focus subject with the out of focus background works great.  Nothing distracting in the background.  Focus on your subject is great.  I like the angle at which you took the photo and also the crop you chose.  Definately a rusted subject, fits the challenge perfectly.  Very nice shot. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(712651, 74100, 3080, '<td valign="top">The ruse doesn''t really stand out to me here.  Unless it''s the side panels of the tracks that are rusted.  I like the angle, and the subject is definately interesting to look at.  It looks like it never ends.  The bright white out sky is a bit of a distraction.  Overall though, nice shot of the bridge. ~Heather~</td>', 'The ruse doesn''t really stand out to me here.  Unless it''s the side panels of the tracks that are rusted.  I like the angle, and the subject is definately interesting to look at.  It looks like it never ends.  The bright white out sky is a bit of a distraction.  Overall though, nice shot of the bridge. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(712654, 74453, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think I would have like this a bit better without the focus being off at the bottom...a judicious crop might have been in order.  The rest of the image is very interesting...great colors and textures.</td>', 'I think I would have like this a bit better without the focus being off at the bottom...a judicious crop might have been in order.  The rest of the image is very interesting...great colors and textures.', '2004-05-12 00:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(712655, 74203, 12252, '<td valign="top">I love this image and hope it places in the top three, where it belongs.</td>', 'I love this image and hope it places in the top three, where it belongs.', '2004-05-12 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(712657, 73955, 12252, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot; I''m predicting a ribbon.</td>', 'Excellent shot; I''m predicting a ribbon.', '2004-05-12 00:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(712659, 74054, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the angle here.  Nice and dramatic.  I also like the rusted color on the blue background.  Nice diagonals and lines.  I guess my only complaint would be the white area near the bottom, doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the photo.  Otherwise, focus and clarity are really good.  LIghting looks like it was cooperating with you on this day, and subject is interesting enough.  Nice shot.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I like the angle here.  Nice and dramatic.  I also like the rusted color on the blue background.  Nice diagonals and lines.  I guess my only complaint would be the white area near the bottom, doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the photo.  Otherwise, focus and clarity are really good.  LIghting looks like it was cooperating with you on this day, and subject is interesting enough.  Nice shot.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(712663, 74496, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the title, and the lighting. Well done!</td>', 'I like the composition, the title, and the lighting. Well done!', '2004-05-12 00:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(712664, 74478, 12252, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge. Good composition, like the contrast of the leaves and the rusty sign. 7</td>', 'Great take on the challenge. Good composition, like the contrast of the leaves and the rusty sign. 7', '2004-05-12 00:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(712665, 74454, 3080, '<td valign="top">ew.  scary thought. lol.  I think that the rusted subject is good for the challenge.  I like the angle at which you chose to shoot your subject.  Nice to see it not head on.  focus and clarity are really good.  the light glares actually add to the photo for me, I think it balances out nicely with the 2 bright spots.  I do wish that the dark shadow near the right side were lighter, but not bad as is.  Overall nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'ew.  scary thought. lol.  I think that the rusted subject is good for the challenge.  I like the angle at which you chose to shoot your subject.  Nice to see it not head on.  focus and clarity are really good.  the light glares actually add to the photo for me, I think it balances out nicely with the 2 bright spots.  I do wish that the dark shadow near the right side were lighter, but not bad as is.  Overall nice shot. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(712667, 74124, 9232, '<td valign="top">Color looks off on this.  Has it been white balanced?  Did you adjust levels or hue/saturation?</td>', 'Color looks off on this.  Has it been white balanced?  Did you adjust levels or hue/saturation?', '2004-05-12 00:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(712668, 74144, 12252, '<td valign="top">Hey, I had one of those! About that color, too! Nicely done. 7</td>', 'Hey, I had one of those! About that color, too! Nicely done. 7', '2004-05-12 00:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(712669, 73391, 8891, '<td valign="top">Now when you see this comment and who it is from you may be surprised to see that I am writing that the flower adds absolutely nothing to this shot....the rust and the composition of it are really great and you just did not need to add the flower.  A frest floser of a less clashing color might have worked better, but not as well as the rust by itself IMHO.</td>', 'Now when you see this comment and who it is from you may be surprised to see that I am writing that the flower adds absolutely nothing to this shot....the rust and the composition of it are really great and you just did not need to add the flower.  A frest floser of a less clashing color might have worked better, but not as well as the rust by itself IMHO.', '2004-05-12 00:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(712670, 74156, 12252, '<td valign="top">Would have worked well as an Abstract, too. 7 (not crazy about that border, though, but that doesn''t alter my vote)</td>', 'Would have worked well as an Abstract, too. 7 (not crazy about that border, though, but that doesn''t alter my vote)', '2004-05-12 00:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(712671, 74117, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Good monotone, good title, good composition, and it''s about trains, so it has to be good. 7</td>', 'I like this one. Good monotone, good title, good composition, and it''s about trains, so it has to be good. 7', '2004-05-12 00:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(712673, 73910, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like it, but don''t care much for the title. The image is good; nice DOF.</td>', 'I like it, but don''t care much for the title. The image is good; nice DOF.', '2004-05-12 00:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(712676, 74272, 3080, '<td valign="top">Too bad the background isn''t a bit more interesting.  I think this has a lot of potential as a photograph.  If only the background were able to be worked with.  Firstly, I think that a colored sky would have helped emencely.  secondly, maybe if there were leaves on the trees in the back.  next, I would pull the weeds that are sticking up into the sky.  they are creating vertical lines that don''t contrast well with the lines of your tracks.  focus and clarity look to be alright.  maybe even some DOF could blurr out the background, so it''s not so noticable?  ~Heather~</td>', 'Too bad the background isn''t a bit more interesting.  I think this has a lot of potential as a photograph.  If only the background were able to be worked with.  Firstly, I think that a colored sky would have helped emencely.  secondly, maybe if there were leaves on the trees in the back.  next, I would pull the weeds that are sticking up into the sky.  they are creating vertical lines that don''t contrast well with the lines of your tracks.  focus and clarity look to be alright.  maybe even some DOF could blurr out the background, so it''s not so noticable?  ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(712678, 74099, 12252, '<td valign="top">I knew a guy who collected these. He had more than a dozen when I knew him. Anyway...good photo, good compo, focus, light, everything is pretty darn good. How come all thse old rust buckets are out in the woods?</td>', 'I knew a guy who collected these. He had more than a dozen when I knew him. Anyway...good photo, good compo, focus, light, everything is pretty darn good. How come all thse old rust buckets are out in the woods?', '2004-05-12 00:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(712681, 74509, 8891, '<td valign="top">LOL....gay super hero love!  HA!   love it!....no where is the rust...LOL! LMFAO &amp; PIMP!    OK there is rust color...I''ll let it go...to funny....wow, Skeletor or whatever it is on top has a real contented look on his face.</td>', 'LOL....gay super hero love!  HA!   love it!....no where is the rust...LOL! LMFAO & PIMP!    OK there is rust color...I''ll let it go...to funny....wow, Skeletor or whatever it is on top has a real contented look on his face.', '2004-05-12 00:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(712683, 74399, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Definately rusted.  I like how you have all of him in the shot.  I like the background, and I think that the ''from above'' angle is alright too.  Focus and clarity are good, and I think that the lighting is what makes the shot.  I like how some areas are shadowed and some are brighter.  Overall a nice job.  congrats. ~Heather~</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Definately rusted.  I like how you have all of him in the shot.  I like the background, and I think that the ''from above'' angle is alright too.  Focus and clarity are good, and I think that the lighting is what makes the shot.  I like how some areas are shadowed and some are brighter.  Overall a nice job.  congrats. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(712684, 74415, 12252, '<td valign="top">What''s appealing is the colors of the shirt, the chain, and the arms, and even the stark contrast to the jeans. Background lighting is uneven left to right, but not distracting. Good shot. 7</td>', 'What''s appealing is the colors of the shirt, the chain, and the arms, and even the stark contrast to the jeans. Background lighting is uneven left to right, but not distracting. Good shot. 7', '2004-05-12 00:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(712685, 74548, 9232, '<td valign="top">Wish you chould have shot this from the other side so that the rusted pipe was more "unbroken" and the chain link could have still trailed off out of focus.  Good idea and good eye, though.</td>', 'Wish you chould have shot this from the other side so that the rusted pipe was more "unbroken" and the chain link could have still trailed off out of focus.  Good idea and good eye, though.', '2004-05-12 00:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(712689, 74368, 9232, '<td valign="top">Almost too active in the background but that "flaw" is overcome by the overwhelming presence that rust has in this shot.  It is simply central.</td>', 'Almost too active in the background but that "flaw" is overcome by the overwhelming presence that rust has in this shot.  It is simply central.', '2004-05-12 00:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(712690, 73544, 12252, '<td valign="top">Oh this is terrific! I wish the model wasn''t quite so washed out, because otherwise the picture is perfect. Marvelous job with the focus. I wonder what a blue eyed model would do to this idea. Doesn''t matter. Great job.</td>', 'Oh this is terrific! I wish the model wasn''t quite so washed out, because otherwise the picture is perfect. Marvelous job with the focus. I wonder what a blue eyed model would do to this idea. Doesn''t matter. Great job.', '2004-05-12 00:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(712693, 74416, 9232, '<td valign="top">Lighting looks a little flat.</td>', 'Lighting looks a little flat.', '2004-05-12 00:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(712694, 74104, 3080, '<td valign="top">an earring?  your background is uninteresting.  subject is alright.  I like how it''s framed by the walls of what ever it''s in.  I think it''s good that the background is blurred, but I don''t think that helped much.  first thought is that it''s too bright.  overexposed, I think is the word.  focus and clarity on your subject is good, and it is definately rusted.  ~Heather~</td>', 'an earring?  your background is uninteresting.  subject is alright.  I like how it''s framed by the walls of what ever it''s in.  I think it''s good that the background is blurred, but I don''t think that helped much.  first thought is that it''s too bright.  overexposed, I think is the word.  focus and clarity on your subject is good, and it is definately rusted.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(712695, 73343, 12252, '<td valign="top">What a story! I love this shot, makes me ask lots of questions about who lived here, what it was like, how the train got there, why it''s been abandoned, etc. Looks just a tad oversharpened in the tree behind it to me. Composition is great, lighting is good but I wish there was just a bit more light on the "front" of the train by the steps.</td>', 'What a story! I love this shot, makes me ask lots of questions about who lived here, what it was like, how the train got there, why it''s been abandoned, etc. Looks just a tad oversharpened in the tree behind it to me. Composition is great, lighting is good but I wish there was just a bit more light on the "front" of the train by the steps.', '2004-05-12 00:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(712699, 74403, 12252, '<td valign="top">I see no connection to the challenge. Fingers and toy are out of focus -- in fact, I didn''t realize there was a toy for quite some time. Not much to engage in this picture. 1</td>', 'I see no connection to the challenge. Fingers and toy are out of focus -- in fact, I didn''t realize there was a toy for quite some time. Not much to engage in this picture. 1', '2004-05-12 00:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(712700, 73226, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF for this shot.  Love the central theme of rust in this composition as well as the continuity you keep in the shot with most of the pieces extending out of the frame of view (notable exception in top right corner of the photo).  I wish you hadn''t captured the shadow in the lower left corner but overall this is a very strong photo.</td>', 'Great use of DOF for this shot.  Love the central theme of rust in this composition as well as the continuity you keep in the shot with most of the pieces extending out of the frame of view (notable exception in top right corner of the photo).  I wish you hadn''t captured the shadow in the lower left corner but overall this is a very strong photo.', '2004-05-12 00:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(712702, 74545, 20613, '<td valign="top">I love the vintage feel that I got when looking at this photo!  Amazing job.</td>', 'I love the vintage feel that I got when looking at this photo!  Amazing job.', '2004-05-12 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(712703, 74509, 12252, '<td valign="top">Not very interesting and doesn''t meet the challenge. 1</td>', 'Not very interesting and doesn''t meet the challenge. 1', '2004-05-12 00:23:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(712705, 73648, 7570, '<td valign="top">mech warrior''s grandfather! nice nice nice refreshing image amongst most of the other "rust" images in this challenge. nice job. 8</td>', 'mech warrior''s grandfather! nice nice nice refreshing image amongst most of the other "rust" images in this challenge. nice job. 8', '2004-05-12 00:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(712706, 73866, 20613, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, I was sick of viewing the chain pictures.  This is totally different, though!  This is truly an amazing photo.</td>', 'I have to admit, I was sick of viewing the chain pictures.  This is totally different, though!  This is truly an amazing photo.', '2004-05-12 00:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(712707, 73170, 12252, '<td valign="top">Fails to meet challenge unless I''m really missing something. On top of that, the image doesn''t hold much interest. 1</td>', 'Fails to meet challenge unless I''m really missing something. On top of that, the image doesn''t hold much interest. 1', '2004-05-12 00:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(712708, 74115, 20613, '<td valign="top">I love this.  The sheep is in perfect focus; it is such an amazing animal.  This is truly a beautiful photo.</td>', 'I love this.  The sheep is in perfect focus; it is such an amazing animal.  This is truly a beautiful photo.', '2004-05-12 00:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(712709, 73366, 12252, '<td valign="top">Huh? Can''t tell what this is, but it sure doesn''t appear to meet the challenge and it''s very hard to look at. 1</td>', 'Huh? Can''t tell what this is, but it sure doesn''t appear to meet the challenge and it''s very hard to look at. 1', '2004-05-12 00:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(712710, 73332, 3080, '<td valign="top">Finally, a blue sky.  lol.  seeing lots of white blown out skys this time around.  you definatley have a rusted subject, and that''s good.  definately good.  It''s a photo of a car, but I''m wondering if you could have gotten a more interesting look on it.  right now, it''s just a shot of a car.  could you have gone in and gotten a close up of some rust or taken the car at a different angle, focussing more on one smaller section rather than trying to get the entire car in the photo?  focus and clarity look alright, and nothing overly distracting in the background.  The part I find most interesting is the rusted visor on the passenger (unless it''s a foreign car) side.  It really stands out and is rusted.  could you have focussed in on that more?  ~Heather~</td>', 'Finally, a blue sky.  lol.  seeing lots of white blown out skys this time around.  you definatley have a rusted subject, and that''s good.  definately good.  It''s a photo of a car, but I''m wondering if you could have gotten a more interesting look on it.  right now, it''s just a shot of a car.  could you have gone in and gotten a close up of some rust or taken the car at a different angle, focussing more on one smaller section rather than trying to get the entire car in the photo?  focus and clarity look alright, and nothing overly distracting in the background.  The part I find most interesting is the rusted visor on the passenger (unless it''s a foreign car) side.  It really stands out and is rusted.  could you have focussed in on that more?  ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(712711, 73448, 20613, '<td valign="top">The sky looks absolutely amazing.  The subject is perfect.</td>', 'The sky looks absolutely amazing.  The subject is perfect.', '2004-05-12 00:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(712713, 73140, 12252, '<td valign="top">Kinda small, and no apparent relationship to the theme. Overexposed grass or gravel or ground or whatever it is. Sorry! 1</td>', 'Kinda small, and no apparent relationship to the theme. Overexposed grass or gravel or ground or whatever it is. Sorry! 1', '2004-05-12 00:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(712714, 73106, 20613, '<td valign="top">beautiful sky!  also, this photo meets the challenge very well.</td>', 'beautiful sky!  also, this photo meets the challenge very well.', '2004-05-12 00:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(712716, 74512, 12252, '<td valign="top">Huh? 1</td>', 'Huh? 1', '2004-05-12 00:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(712717, 74489, 20613, '<td valign="top">Great texture!  When I saw the first half of the photo, I didn''t know what this was.  The second half revealed an amazing picture.  Great job!</td>', 'Great texture!  When I saw the first half of the photo, I didn''t know what this was.  The second half revealed an amazing picture.  Great job!', '2004-05-12 00:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(712719, 74340, 12252, '<td valign="top">Whatever this is, it is WAY OOF, and doesn''t even appear to be rusty! There''s nothing to hold one''s interest in this image. Sorry, but it''s a 1 to me</td>', 'Whatever this is, it is WAY OOF, and doesn''t even appear to be rusty! There''s nothing to hold one''s interest in this image. Sorry, but it''s a 1 to me', '2004-05-12 00:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(712720, 73167, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, as the bug is not actually rusty, but he looks as if he is rusty.  I love how people interpret the challenges in different ways.  I really got tired of seeing the literal interpretations, and this freshened me up.</td>', 'This is a great idea, as the bug is not actually rusty, but he looks as if he is rusty.  I love how people interpret the challenges in different ways.  I really got tired of seeing the literal interpretations, and this freshened me up.', '2004-05-12 00:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(712721, 74512, 3080, '<td valign="top">Does copper get rusty or does it tarnish, are they the same thing?  oh well.  Anyway,  while this is funny, I don''t find it particularily interesting as a photograph.  We can''t see much detail in the pennies at all.  You cropped the bottom penny too close, and I''m not really sure of the point of the photo.  it could have been drawn better.  focus doesn''t even seem right on the pennies.  Funny, but not the best photo. ~Heather~</td>', 'Does copper get rusty or does it tarnish, are they the same thing?  oh well.  Anyway,  while this is funny, I don''t find it particularily interesting as a photograph.  We can''t see much detail in the pennies at all.  You cropped the bottom penny too close, and I''m not really sure of the point of the photo.  it could have been drawn better.  focus doesn''t even seem right on the pennies.  Funny, but not the best photo. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(712723, 73344, 12252, '<td valign="top">Not at all on challenge. Not at all terribly interesting, either. The lines are okay, but the blemishes on the concrete spoil the abstract nature of this off-challenge shot. 1</td>', 'Not at all on challenge. Not at all terribly interesting, either. The lines are okay, but the blemishes on the concrete spoil the abstract nature of this off-challenge shot. 1', '2004-05-12 00:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(712724, 73756, 12252, '<td valign="top">VERY VERY small. What is it? Can''t tell what I''m seeing here, and I don''t see a relationship to the challenge. 1</td>', 'VERY VERY small. What is it? Can''t tell what I''m seeing here, and I don''t see a relationship to the challenge. 1', '2004-05-12 00:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(712725, 73221, 12252, '<td valign="top">WAY too small. And this relates to Rusty, um, how? 1</td>', 'WAY too small. And this relates to Rusty, um, how? 1', '2004-05-12 00:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(712726, 74198, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like it!  Beautiful.  You have succeeded in making a rusty old subject interesting.  I think the background is perfect.  I like the way it goes from light to dar.  Your focus and clarity are right on, and lighting is wonderful as well.  Both focus and lighting help to bring out the details and textures here.  What else can I say?  Very nice. 10 ~Heather~</td>', 'I like it!  Beautiful.  You have succeeded in making a rusty old subject interesting.  I think the background is perfect.  I like the way it goes from light to dar.  Your focus and clarity are right on, and lighting is wonderful as well.  Both focus and lighting help to bring out the details and textures here.  What else can I say?  Very nice. 10 ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(712728, 74509, 7570, '<td valign="top">gross...lol</td>', 'gross...lol', '2004-05-12 00:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(712729, 74550, 12252, '<td valign="top">Way too small. I''m not sure what story you''re trying to tell here. I think you could work on a better perspective, make the picture bigger, chose a better background, maybe even a heavier chain. 2</td>', 'Way too small. I''m not sure what story you''re trying to tell here. I think you could work on a better perspective, make the picture bigger, chose a better background, maybe even a heavier chain. 2', '2004-05-12 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(712730, 73376, 3080, '<td valign="top">If I were to look at this photo alone, Rusted would be the last thing I would think of.  If you were taking a photo and entering it just for the sake of entering it to get comments, well, I guess that''s just fine.  Unfortunate that you will probably have to undergo a major hit to your average score.  As for the photo, your background contains a strong diagonal line that cuts right through your poor subjects head.  I''d have put that line somewhere else.  focus and clarity seem alright, and i like the froggy.  lighting is a bit harsh on his nose. ~Heather~</td>', 'If I were to look at this photo alone, Rusted would be the last thing I would think of.  If you were taking a photo and entering it just for the sake of entering it to get comments, well, I guess that''s just fine.  Unfortunate that you will probably have to undergo a major hit to your average score.  As for the photo, your background contains a strong diagonal line that cuts right through your poor subjects head.  I''d have put that line somewhere else.  focus and clarity seem alright, and i like the froggy.  lighting is a bit harsh on his nose. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(712731, 74209, 12252, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. I know what a Ruy Lopez is, I just don''t udnerstand this photograph. And what''s with the background on the right? What IS that blue thing on the chessboard? Sorry, doesn''t compute on my monitor... 2</td>', 'I don''t get it. I know what a Ruy Lopez is, I just don''t udnerstand this photograph. And what''s with the background on the right? What IS that blue thing on the chessboard? Sorry, doesn''t compute on my monitor... 2', '2004-05-12 00:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
