(712736, 73511, 12252, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get it. Is that a bike under the grass and weeds? Perhaps so, but hard to say. In any event, this picture isn''t conveying RUST to me ... it''s conveying grass and/or weeds. 2</td>', 'I just don''t get it. Is that a bike under the grass and weeds? Perhaps so, but hard to say. In any event, this picture isn''t conveying RUST to me ... it''s conveying grass and/or weeds. 2', '2004-05-12 00:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(712737, 73511, 3080, '<td valign="top">can barely tell what this is, let alone tell if it''s rusty.  I think I can see a wheel near the top of the photo that is a bit orange, assuming that''s the rust.  I wonder what this would have turned out like if you had focussed on that one wheel.  Maybe be a stronger match for the challenge.  Maybe wouldn''t be able to tell what it was, but we can barely do that now.  I would definatley prefer a tighter close up of that wheel.  otherwise, focus and clarity are alright, and lighting seems to have been on your side as well.  ~Heather~</td>', 'can barely tell what this is, let alone tell if it''s rusty.  I think I can see a wheel near the top of the photo that is a bit orange, assuming that''s the rust.  I wonder what this would have turned out like if you had focussed on that one wheel.  Maybe be a stronger match for the challenge.  Maybe wouldn''t be able to tell what it was, but we can barely do that now.  I would definatley prefer a tighter close up of that wheel.  otherwise, focus and clarity are alright, and lighting seems to have been on your side as well.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(712739, 74398, 12252, '<td valign="top">The rusty wreck would have been fine. Adding the beer ruined your image for me. NOt only are they not needed, but they appear too straight up and down and almost photoshoppy. I''m sure you put them there in real life, but why not have them broken, for instance? 2</td>', 'The rusty wreck would have been fine. Adding the beer ruined your image for me. NOt only are they not needed, but they appear too straight up and down and almost photoshoppy. I''m sure you put them there in real life, but why not have them broken, for instance? 2', '2004-05-12 00:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(712742, 74038, 3080, '<td valign="top">Pattern is interesting.  Definately fits the challenge, and focus and clarity are good, as is lighting.  the problem i''m having with the photo is that it''s not particularity interesting.  it isn''t drawing me in and holding me there.  While technically good, it lacks that wow. ~Heather~</td>', 'Pattern is interesting.  Definately fits the challenge, and focus and clarity are good, as is lighting.  the problem i''m having with the photo is that it''s not particularity interesting.  it isn''t drawing me in and holding me there.  While technically good, it lacks that wow. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(712746, 74486, 12252, '<td valign="top">There''s rust, but the image leaves me wanting something more. The focus is pretty off on some of the utensils, and the background is distracting and competes for the eye. The marshmallow is just rather gross. 2</td>', 'There''s rust, but the image leaves me wanting something more. The focus is pretty off on some of the utensils, and the background is distracting and competes for the eye. The marshmallow is just rather gross. 2', '2004-05-12 00:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(712751, 74314, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I think that I like the lighting.  it makes the photo what it is.  Not really sure if I identify the orangeness as rust though.  I assume that it is because you say that it is, but honestly it''s hard to tell if it''s rusted, or just colored to look rusted.  either way, I think that originalty is strong here.  focus and clarity are hard to judge, but look just fine to me.  I would call this abstract too.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I think that I like the lighting.  it makes the photo what it is.  Not really sure if I identify the orangeness as rust though.  I assume that it is because you say that it is, but honestly it''s hard to tell if it''s rusted, or just colored to look rusted.  either way, I think that originalty is strong here.  focus and clarity are hard to judge, but look just fine to me.  I would call this abstract too.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(712753, 74475, 12252, '<td valign="top">This had potential, but I don''t think you pulled it off. the sky isn''t helping, for one thing. Could you have shot even lower and elevated the can? The lighting is a bit off as well. I had to work hard to see the bullet holes in the can. Maybe stand the can up and superimpose in front of the mountain? Try it again  and explore other possibilities. 2</td>', 'This had potential, but I don''t think you pulled it off. the sky isn''t helping, for one thing. Could you have shot even lower and elevated the can? The lighting is a bit off as well. I had to work hard to see the bullet holes in the can. Maybe stand the can up and superimpose in front of the mountain? Try it again  and explore other possibilities. 2', '2004-05-12 00:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(712755, 73754, 12252, '<td valign="top">Why so small? Might have been a great image, but it''s impossible to tell at this size. Also you have the horizon running downhill to the right. 2</td>', 'Why so small? Might have been a great image, but it''s impossible to tell at this size. Also you have the horizon running downhill to the right. 2', '2004-05-12 00:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(712756, 74394, 3080, '<td valign="top">I would have liked the focus to be the oposite of what it is now for this challenge.  I would like the rusted subject to be in focus.  the background is interesting, and you could have it either in focus or not, I''d have to see it to tell which would be better.  You need to straighten up your horizon.  looks like the water is going to runn right off the left side of the photo.  give it a slight right rotation and then recrop.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I would have liked the focus to be the oposite of what it is now for this challenge.  I would like the rusted subject to be in focus.  the background is interesting, and you could have it either in focus or not, I''d have to see it to tell which would be better.  You need to straighten up your horizon.  looks like the water is going to runn right off the left side of the photo.  give it a slight right rotation and then recrop.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(712757, 74316, 12252, '<td valign="top">Not sure why the stuffed animal is included, ikt adds nothing to the image. OTOH, there''s not much compelling about the rest -- the lighting is flat and there is no clear subject. What does Kipi mean? Is that the name of the stuffed animal?</td>', 'Not sure why the stuffed animal is included, ikt adds nothing to the image. OTOH, there''s not much compelling about the rest -- the lighting is flat and there is no clear subject. What does Kipi mean? Is that the name of the stuffed animal?', '2004-05-12 00:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(712759, 74545, 3080, '<td valign="top">rusty car, rusty pump.  I like it.  I like that the rusts are 2 different colors.  focus and clarity are right on.  lighting is good for the most part.  I only see one shadow that is a bit distracting on the wheel.  would like to see that a bit brighter.  this is an interesting scene, and it''s rusty, I feel that you met the challenge very well here.  nice one. ~Heather~</td>', 'rusty car, rusty pump.  I like it.  I like that the rusts are 2 different colors.  focus and clarity are right on.  lighting is good for the most part.  I only see one shadow that is a bit distracting on the wheel.  would like to see that a bit brighter.  this is an interesting scene, and it''s rusty, I feel that you met the challenge very well here.  nice one. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(712760, 73335, 12252, '<td valign="top">Out of focus i think. Or something. The pliers (?) are hard to look at, and the background color is odd. Is that the rust? I think you had great intentions but it didn''t get carried off here. 2</td>', 'Out of focus i think. Or something. The pliers (?) are hard to look at, and the background color is odd. Is that the rust? I think you had great intentions but it didn''t get carried off here. 2', '2004-05-12 00:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(712763, 74544, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s rusty, but not particularily that interesting.  I feel like the image is strangely tilted.  Focus and clarity are ok, and lighting looks to have been on your side, but I''m just not drawn in and kept there.  ~Heather~</td>', 'It''s rusty, but not particularily that interesting.  I feel like the image is strangely tilted.  Focus and clarity are ok, and lighting looks to have been on your side, but I''m just not drawn in and kept there.  ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(712764, 73644, 12252, '<td valign="top">I can''t see a relationship to the challenge, and don''t quite understand the composition as well. Did you need the small jar and two candles? I dont'' think so. Also the line marking the corner in the wall is distracting. 2</td>', 'I can''t see a relationship to the challenge, and don''t quite understand the composition as well. Did you need the small jar and two candles? I dont'' think so. Also the line marking the corner in the wall is distracting. 2', '2004-05-12 00:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(712765, 73766, 3080, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit dull, but doesn''t look like you could do much about that.  Overall I think that this is an interesting image to look at.  Your focus and clarity are good, and the angle at which you decided to take the shot at is interesting as well.  Technically well done. ~Heather~</td>', 'The background is a bit dull, but doesn''t look like you could do much about that.  Overall I think that this is an interesting image to look at.  Your focus and clarity are good, and the angle at which you decided to take the shot at is interesting as well.  Technically well done. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(712769, 74511, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like how the rust runs down from the subject.  I like how the photo is divided by the vertical line, and you placed that line in a great place to balance out the photo.  I like how it''s not devided directly in half.  focus and clarity are really good, and lighting seems to have been really great as well.  Overall interesting to look at, definately rusted, and good for the challenge.  good find. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like how the rust runs down from the subject.  I like how the photo is divided by the vertical line, and you placed that line in a great place to balance out the photo.  I like how it''s not devided directly in half.  focus and clarity are really good, and lighting seems to have been really great as well.  Overall interesting to look at, definately rusted, and good for the challenge.  good find. ~Heather~', '2004-05-12 00:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(712770, 73976, 12252, '<td valign="top">Is that blue stuff rust? In any event the colors are kind of interesting but there doesn''t seem to be a main point of interest. My eyes keep wandering and not settling. Bit dark on the top right, as well. 2</td>', 'Is that blue stuff rust? In any event the colors are kind of interesting but there doesn''t seem to be a main point of interest. My eyes keep wandering and not settling. Bit dark on the top right, as well. 2', '2004-05-12 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
