(712902, 74479, 17175, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by KaDi:</b></div><hr/><i> Very bug-like!  The lighter blue in the background distracts from the whole.  Wish there were more contrast in the upper-left corner.  Still a neat subject--what is it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Some sort of outdoor iron display ''cabinet'' where you hang horseshoes or something, I guess. I wish there were a lot more of some stuff in the pic, but then again I was busting for a pee and didn''t want to fiddle-faddle with the camera''s settings to get only a marginally better shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by KaDi: Very bug-like!  The lighter blue in the background distracts from the whole.  Wish there were more contrast in the upper-left corner.  Still a neat subject--what is it?  Some sort of outdoor iron display ''cabinet'' where you hang horseshoes or something, I guess. I wish there were a lot more of some stuff in the pic, but then again I was busting for a pee and didn''t want to fiddle-faddle with the camera''s settings to get only a marginally better shot.', '2004-05-12 01:22:09.000000', NULL, 0),
