(713543, 73544, 14603, '<td valign="top">I thought I would see this amongst the ribbons.<br/>Great shot.<br/>My original comment during the challenge was very lengthy and so I decided to cut it..but it was based on the same comment as "Whagerbaumer" made about cutting the image off at the eyebrow..it definitely added impact to the image for me when I held my hand up to the screen and viewed the image without the hairline and ear.One of the pictures where a fifty/fifty compositional split works well.<br/>Great work though..well done</td>', 'I thought I would see this amongst the ribbons.Great shot.My original comment during the challenge was very lengthy and so I decided to cut it..but it was based on the same comment as "Whagerbaumer" made about cutting the image off at the eyebrow..it definitely added impact to the image for me when I held my hand up to the screen and viewed the image without the hairline and ear.One of the pictures where a fifty/fifty compositional split works well.Great work though..well done', '2004-05-12 07:21:20.000000', NULL, 0),
