(715269, 74488, 9581, '<td valign="top">This is a good macro shot to me...It  has a different kind of dof to it.<br/>Great focus and the way its centered is really what makes the subject stand out showing the shadows and light balancing out. There is just a touch too much though on top of nail, that distracts my eye. Didnt get to vote on this because there were so many, I did comment lots more this time, I think I am getting the hang of it. Hope this helps.<br/> <br/>Edited to say....this makes my 300 comment...:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-12 20:32:42.</i></td>', 'This is a good macro shot to me...It  has a different kind of dof to it.Great focus and the way its centered is really what makes the subject stand out showing the shadows and light balancing out. There is just a touch too much though on top of nail, that distracts my eye. Didnt get to vote on this because there were so many, I did comment lots more this time, I think I am getting the hang of it. Hope this helps. Edited to say....this makes my 300 comment...:)', '2004-05-12 21:28:09.000000', '2004-05-12 21:32:42.000000', 0),
