(717425, 74515, 20102, '<td valign="top">You could have cropped even tighter - I''d say right below the handle. The green leaves form an amazing frame. You can then have a choice of whether to focus on the can, or on the leaves, and nobody will complain. In this picture, everybody knew what your subject was (can) and commented on its focus. In a more tightly cropped pic, it wouldn''t matter as much anymore, since it wouldn''t be so big. Good job.</td>', 'You could have cropped even tighter - I''d say right below the handle. The green leaves form an amazing frame. You can then have a choice of whether to focus on the can, or on the leaves, and nobody will complain. In this picture, everybody knew what your subject was (can) and commented on its focus. In a more tightly cropped pic, it wouldn''t matter as much anymore, since it wouldn''t be so big. Good job.', '2004-05-13 22:00:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(717472, 74499, 19248, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments.  I see from the comments I may have fared better entering the blurry pics of her spinning on the merry go round.  Or the dark closeup of her on top of the slide.  I am learning a great deal.  Thanks again.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments.  I see from the comments I may have fared better entering the blurry pics of her spinning on the merry go round.  Or the dark closeup of her on top of the slide.  I am learning a great deal.  Thanks again.', '2004-05-13 22:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
