(750789, 74390, 7322, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this but it would have gotten at least a 6 or 7 from me. It shows a very good eye for seeing art in the mundane. The focus could be a little sharper in the rusty area, perhaps, but overall I think it really works. I think I''ll put it in my favorites because it so refreshing from most of what I saw in this challenge (I didn''t see everything which is why I didn''t vote on this).</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this but it would have gotten at least a 6 or 7 from me. It shows a very good eye for seeing art in the mundane. The focus could be a little sharper in the rusty area, perhaps, but overall I think it really works. I think I''ll put it in my favorites because it so refreshing from most of what I saw in this challenge (I didn''t see everything which is why I didn''t vote on this).', '2004-06-04 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 0),
