(1481881, 74401, 16488, '<td valign="top">Challenge victim.<br/> <br/>This is a very nice abstract!  I love the texture and detail of the rusty metal.  Why voters (in the majority) refuse to see the value of such an image is beyond me.  I received similar comments about not seeing "what it is" in "Rusted" and continue to receive them in the current "Metal" challenge.  I wish I could tell them all to relax and just enjoy what they''re presented with...it doesn''t have to "mean" anything!</td>', 'Challenge victim. This is a very nice abstract!  I love the texture and detail of the rusty metal.  Why voters (in the majority) refuse to see the value of such an image is beyond me.  I received similar comments about not seeing "what it is" in "Rusted" and continue to receive them in the current "Metal" challenge.  I wish I could tell them all to relax and just enjoy what they''re presented with...it doesn''t have to "mean" anything!', '2005-06-24 19:13:09.000000', NULL, 0),
